<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Engungwel</book>
  <para style="h">LUK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékel Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi ékel</para>
  <para style="mt1">Luk</para>
  <para style="imt">Obɛɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan</para>
  <para style="ip">Ɔ̃nkaan wa Nsia yi Ngesɛ wu ye wu Ɛ̃sal mi atam ɛ̃li kɛn ɔ̃nkaan ngɔmɔ̃ wu am'ebaal bviial: Ki ɛ̃kwel, ɔ̃nkaan wu, ki bviaal, Ɛ̃sal mi atam. Wu áswɛn myɛ̃ Luk. Ye k'ekel ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu, ndɛ ábwɛɛl ngesɛ otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ m'ã́bwel ola baal b'ámwɛn k'ébwel mɔ̃ fa obɛɛn, kwɛn wu atsiɔ mɔ̃ ayɛɛ otaa-taa b'ãtee m'eyoo ndɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1:1-4">1.1-4</ref></char>). Luk áyuɔɔl ɛ̃nkaan omyɛ̃ ɛ̃nge-mviaal ola mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuun Tehofil, wɛn baal k'ayɛɛ ndɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ wɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Me b'otal Luk ndyam, eli y'ɛ̃nkaan mikyɛ mi esuo kwɛn ndɛ oli ɔ̃boo wu ɔ̃kiri wa Ngelek. Ndɛ áli ndoo a Pool wu ɔ̃sal, wu áyesuul ndɛ tiil bviil li Lome (<char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4.14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Flm 24</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2Ti 4.11</ref></char>). Luk onge wu áswɛn ɔ̃nkaan wu ke bviil olɔ, sua mvel wu ãku-ãsɛɛn ye yuaal (62) ye wu ãku-ãsɛɛn y'ataan (65). Luk wɛn k'Ɔ̃yuda wɛ, okel ola bɛn k'Ayuda wɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Luk emfa ngemɔ̃ onge Matie, abɛɛn ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ m'ãndɔɔ m'ãtal oburu b'emwã b'aburu Yeso (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 1-2">1–2</ref></char>). Ãnzwel ãlieel ɛ̃mbuaal-anyam ndiri: «Nonɔ̃ ŋã, onse bviil e David, aburu byɛ Ɔ̃mvuul» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 2:11">2.11</ref></char>). Yeso, ŋ'ebɛɛn ndɛ ɔ̃sal ke bviil li Nadzalɛt, ŋ'asuo kwɛn asi m'élieel Edzayi wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ndiri Ɔ̃mvuul kieel aya (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:13">Luk 4.13</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Akoo k'akab ɔ̃nkaan wu m'ebaal etyel bvi ela.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebaal ki ɛ̃kwel eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ɔ̃sal wu ési Yeso k'etswi e nsie ki Ngalile. Onse ebaal okyɛ, Luk asuo kal-a-kal ɔ̃sal wu eyi Yeso osa onse ɔ̃kiri me nkuul oboo b'ãluu ã baal y'obvuul b'ɛ̃fel ɛ̃ bɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 4:14-9:50">4.14–9.50</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebaal ki bviaal eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a nkuul yi nda yi ewel Yeso tiil Yelusalem. Okɔ, mboo yi eyemwɛn ndɛ fool me ndɔɔ yi abvuul baal. Ke ngwel wɛ, «Muaan a mbuul oyebii bvool oyebvuul b'ádziɔɔn.» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">19.10</ref></char>). Obɔ otsɛn bɛn ndɛ aketee bvool atsɛɛl baal ndɔɔ yi etal onɔɔn o ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi abvuul (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 9:51-19:27">9.51–19.27</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebaal ki etyel esuo kwɛn baal abɔɔ obvuul obɔ me nkuul a epfu e Yeso m'enkulusu ke Yelusalem. Kyɛ bvool esuo kwɛn ke mbee epfu e ndɛ, ndɛ osiool ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ oli Mfam bvool oli Ɔ̃mvuul a baal. Osiool o Yeso onse b'ákwi-ákwi oli ndɔɔ yi nkiin onse ãndɔɔ mbueel m'éyoo Luk ol'amwɛn. Ŋ'esiool ndɛ, ndɛ osuo nzuru ol'akaal, ol'ayio bvool ol'antam b'ákelel me ndɔɔ a epfu e ndɛ. Ndɛ otsɛɛl bɔ ãndɔɔ m'áyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã wueel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 19:28-24:53">19.28–24.53</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Otsɛn b'ɔ̃nkaan a Luk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1-2" />Mfam Tehofil, baal bibi amwɛn ãndɔɔ m'esi Nziã ola bee k'obɛɛn o mɔ̃. Obobɔ, bɔ atsal nsia a ndɛ, bvool ayɛɛn bee ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mam mbueel. Baal bibi onse bee bu abvi mɔ̃ okel. <verse eid="LUK 1:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ mfuul baal obɔ nsia a ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ngesɛ-ngesɛ, m'emfa ki ébwel mɔ̃ fa obɛɛn. Obobɔ, mfam Tehofil, mɛ̃ mwɛn kwɛn eli ngesɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ nkel yɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ nzyal-nzyal. <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Mɛ̃ nkel mɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn yɛ yɛɛ kwɛn ãndɔɔ m'éyoo yɛ omɔ̃, ãli mam mã taa-taa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãnzwel ãwi nsia yi àburu Dzaã Batis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Me lio li éli Elode ɔ̃kwɛn a etswi e nsie ki Yude, éli ye ngaa-a-Nziã ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Dzakali, ngɔmɔ̃ onse ɔ̃luo wu angaa-a-Nziã wu Abia. Nkuũ a ɔ̃kal a ndɛ éli Elidzabet, wa yam li angaa-a-Nziã li Alona. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Dzakali y'Elidzabet áli dzu ke mviil ã Nziã, bɔ ákekiaal ãngel ã ndɛ mam mbueel m'emfa ki ekoo, bvool ákesa mam mbueel m'etam ndɛ wu Mfam Nziã baal osa. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Kɛn a bɔ k'áli ye muaan wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn Elidzabet áli empi. Bɔ ange-buaal hɛ̃ al'ayii ekukwel e baal.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Dzakali ákesa ɔ̃sal a ndɛ ke nkwel a Nziã, nzal-a-ŋɛn, tsoo olɔ éli ɔ̃nkaal wa nkel yi ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ol'angaa-a-Nziã, ákesuaal mbuul ngɔmɔ̃, kwɛn ndɛ asam onse etswi e Nzɔ a Nziã ki ɔ̃nsensal. Bɔ áketa ebie m'osuaal o ndɛ. Me tsoo olɔ, bɔ ásueel Dzakali, kwɛn ndɛ ayewa Mfam Nziã ãkab m'ãnasi. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Me lio li ákewa ãkab m'ãnasi olɔ, baal bueel ákebuɛɛn ke nkwel-a-nzi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">B'ákesam onse ongoo o nzɔ a Nziã éli kɛn a angaa-a-Nziã. Baal b'asiil ákesɛn kɛn onse ekɔɔ.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, ãnzwel ã Mfam Nziã ãpal ola Dzakali, me kuɔɔl ki elam ki misa wu awa ãkab m'ãnasi. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Ŋ'emwɛn Dzakali mɔ̃, esi ndɛ ongɛɛ, buɔ bo kokɔ obɔɔ ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Kɛn ãnzwel ãlieel ndɛ bubu: «Dzakali, bee buɔ oyoo, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã okiool ãbuɛɛn ã yɛ: Ɔ̃kal a yɛ Elidzabet akieel aburu yɛ muaan wu bɔɔl, wu ekieel eta yɛ me Dzaã. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Yɛ akieel akal y'esɛ y'osia mpaa me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, baal bibi hɛ̃ akieel asia mpaa, me ndɔɔ oburu o ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Ndɛ akieel akal mbuul wu ɔ̃nɛn ke mviil ã Mfam Nziã. Ndɛ kieel k'anywã mbal ã bvine wuo mbal ã mpuru ãkyam wɛ. Ndɛ akieel aluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal fa mwiĩ a ngoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ndɛ akieel asa kwɛn baan b'Isalayel bibi abvool ola Mfam Nziã wu Nziã a bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ndɛ akieel atsɔɔn nkwel a Mfam Nziã, ye mpɛn yi ɔ̃fel yɛn onge yi éli y'Eli wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. Obobɔ, ndɛ akieel asa kwɛn dzii ebvool mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ atal ye baan a bɔ. Ndɛ hɛ̃ akieel aswɛɛl ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ baal bɛn k'alweel Nziã wɛ, kwɛn bɔ abɛɛn otsam onge baal ba dzu. M'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ akieel asa kwɛn baal awal ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ oya o Mfam Nziã.»<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Kɛn a Dzakali ofuul ãnzwel bubu: «Mɛ̃ ekieel eyɛɛ kwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãli taa-taa bwɛn a bwɛn? Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ bam emeeyal, ɔ̃kal a mɛ̃ ndyam hɛ̃ amaayal, kwɛn ndɛ aburu muaan.» <verse eid="LUK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Ãnzwel bu ãbveel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi Gabiliyel, mɛ̃ wu ebetɛɛn ke nkwel a Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi esa ɔ̃sal a ndɛ. Ndɛ wu Nziã wu otam mɛ̃ ola yɛ, kwɛn mɛ̃ ye ngyɛɛn ye yɛ, bvool mbiri yɛ nsia yi ngesɛ yi. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Onge bɛn yɛ ke kiool ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ wɛ, yɛ àkɔɔl nkɛn: Yɛ bvool k'àbekoo k'ayɛɛn wɛ, tiil tsoo li èbwel ãndɔɔ me ngyɛɛn mɛ̃ yɛ. Taa-taa bam, Nziã àsa ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ me lio li ewɛɛ ndɛ osa.»<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, baal ákekiaal Dzakali. Bɔ ákekam m'oyiil b'éyiil ndɛ onse Nzɔ a Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Ŋ'epal ndɛ, ndɛ bvool k'abekoo k'ayɛɛn ye baal wɛ, bɔ bu abvi otsam kwɛn ndɛ oŋɔ̃ emwɛn abɔɔ onse Nzɔ a Nziã. Kɛn a ndɛ oyii nkɛn, bu ayii ayɛɛn ye baal m'ɛ̃liɛɛn.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ŋ'eman Dzakali ɔ̃nkaal wa ndɛ wu ɔ̃sal, ndɛ oyɛn nzɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃kal a ndɛ Elidzabet obvi yam, ndɛ bu abvi okal m'edziɔɔn nswii taan. Ndɛ wu Elidzabet oyɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam bubu: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />«Tal ndɔɔ yi esi Mfam Nziã me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃: Mɛ̃ éli y'opfuru ke nkwel a baal a yam e mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ k'éli ye muaan wɛ. Ndɛ otal mɛ̃, bu ambaal mɛ̃ opfuru.»<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãnzwel ãwi nsia yi àburu Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Ŋ'ebɔɔ yam li Elidzabet nswii sɛɛn, Nziã oyuɔɔl ãnzwel mɛn nkuũ Gabiliyel ke bviil li Nadzalet, li eli k'etswi e nsie ki Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Ndɛ oyuɔɔl ãnzwel omɔ̃ ola nsam a ɔ̃kaal yi ata me Mali. Ndɛ wu Mali áli ɔ̃kal wu ésɔɔn bɔɔl li ata me Dzedzef me ndɔɔ obaal o ndɛ. Dzedzef áli mbuul wa yam li ɔ̃kwɛn David. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Ãnzwel ãsam onse nzɔ a Mali, bvool ãlieel ndɛ bubu: «Sia mpaa! Ke ngwel wɛ, Mfam Nziã osuo yɛ nyiĩ a ndɛ yi enɛn, ndɛ oli ye yɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Mali ebangɛɛ ebɔɔ ndɛ, bu ayɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: «Otsɛn b'ãyɛɛn mã omã?» <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ãnzwel bu ãbveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mali, bee buɔ oyoo, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã ŋ'asuo yɛ nyiĩ a ndɛ yi enɛn. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Tal, yɛ àbva yam, yɛ àburu muaan wu bɔɔl wu èloo yɛ me Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ndɛ àkal mbuul wu ɔ̃nɛn. Àta ndɛ me Muaan a Nziã-a-Mpuu. Mfam Nziã àwa ndɛ okwɛn o David wu nkiɔɔn<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkiɔɔn ŋã ke wu oburu ngoo wuo tal a ndɛ wɛ, nkiɔɔn wa lela.</char></note> a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ndɛ àkal ɔ̃kwɛn ɔ̃bu nkal yam li Isalayel, okwɛn o ndɛ k'òfa wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Obobɔ, Mali olieel ãnzwel ndiri: «Ke-bwɛn-ndoo, ndɔɔ yi obobɔ bwɛn-a-bwɛn eyebɛɛn, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ abɔɔl wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Ãnzwel ãbveel ndɛ bubu: «Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal àsool nkal a yɛ, mpɛn a Nziã-a-Mpuu èfoo yɛ. Obɔ otsɛn bɛn muaan wu ɔ̃nsensal wu èburu yɛ, àta ndɛ me Muaan a Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Tal, Elidzabet wu eburu e yɛ oli hɛ̃ ye yam, ndɛ akieel aburu muaan wu bɔɔl, onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ oyii ekukwel. Ndɛ wu áketa m'empi, meba bu ayii ye yam li nswii sɛɛn obɔ. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Ke ngwel wɛ, k'eli ye ndɔɔ yi ekwɛɛn Nziã osa wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Obobɔ, Mali obveel ãnzwel bubu: «Mɛ̃ ndi ɔ̃sal a Mfam. Yɔɔl kwɛn Nziã asa mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'eyɛɛn yɛ.» Ãnzwel bu ãyɛn.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mali oyetal Elidzabet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ke kwɛ, Mali otwel nkuul, bu ayɛn tswa-a-tswa k'ola ngɔmɔ̃ bo k'ãnkio mã Yude. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ okɔ, ndɛ osam onse nzɔ a Dzakali, bu abio Elidzabet. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ɔ̃bio a Mali, muaan wu oli onse mwiĩ a ndɛ wu Elidzabet osiɔ nzuru. Obobɔ, Elidzabet oluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ndɛ bu ayɛɛn kokɔ bubu: «Yɛ nduru akaal bam bueel m'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl, muaan wu oli onse mwiĩ a yɛ hɛ̃ oli y'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Li dzuun li bwɛn-a-bwɛn li eyi ngoo a Mfam ola mɛ̃! <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Tal, me lio li ngyoo mɛ̃ ɔ̃bio a yɛ, muaan wu oli onse mwiĩ a mɛ̃ oluul m'esɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Yɛ li ɔ̃kaal wu esɛ, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ kiool kwɛn Mfam Nziã asa m'elieel ndɛ yɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mali oyam nziĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mali bu ayɛɛn ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:46">«Taa-taa bam Mfam Nziã oli wu ɔ̃nɛn! Mɛ̃ eyam me ndɔɔ yi elweel ndɛ!<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Mɛ̃ nduul m'esɛ, me ndɔɔ a Nziã,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:47">ndɛ wu Ɔ̃mvuul a mɛ̃.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ okaal mviil nkal a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃sal a ndɛ wɛn otsɛn pyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:48">Akieel ata mɛ̃ m'ɔ̃kaal wu esɛ, ãlio mbueel,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />ke ngwel wɛ, Nziã-Ngaa-Waan osi mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ m'ãnɛn.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:49">Nkuũ a ndɛ eli nkuũ yi ɔ̃nsensal.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Nyiĩ a ndɛ eli ãlio mbueel</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:50">nkal a baal b'alweel ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ndɛ osi ãndɔɔ ye waan li kokɔ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:51">bu atsal baal bɛn ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃li ye nzal-a-nsia.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Ndɛ okweel baal b'anɛn k'ãmpu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:52">owi baal bɛn otsɛn pyɛ dzuun.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Ndɛ owi eluɔ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ ol'akaan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">ndɛ otswɛɛl apfel ayɛn ãkɛɛ-ãkɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54-55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54-55" />Ndɛ owueel a yam li Isalayel, wu ɔ̃sal a ndɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Ndɛ k'ayɔɔl k'asuo bɔ nyiĩ a ndɛ ãlio mbueel wɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54-55">onge b'élieel ndɛ bɔ b'ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:54-55">Abalayam, ye yam e ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:54-55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Mali okal y'Elidzabet nku-a-nku a nswii tyel, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ obvool ola.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aburu Dzaã Batis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ŋ'ekoo lio li eburu Elidzabet, ndɛ oburu muaan wu bɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Ŋ'eyoo baal b'akal tsotsoo a ndɛ y'eburu e ndɛ kwɛn Mfam Nziã osio Elidzabet nyiĩ, bɔ asia mpal ye ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Ke mbee ãtsoo mpuɔ̃ m'aburu ndɛ, bɔ ayi muaan otsiil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.59 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ol'Ayuda, otsiil o muaan éli eliĩ ki esuo kwɛn muaan ondɛ oli wa yam li eli m'ondoo ye Mfam Nziã. Tal </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:9-14">Obɛ 17.9-14</ref>.</char></note>, bɔ ákedzii k'awa ndɛ nkuũ a tal a ndɛ, Dzakali, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />kɛn a ngoo a muaan oyɛɛn ndiri: «Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, nkuũ a ndɛ èkal Dzaã.» <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Kɛn a bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Onse yam e yɛ, k'eli ye mbuul wu oli ye nkuũ oyɔ wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Bɔ bu ayii ayɛɛn ye tal a ndɛ m'ɛ̃liɛɛn, me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛ nkuũ yi edzii k'eta ndɛ muaan. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Dzakali bu asɔɔ muaan-ebɛɛ kwɛn ndɛ akel ke ywel a lɔ. Ndɛ okel ndiri: «Nkuũ a ndɛ eli Dzaã.» Bɔ bueel bu akam. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Kɛn a me lio olɔ, Dzakali bvool okoo k'ayɛɛn. Ndɛ bu abvi Nziã olweel. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Ndɔɔ oyɔ esi baal bam bueel b'ákekal tsotsoo oŋɔ̃ ongɛɛ. Onse etswi e nsie ki ãnkio ki Yude, eyii oyɛɛn onkyam pyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Baal bam bueel b'ayoo ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ akwee mɔ̃ onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, bvool abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam bubu: «Ondɛ muaan kieel bwɛn-a-bwɛn akal?» Taa-taa bam mpɛn a Nziã éli ye muaan ondɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dzakali oyam nziĩ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Dzakali wu tal a muaan oluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, bu abvi ãndɔɔ oyɛɛn m'ãfi ola Nziã, bubu:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />«Elweel Mfam Nziã, Nziã a Isalayel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:68">ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ owueel a yam e ndɛ, bvool opaal lɔ onse onkyal.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Ndɛ opaal bia-byɛ Ɔ̃mvuul wa mpɛn,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:69">onse yam e David wu ɔ̃sal a ndɛ,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />onge b'éyɛɛn ndɛ tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn m'ɛ̃nywã mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a ndɛ ba ngel ndiri,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />ndɛ akieel abvuul bia-byɛ me mviɔɔl mi ataal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:71">ye mi baal bam bueel b'abyal bia-byɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Ndɛ hɛ̃ álieel ndiri ndɛ akieel asuo nyiĩ a ndɛ ol'ankiɔɔn a bia-byɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:72">bvool asa ãndɔɔ m'élieel ndɛ onse ondoo bo ngel b'étɛn ndɛ ye bɔ.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Ondɛ ɔ̃kyel wu élab ndɛ Abalayam wu nkiɔɔn a bia-byɛ. Taa-taa bam, Nziã álieel ndɛ me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ ndiri,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ndɛ akieel abvuul bia-byɛ me mviɔɔl mi ataal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:74">kwɛn bia-byɛ ebee ye buɔ okal b'esal me ndɔɔ a ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />M'emfa okyɛ, bia-byɛ èkal baal b'awa Nziã esɛ, bvool b'ali dzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:75">ãtsoo mbueel ke nkwel a ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Dzakali bvool oyɛɛn bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">«Me b'otal yɛ, yɛ wu muaan wu ɔ̃bwee, akieel ata yɛ m'ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã-a-Mpuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:76">ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ akieel adzuu ke nkwel a Mfam Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi afaal ãnkuul ã ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Yɛ akieel ayɛɛn yam e ndɛ bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:77">“Nziã àbvuul byɛ me nkuul yi odzeel b'ãbi ã byɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Taa-taa bam, Nziã a bia-byɛ oluul me nyiĩ y'obvɛ me ndɔɔ a bia-byɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:78">Ndɛ àyuɔɔl bia-byɛ Ɔ̃mvuul<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.78 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">M'ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek, Ɔ̃mvuul wu, ati ndɛ me tal.</char></note> wu afa ywel, wu oli onge tal li epal.<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />Ndɛ àsuo Nziã ola baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ ndɛ wɛ, ye baal b'ali ye buɔ b'epfu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:79">bvool asa kwɛn bia-byɛ ekal onse opi.»<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, muaan ákeyal, bvool ákewam me mpɛn a Ɔ̃fel. Ndɛ ákekal onse ɔ̃baan tiil tsoo li épal ndɛ ke nkwel a baal b'Isalayel.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Emfa ki aburu Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Me lio olɔ, Oguste<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sedzaal Oguste áli ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃kiri wa Lom. Me lio olɔ, ɛ̃kiri myam mvieel ɛ̃li ke nsɛn a Lom.</char></note> wu ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn, otam baal a ndɛ ɔ̃tsiɔ a baal bam bueel ba nsie a ndɛ osa. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Oyɔ nsa yi ɛ̃kwel yi asa ɔ̃tsiɔ wu obobɔ. Me lio olɔ, Kilinus áli mfam wu ɔ̃kiri wa Sili. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Baal bueel bu ayesa ɔ̃tsiɔ, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul onse bviil li áburu ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Dzedzef hɛ̃ ombal bviil li Nadzalet li ke nsie yi Ngalile, oyɛn bviil li David li Betelem, li ke Yude. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ wu Dzedzef áli mbuul wa yam li David. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ndɛ oyɛn bviil olɔ, me ndɔɔ yi ayesa ɔ̃tsiɔ okɔ, ye Mali, wu muaan-ɔ̃kaal wu ésɔɔn ndɛ me ndɔɔ yi abaal, wu áli hɛ̃ ye yam. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Me tal li éli bɔ m'ɔ̃lɔɔ ke Betelem, lio e Mali li oburu ekoo. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Ndɛ bu aburu muaan wu bɔɔl wu otab ɔ̃la a ndɛ. Ndɛ odzii ndɛ onse ekɔ, bvool olaal ndɛ onse mboo yi alɔ bvi-odza bvi anyam, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ k'abɔɔ mboo yi akal onse ngwel-a-nzɔ a anzii wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãnzwel ãpal ol'ɛ̃mbuaal-anyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Onse ãnguun mã tsotsoo a Betelem, éli y'ɛ̃mbuaal-anyam. Bɔ ákewal ɛ̃nsiil, m'okiaal b'anyam a bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Ãnzwel ã Mfam Nziã ngãmɔ̃ ãpal ola bɔ, mbaa a ndɛ wu Mfam Nziã eyɛɛl mboo yi éli bɔ, buɔ bo bibi obɔɔ bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Kɛn Ãnzwel ãlieel bɔ ndiri: «Ebee buɔ oyoo, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ngyi yengwa byɛ nsia yi ngesɛ, yi esa kwɛn baal bueel aluul m'esɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Nsia yi Ngesɛ oyɔ eli yi: Nonɔ̃ ŋã, onse bviil e David, aburu byɛ Ɔ̃mvuul. Ndɛ oli Mãsia, bvool oli Mfam. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Etal emfa ki èyɛɛ byɛ ndɛ: byɛ èmwɛn muaan wu ɔ̃bwee wu adzii onse ekɔ, bvool wu alaal onse mboo yi alɔ bvi-odza bvi anyam.»<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, ãnzwel bibi ãfi ywel, ãbvɔɔn y'ãnzwel m'ɛ̃kwel, mɔ̃ bu ãbvi Nziã olweel ndiri:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />«Bia-byɛ elweel Nziã wa ke ywel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:14">bvool eyɔɔl kwɛn opi okal me nsie, onse baal b'edzii ndɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛ̃mbuaal-anyam ayɛn Betelem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl ãnzwel ywel, ɛ̃mbuaal-anyam ayɛɛn bam-a-bam bubu: «Eyi tiil Betelem, me ndɔɔ yi etal ndɔɔ yi ɛ̃kam yi ebwel, yi elieel Mfam Nziã bia-byɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Bɔ ayɛn Betelem tswa-a-tswa. Ŋ'etɔ bɔ okɔ, bɔ ayebɔɔ Mali ye Dzedzef, ye muaan wu ɔ̃bwee bɔ onse mboo yi alɔ bvi-odza bvi anyam. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Ŋ'emwɛn bɔ ndɛ, bɔ alieel ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'elieel ãnzwel bɔ me ndɔɔ a muaan ondɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Baal bam bueel b'ayoo m'elieel ɛ̃mbuaal-anyam, akam me ndɔɔ ãyɛɛn ã bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Me b'otal Mali, ndɛ ákekwɛɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ngesɛ onse ɔ̃kwal, bvool áketsam me ndɔɔ a mɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ɛ̃mbuaal-anyam ɛ̃kɔɔl. Bɔ abvi oyam y'olweel o Nziã, me nkuul a nkuul, me ndɔɔ a m'emwɛn bɔ ye m'eyoo bɔ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ãndɔɔ ã́bwel kɛn a m'emfa ki éyɛɛn ãnzwel.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaal Yeso ke Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ke mbee ãtsoo mpuɔ̃, atsiil muaan, bu awi ndɛ nkuũ yi Yeso. Nkuũ oyɔ yi élieel ãnzwel Mali ye k'ebva ndɛ yam.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, tsoo li embaal Mali ye Dzedzef mbiin m'emfa ki eyɛɛn ãngel ã Moyize, ekoo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔ̃kiri wu ombaal o mbiin ol'Ayuda, ákesa ndɛ ke mbee a ŋ'eburu ɔ̃kaal. Etal </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 12:1-8">Lev 12.1-8</ref></char>.</note>. Obobɔ, bɔ abiri muaan Yelusalem, me ndɔɔ yi asuo ndɛ ola Mfam Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Mfam Nziã ndiri: «Muaan wu bɔɔl ndyam wueel wu otab ɔ̃la a ngoo, ebvaan akal wa ngel me ndɔɔ a Mfam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Me b'otal opaal o muaan ke nkwel a Mfam, etal onse </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Opa 13.2</ref></char>.</note>.» <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Mali ye Dzedzef awi hɛ̃ kab, m'emfa ki etam ngel a Mfam Nziã osa: «Ãkuun mbuaal, wuo anywɛn akyam buaal b'emfa onge mɔ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simehɔ̃ olieel ãndɔɔ m'ãfi ola Nziã me ndɔɔ a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ke Yelusalem, éli ye bɔɔl ngemɔ̃ lɛn nkuũ Simehɔ̃. Bɔɔl olɔ éli dzu, bvool ékelweel Nziã. Lɔ ékekiaal kwɛn Nziã ayuɔɔl mbuul wu abvuul baal b'Isalayel. Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal áli nkal a ndɛ wu Simehɔ̃, <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />bvool álieel ndɛ ndiri ndɛ k'akoo m'okwa wɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ k'amwɛn Mãsia wu éyɛɛn Mfam ndiri ayuɔɔl Isalayel wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Obobɔ, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal obiri ndɛ ke Nzɔ a Nziã. Kɛn a me lio olɔ, tal ye ngoo a Yeso abiri muaan, me ndɔɔ yi asa m'etam ãngel osa me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wu muaan. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Simehɔ̃ owel muaan onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, ndiri:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />«Mfam! Meba ŋã, yɔɔl kwɛn mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃sal a yɛ nkwa onse opi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:29">onge b'eyɛɛn yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mviil ã mɛ̃ ãmwɛn Ɔ̃mvuul wu eyuɔɔl yɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Yɛ afaal ndɛ kwɛn baal bueel amwɛn ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ndɛ àkal onge mwiĩ wu asa kwɛn ɛ̃kiri mvieel ɛ̃yɛɛ yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 2:32">ndɛ hɛ̃ àkal ndɔɔ yi esa kwɛn baal awa Isalayel dzuun.»<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Tal a Yeso ye ngoo a ndɛ akam me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ m'eyɛɛn Simehɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Simehɔ̃ ondɔɔl bɔ kuɔɔl, bvool olieel Mali wu ngoo a Yeso bubu: «Nziã osueel muaan wu, me ndɔɔ yi abal baal bibi k'Isalayel, bvool aseel bakyɛ. Ndɛ àkal eliĩ ki efa ola ndɛ wu Nziã, kɛn a baal bibi àtiɔ ndɛ eboo. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Obobɔ, ndɛ àsuo ãtsam m'ãdziɔɔn onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ baal bibi. Yɛ wu Mali, fool ètab yɛ ɔ̃kwal onge b'etab epwel mbuul.»<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãnã olieel ãndɔɔ m'ãfi ola Nziã me ndɔɔ a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Oŋɔ̃ hɛ̃ éli y'ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Ãnã. Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ áli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. Ndɛ áli muaan a Fanwel, wa yam li Asɛɛl. Ndɛ ale yii ekukwel ki ɔ̃kaal. Ndɛ ákal y'ɔ̃lam wu ábaal ndɛ fa obwee, kɛn a mvel nsiaan. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Ɔ̃lam a ndɛ okwi. Ndɛ bu asiil ndyam sii, tiil ŋ'eyii ndɛ me mvel ɛ̃kuun-mpuɔ̃ ye nã (84). Ndɛ k'ákeywɛn ke Nzɔ a Nziã wɛ, ndɛ áli oŋɔ̃ tsia mwiĩ, ákesa ɔ̃sal a Nziã onse ãbuɛɛn mɛn k'adza wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Ndɛ otɔ oŋɔ̃ kɛn a me lio li ékeyɛɛn Simehɔ̃ ye Dzedzef bwɛn a Mali. Ndɛ obvi Nziã olweel me ndɔɔ a Yeso, bvool olieel ãndɔɔ m'ãtal ndɛ wu Yeso, ola baal b'ákekiaal kwɛn Nziã abvuul Yelusalem.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso okwel ke Nadzalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Ke mbee a ŋ'esi Dzedzef ye Mali ãndɔɔ mbueel m'etam ãngel osa, bɔ akɔɔl Ngalile, ke bviil e bɔ li Nadzalet. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, muaan ákeyal, bvool ákewam. Ndɛ ákeluul m'ãkaã, nyiĩ a Nziã éli ye ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso me mvel kuun ye yuaal onse Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Mvel bwɛn a mvel, ngoo a Yeso ye tal a ndɛ ákeyi Yelusalem, me ndɔɔ a pfuun li Onduru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pfuun li Ɔ̃nduru eli pfuun li ékesa Ayuda, me ndɔɔ yi atsam opaal b'épaal Nziã baan b'Isalayel m'onkyal k'Edzipito. Nkuũ yi Onduru oyɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ãnzwel m'ã́kebam baal k'Edzipito ãnkeduru ãnzɔ ã baan b'Isalayel, bvool k'ãkebam baan a bɔ b'ɛ̃kwel wɛ. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 12">Opa 12</ref></char>.</note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Ŋ'ekoo Yeso mvel kuun ye yuaal, bɔ ayɛn okɔ ye ndɛ, onge b'abesa me tsoo e pfuun. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Ke mbee a pfuun, bɔ abvool ola, kɛn a Yeso osiil ke Yelusalem, ngoo ye tal yi ayɛɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Bɔ áketsam ndiri ndɛ áli ye baal bakyɛ b'áli ye bɔ. Bɔ bu abvi ndɛ obii ol'eburu e bɔ y'anga-ndoo a bɔ, ke mbee a ŋ'esi bɔ tsoo ɔ̃tsiin me nkuul. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Onge bɛn bɔ k'amwɛn ndɛ wɛ, bɔ akɔɔl Yelusalem ke ndɛ obii.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ãtyel, bɔ ayebɔɔ ndɛ me nsɛn onse Nzɔ a Nziã, kal-a-kal ayiool b'ãngel. Ndɛ ákeyoo bɔ, bvool ákefuul bɔ ɛ̃mfuul. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Baal bueel b'ákeyoo ndɛ ákekam bibi, me ndɔɔ yi ékebɔɔ ndɛ otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ ngesɛ-ngesɛ, bvool ákebveel ɛ̃mfuul y'ãyal mam mbueel. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ŋ'emwɛn tal ye ngoo ndɛ, esi bɔ ongɛɛ, obobɔ ngoo a ndɛ olieel ndɛ bubu: «Muaan a mɛ̃, ndɔɔ yi esi yɛ bee yi mã? Tal, mɛ̃ ye tal a yɛ ɛ̃kwal al'ɛ̃yii ke ywel, bu eyii ebii yɛ ãmboo mbueel!» <verse eid="LUK 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi ekebii byɛ mɛ̃? Byɛ k'eyɛɛ kwɛn ebvaan mɛ̃ etal ãndɔɔ ã tal a mɛ̃ wɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Kɛn a bɔ k'abɔɔ m'eyɛɛn ndɛ otsɛn wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ okɔɔl Nadzalet ye bɔ. Ndɛ ákelweel bɔ. Ngoo ákekwɛɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mam mbueel onse ɔ̃kwal. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yeso ákekwel, bvool ãkaã ákebɔɔl kɛn obɔɔl. Nziã ákedzii ndɛ, baal bueel hɛ̃ ákedzii ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Ãtee ã Dzaã Batis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mak 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Dzã 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1-2" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃ Nziã oyɛɛn ye Dzaã wu muaan a Dzakali, me lio li ékekal ndɛ nkal ɔ̃baan. Me lio olɔ, Tibɛɛl wu ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃nɛn wa Lom, al'oyii me mvel kuun ye taan yi okwɛn o ndɛ. Ponse Pilate áli mfam wa Yude. Elode Antipas áli mfam wa Ngalile. Muaan-ngoo a ndɛ Filipe áli ɔ̃kwɛn fa Itule tiil Telakonide. Lisanias áli mfam wu Abilɛn. Ãnã ye Kayif áli angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn b'Ayuda. <verse eid="LUK 3:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Ŋ'eyoo Dzaã m'eyɛɛn Nziã ndɛ, ndɛ odzuu me nsie yam yueel yi eli tsotsoo a nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃. Ndɛ áketa baal ãmbel k'awal opongo b'okaal b'ɛ̃kwal kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi.<verse eid="LUK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Ãndɔɔ ãbwel m'emfa ki élieel Edzayi wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, onse ɔ̃nkaan a ndɛ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">«Mbuul abebiool nkal ɔ̃baan bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">“Efaal ɔ̃siɔɔn me ndɔɔ a Mfam Nziã!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:4">Eseel ãnkuul ã ndɛ ãkal dzu!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ɔ̃bwɔɔ ndyam wueel, akieel akiil ndɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Ãnkio mam mbueel m'ãnɛn ye m'ãtsi-ãtsi, akieel abwel mɔ̃.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">Ãnkuul m'ãbwɔɔl-ãbwɔɔl, akieel aseel mɔ̃,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 3:5">mã y'ãywɛn, akieel aboo mɔ̃.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Me lio olɔ, ŋ'ékekiaal baal oya b'ɔ̃kwɛn onse ola o bɔ, bɔ ákefaal nkuul. Edzayi oyɛɛn ndiri kɛn a m'emfa kiki, ebvaan baal afaal elaã e bɔ, m'oyɔɔ o Mãsia. Dzaã áketee baal k'akaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, bvool k'ayɔɔl ãbi, me ndɔɔ ɔ̃yɛɛl wu oya o Yeso.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />M'emfa okyɛ, mbuul ndyam wueel àmwɛn emfa ki èbvuul Nziã baal<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Edz 40.3-5</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Embuul e baal ékeya opongo owal ola Dzaã, obobɔ ndɛ ákeyɛɛn bɔ bubu: «Byɛ abi-abi eli onge ampel! Wu osuo byɛ emfa ki abal mpuru a Nziã yi èyeya nã<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dzaã ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri ki ebvuul mbuul k'eli kɛn owal b'opongo wɛ, ki enduru okuun okaal b'ɛ̃kwal.</char></note>? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Esa ãndɔɔ mã ngesɛ, m'ãsuo kwɛn byɛ ekaal ɛ̃kwal. Ebee byam-a-byam obeyɛɛn wɛn: “Abalayam oli nkiɔɔn a bee.” Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ bam eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ãnkɔɔn m'emwɛn byɛ mã, Nziã okoo k'asa kwɛn mɔ̃ ãkɔɔl atiɔɔl b'Abalayam. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Bam ŋ'eyɛɛn ŋã, ekuu amaayɛɛl me ndɔɔ yi akii ɛ̃ti bɛɛn k'ɛ̃dza ɛ̃ myɛ̃. Ɔ̃ti ndyam wueel wɛn k'aburu nsia yi mvɛ wɛ, àkii ndɛ bvool àtyal ndɛ onse mbaa.»<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Baal bu afuul Dzaã ndiri: «Obobɔ, bee eyii bwɛn esa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Mbuul wa m'ɛ̃nkuru mviaal, awa wu oywɛn a ndɛ ngɔmɔ̃. Wa ye bvi-odza, akab bvɛ ye wu oywɛn a bvɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Baal b'asal ke mboo yi afuru mpal ayi hɛ̃ opongo owal, bvool afuul Dzaã bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, ke bee bwɛn-a-bwɛn esa?» <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ndɛ bu abveel bɔ bubu: «Ebee nzi ondɔɔl ke ywel a yi etam nga-furu baal ofuru.»<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Ambwel-mbwel hɛ̃ afuul ndɛ bubu: «Ke bee, bee hɛ̃ bwɛn esa?» Ndɛ hɛ̃ obveel bɔ bubu: «Ebee baal nzi owɛɛl, ebee baal hɛ̃ ãndɔɔ oburu. Ekal y'esɛ me furu e byɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Baal bueel ákekiaal Ɔ̃mvuul ye kaã, bɔ bu abvi ofuul bam-a-bam me ndɔɔ a Dzaã, ndiri: «Wu olɔ ke Mãsia wu Ɔ̃mvuul wu eyuɔɔl Nziã bia-byɛ wɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Dzaã bu abveel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ wu ewa byɛ opongo b'ãdza. Kɛn a mbuul wu aya, wu onduru mɛ̃ me waan. Mɛ̃ ke mvaan m'odzuul b'asimpal a ndɛ wɛ. Ndɛ wu akieel awa byɛ opongo b'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal ye bo mbaa. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Mbuul ondɛ oli y'esiɔ onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi akab nsia e bele ye bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi. Ndɛ àbvool nsia onse nzɔ yi abekwɛɛ yɔ, kɛn a ndɛ àtyal bviĩ bvi ebi-ebi onse mbaa yɛn k'edzam wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Dzaã hɛ̃ owi baal ãluo ãkyam bibi, ndɛ otee bɔ Nsia a Nziã yi Ngesɛ. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Elode wu mfam a Ngalile áwɛɛl Elodias wu ɔ̃kal a muaan-ngoo a ndɛ. Ndɛ wu Elode bvool osi ãndɔɔ m'ãbi-ãbi ãkyam mam bibi. Dzaã bu awi ndɛ mbyel, m'ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mam mbueel. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Obobɔ, Elode otam ndiri alɔ Dzaã bwal: Oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru obii yi esi ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso owel opongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mak 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ŋ'ewel baal bueel opongo, Yeso hɛ̃ oyi bo ndɛ owal. Ŋ'eyii ebuɛɛn ndɛ, ywel edzweel nzuru, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal bu asool nkal a ndɛ m'emfa ki kuun. Nziã bu ayɛɛn ke ywel ndiri: «Yɛ li Muaan a mɛ̃ wu ɔ̃tio, mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ ki bibi me ndɔɔ a yɛ.»<figure style="fig" alt="La baptême de Jésus" file="GT00066.tif" size="col" copy="Gordon Thompson © 2012 Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc." ref="3.21-22" /><verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ankiɔɔn a Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Ŋ'ébɛɛn Yeso otee, ndɛ aleyii me mvel nku-a-nku ãku-ãtyel (30). Baal áketsam kwɛn Dzedzef áli tal a ndɛ. Ndɛ wu Dzedzef oli muaan a Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli oli muaan a Matat. Matat oli muaan a Lebvi. Lebvi oli muaan a Meliki. Meliki oli muaan a Dzanayi. Dzanayi oli muaan a Dzedzef. <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Dzedzef oli muaan a Matatias. Matatias oli muaan a Amose. Amose oli muaan a Nahum. Nahum oli muaan a Esili. Esili oli muaan a Nagayi. <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagayi oli muaan a Mahat. Mahat oli muaan a Matatias. Matatias oli muaan a Semehin. Semehin oli muaan a Yosek. Yosek oli muaan a Yoda. <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda oli muaan a Yohanan. Yohanan oli muaan a Lesa. Lesa oli muaan a Dzolobabel. Dzolobabel oli muaan a Salatyel. Salatyel oli muaan a Neli. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neli oli muaan a Meliki. Meliki oli muaan a Adi. Adi oli muaan a Kosam. Kosam oli muaan a Elemadam. Elemadam oli muaan a Ɛɛl. <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Ɛɛl oli muaan a Dzodzue. Dzodzue oli muaan a Elihedzɛɛl. Elihedzɛɛl oli muaan a Yolim. Yolim oli muaan a Matat. Matat oli muaan a Lebvi. <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lebvi oli muaan a Simehɔ̃. Simehɔ̃ oli muaan a Yuda. Yuda oli muaan a Dzedzef. Dzedzef oli muaan a Yonam. Yonam oli muaan a Elihakim. <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Elihakim oli muaan a Meleha. Meleha oli muaan a Mena. Mena oli muaan a Matata. Matata oli muaan a Natam. Natam oli muaan a David. <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />David oli muaan a Dzese. Dzese oli muaan a Obed. Obed oli muaan a Bohaz. Bohaz oli muaan a Sala. Sala oli muaan a Naason. <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Naason oli muaan a Aminadab. Aminadab oli muaan a Adimin. Adimin oli muaan a Aleni. Aleni oli muaan a Eswerom. Eswerom oli muaan a Pales. Pales oli muaan a Yuda. <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yuda oli muaan a Dzakab. Dzakab oli muaan a Isak. Isak oli muaan a Abalayam. Abalayam oli muaan a Tela. Tela oli muaan a Nahɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahɔɔl oli muaan a Seluk. Seluk oli muaan a Lehu. Lehu oli muaan a Palek. Palek oli muaan a Ebɛɛl. Ebɛɛl oli muaan a Sala. <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Sala oli muaan a Kayinam. Kayinam oli muaan a Alepasad. Alepasad oli muaan a Sem. Sem oli muaan a Nowa. Nowa oli muaan a Lamek. <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek oli muaan a Matusalem. Matusalem oli muaan a Enok. Enok oli muaan a Yalet. Yalet oli muaan a Malehelel. Malehelel oli muaan a Kayinam. <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kayinam oli muaan a Enos. Enos oli muaan a Set. Set oli muaan a Ãdam. Ãdam oli muaan a Nziã.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃pfu ombio Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-11">Mat 1.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mak 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oluul m'Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, bu ambal nzal yi Dzolodɛ̃. Ɔ̃fel obiri ndɛ k'ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Onse ɔ̃baan okɔ, Ɔ̃pfu ombio ndɛ ãtsoo ãku-ãnã (40). Onse ãtsoo omɔ̃ mam mbueel ndɛ k'ákedza wɛ, ke mbee ãtsoo omɔ̃ ndɛ nzal ewel. <verse eid="LUK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Ɔ̃pfu bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn yɛ li Muaan a Nziã, oŋɔ̃ tam kwɛn nkɔɔn yi ekɔɔl esuɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esuɔ li Ayuda eli mampa.</char></note>!» <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Akel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã bubu: “Elaã e mbuul k'eli kɛn a m'esuɔ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Det 8.3</ref></char></note>!”»<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Ɔ̃pfu obiri Yeso nkal ãntɛ, bu asuo ndɛ bam me muaan-lio ãkwɛn mam mbueel m'ɔ̃kiri a nsie. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Ɔ̃pfu bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ èwa yɛ omfam ye lweel li ãkwɛn mã. Ke ngwel wɛ, áwi mɛ̃ eluɔ obvɛ bvam bvieel, mɛ̃ nkoo k'ewa bvɛ me mbuul wu nzii mɛ̃ bvɛ owa. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ŋɛn yɛ bvi ãbuo ke nkwel a mɛ̃, bu lweel mɛ̃, eluɔ bvi bvam bvieel èkal bvi yɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yeso bu abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Akel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã bubu: “Yɛ abva ãbuo kɛn a ke nkwel a Mfam Nziã wu Nziã a yɛ, yɛ asal kɛn a me ndɔɔ a ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13-14">Det 6.13-14</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Ɔ̃pfu bvool obiri Yeso ke Yelusalem, osuul ndɛ ke ywel a Nzɔ a Nziã, bvool olieel ndɛ bubu: «Okɛɛn yɛ Muaan a Nziã li, tsio fa ywel ŋã tiil nsie ku! <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ákel ndiri: “Ndɛ àtam ãnzwel ã ndɛ me ndɔɔ a yɛ kwɛn mɔ̃ ãkiaal yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />Mɔ̃ ã̀biri yɛ nkal a mviɔɔl ɛ̃ mɔ̃, kwɛn yɛ bee tsa obɛɛl me nkɔɔn<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Ãnz 91.11-12</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ákel ndiri: “Oyɛɛ ke poo Mfam Nziã a yɛ wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Det 6.16</ref></char></note>!”» <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Ŋ'eman Ɔ̃pfu Yeso ombio m'emfa bvam bvieel, ndɛ wu Ɔ̃pfu oyɛn lela ye ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi akiaal lio ekyam.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obɛɛn ɔ̃sal ke nsie yi Ngalile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mak 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oluul me mpɛn a Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, bu akɔɔl nsie yi Ngalile. Nsia a ndɛ etsɔɔn me nsie oyɔ yam yueel. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Ndɛ ákeyiool onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn m'Ayuda, baal bueel bu abvi ndɛ otuɛɛn.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baal a Nadzalet k'akiool Yeso wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Yeso oyɛn Nadzalet, ke mboo yi ékwel ndɛ. Me tsoo li saba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saba m'ɔ̃nywã wu Ayuda, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri owuun. Tsoo olɔ ola bɔ éli tsoo li ãsal nsiaan, li eli ãsal ãsɛɛn ola bia-byɛ. Me tsoo olɔ bɔ abuɛɛn mboo ngamɔ̃, onge b'ebesa bia-byɛ m'eyenge.</char></note>, ndɛ osam onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, onge b'ékesa ndɛ tsɔɔn. Ndɛ bu atɛɛn, me ndɔɔ yi atsiɔ ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Awi ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan wu Edzayi, wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã. Ŋ'edzweel ndɛ ɔ̃nkaan ondɛ, ndɛ omwɛn mboo yi ákel ndiri:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />«Ɔ̃fel a Mfam Nziã oli onse mɛ̃,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ osueel mɛ̃ me ndɔɔ yi eliaal aywal Nsia yi Ngesɛ.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Ndɛ otam mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn b'ali onse onkyal wɛn onkyal o bɔ ofi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">me ndɔɔ yi esa kwɛn baal bɛn k'afemwɛn wɛ, amwɛn bvool.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 4:18">Ndɛ hɛ̃ otam mɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yi ebvuul baal b'abetuaal mpal,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />bvool me ndɔɔ yi eliaal baal wɛn mvel amaakoo wu esio Nziã baal a ndɛ nyiĩ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Edz 61.1-2</ref></char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ŋ'eman Yeso otsiɔ, ndɛ okuru ɔ̃nkaan, obveel ndɛ ol'ɔ̃sal a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, bu abvi nsɛn. Baal bueel onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn ayii atal ndɛ yuul. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Obobɔ, ndɛ obvi bɔ oliaal bubu: «Ãndɔɔ me nsiɔ mɛ̃ omɔ̃, asi mɔ̃ nonɔ̃ ŋã me ndɔɔ a byɛ b'ebeyoo mɛ̃.» <verse eid="LUK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Baal bueel ákelweel ndɛ, bvool ákekam m'ãndɔɔ m'ãbvɛ-ãbvɛ m'ékeyɛɛn ndɛ. Bɔ bu abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam bubu: «Ndɛ wu, ke muaan a Dzedzef ali wɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yeso bu alieel bubu: «Taa-taa bam, byɛ ŋ'eta mɛ̃ mboo yi: “Ɔ̃boo, boo nzuru a yɛ yam!” Byɛ hɛ̃ ŋ'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ wɛn: “Bee eyoo nsia a ãndɔɔ mbueel m'esi yɛ ke Kapelanahum, oŋɔ̃ sa mɔ̃ hɛ̃ k'ola o yam!”» <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Yeso bu alweel bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, k'eli y'ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã si ngɔmɔ̃ wu abewa dzuun k'ola o ndyam wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Mɛ̃ bvool ngyɛɛn taa-taa wɛn, me lio li Eli wu ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Mfam Nziã, éli y'akaal b'ápfiil alam bibi ki Isalayel. Me lio olɔ, ési mvel tyel ye nswii sɛɛn yɛn mvel k'ándwɔɔ wɛ, ɔ̃lɔɔ wa kokɔ hɛ̃ áli m'ɔ̃kiri wueel. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Kɛn a Nziã k'áyuɔɔl Eli, kwɛn ndɛ ayewuaal ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil wu Isalayel wɛ. Ndɛ áyuɔɔl ndɛ kɛn ol'ɔ̃pfiil ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákekal ke Salepeta, ke nsie yi Sidɔ̃, m'owuual o ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Me lio li ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Mfam Nziã Elidze, éli hɛ̃ ye baal bibi b'áli y'ãluu me leba. Elidze k'ábvuul mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wu Isalayel wɛ, ndɛ ábvuul kɛn a Naaman wu ɔ̃kiri wa Sili.»<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Ŋ'eyoo baal b'áli onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ ayoo nkyee bibi. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Bɔ atɛɛn, apaal Yeso onse ola, bu abiri ndɛ nkal a nkio yi átuu bviil e bɔ nkal a yɔ, me ndɔɔ yi atsɛɛn ndɛ ke nsɛn a yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Kɛn a ndɛ obwel onse bɔ, bu ayɛn li ndyam.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuul wu oluul m'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Yeso hɛ̃ oyɛn Kapelanahum, bviil li ke nsie yi Ngalile. Oŋɔ̃, ndɛ obvi baal oyiool me tsoo li saba. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Ãtee ã ndɛ ãsi baal ɛ̃kam, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ákesuo omfam onse ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn oŋɔ̃, éli ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi. Mbuul ondɛ obiool bam kokɔ bubu: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />«Ke-bwɛn-ndoo, Yeso wa Nadzalet, ndɔɔ yi esi bee yɛ mã? Yɛ bee yi obam? Mɛ̃ bam ngyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ li mbuul wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu eyuɔɔl Nziã!» <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yeso bu atam ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi ye nkoo yueel ndiri: «Kal pi, bvool pal!» Ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi otyel mbuul ondɛ me nsie ke nkwel a baal bueel, bvool opal onse ndɛ, k'atueel ndɛ mpal wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Baal bueel akam, bvool abvi bam-a-bam oyɛɛn bubu: «Ayɛɛn mã ndɛ mã, mã bwɛn-a-bwɛn! Ndɛ ayɛɛn y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ye nkoo yueel y'omfam, myɛ̃ hɛ̃ ɛ̃pal?» <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Obobɔ, nsia a Yeso etsɔɔn m'etswi e nsie kieel.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oboo anga-ãluu bibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yeso ombal nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, oyɛn nzɔ a Simɔ̃. Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, okɔ o ndɛ wu Simɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal áli ye baa li bibi. Baal b'áli oŋɔ̃ aluɔɔn ola Yeso ndiri aboo ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Yeso bu apfɔɔn nkal a ndɛ, bvool bu ayɛɛn ye baa ye nkoo yueel, ndɛ baa bu efi. Ndɛ bu abvi osal me ndɔɔ a bɔ kɛn a me lio olɔ.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Ŋ'edziin tal, abiri baal bam bueel b'áli y'ãluu m'emfa bwɛn emfa ola Yeso. Ndɛ ondɔɔl mbuul m'ɔ̃mɔ̃-ɔ̃mɔ̃ onse bɔ kuɔɔl, ãluu ã bɔ bam bueel bu ãfi. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃pal onse anga-ãluu, ɛ̃luɔɔl kokɔ ndiri: «Yɛ li Muaan a Nziã.» Kɛn a Yeso ákeyiaan myɛ̃, bvool ákeluo myɛ̃ oyɛɛn, ke ngwel wɛ myɛ̃ ɛ̃yɛɛ kwɛn ndɛ oli Mãsia.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso otee onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, Yeso opal onse bviil, bu ayɛn nkal ɔ̃baan. Baal bibi abvi ndɛ obii. Ŋ'emwɛn bɔ ndɛ, bɔ ayɛɛn ndɛ ndiri akal ye bɔ mboo mɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Ebvaan kwɛn mɛ̃ eyetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Okwɛn o Nziã k'ãbviil mãkyɛ, ke ngwel wɛ obɔ otsɛn b'etam Nziã mɛ̃.» <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ndɛ áketee onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn mã Yude.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Ayio a Yeso b'ɛ̃kwel</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mak 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso áketee nku-a-nku a nzal yi Dzenasalet<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzal yi Dzenasalet ye Nzal yi Ngalile eli kɛn a nzal yiyi.</char></note>. Baal bibi ákeywɛn bakyɛ tsotsoo a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ayoo Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Ndɛ omwɛn ãbvuaal mbuaal k'esiɛɛn e nzal oyɔ. Aswal b'answi apal onse mɔ̃, bu ayii asuɔɔl ãkii ã bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Ndɛ osam onse bvuaal ngɔmɔ̃, b'óli bo Simɔ̃. Ndɛ bu alieel ndɛ wu Simɔ̃ ndiri: «Siaal bvuaal muaan lela y'ekwel.» Yeso obvi nsɛn onse bvuaal, bu abvi baal otee.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Ŋ'eman ndɛ oyɛɛn, ndɛ olieel Simɔ̃ bubu: «Syal ke mboo yi ye dzio, bvool etyal ãkii ã byɛ, m'oswal b'answi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Simɔ̃ obveel bubu: «Taal, bee emwɛn fool m'oswal tsatsa, ki ebɔɔ pyɛ. Kɛn onge bɛn yɛ lieel mɛ̃ wɛn ntyal ãkii, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ètyal mɔ̃.» <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Ŋ'etyel bɔ ãkii, bɔ abɔɔ answi bam bibi. Ãkii ã bɔ ãyii ãsɔɔ okɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Bɔ apyel anga-ndoo a bɔ b'áli onse bvuaal bokyɛ, kwɛn bɔ ayewuaal a bɔ. Bɔ ayi, abvɔɔn ye bakyɛ, bu aluul ãbvuaal m'answi bam bibi. Ãbvuaal ãluul mam tɔ, bvool bu ãyii ãbii odziin.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Ŋ'emwɛn Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a Yeso, bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Mfam, syal lela ye mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndi mbuul ãbi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Taa-taa bam, Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl ye baal bueel b'áli ye ndɛ ebangɛɛ ébɔɔ bɔ, me ndɔɔ olɔɔ b'answi b'ébɔɔ bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Andoo a ndɛ b'áli onse bvuaal bokyɛ: Dzak ye Dzaã, b'áli baan a Dzebede hɛ̃, akam bibi. Obobɔ, Yeso olieel Simɔ̃ bubu: «Bee buɔ obal, ke ngwel wɛ bɛɛn nonɔ̃ ŋã, yɛ yii baal aswal.» <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ asiɛɛn ãbvuaal, asiil eluɔ bvieel, bu aluɛɛn a Yeso.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oboo mbuul wa y'ãluu me leba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mak 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso áli onse bviil ngelemɔ̃. Mbuul wa y'ãluu me leba oyi oŋɔ̃. Ŋ'emwɛn mbuul ondɛ Yeso, ndɛ obvi ãbuo mbwii me nsie ke nkwel a ndɛ, bu aluɔɔn ola ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, okɛɛn yɛ dzii, mbaal mɛ̃ oluu ba, kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal tsɛtsɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yeso ondɔɔl ndɛ kuɔɔl, onywɛn me ndɛ, bu ayɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ nzii obobɔ, oluu o yɛ ofi!» Bam kɛn alili oŋɔ̃, leba e ndɛ efi.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yeso otam ndɛ bubu osa: «Bee mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ oyɛɛn, yi y'asuo nzuru a yɛ ola ngaa-a-Nziã, kwɛn ndɛ atal yɛ ngesɛ. Wa kab hɛ̃, m'emfa ki ekel Moyize onse ɔ̃nkaan wu ãngel, m'emfa okyɛ baal bueel àyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ oluu ofi.» <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Kɛn a nsia a Yeso éketsɔɔn kɛn otsɔɔn. Baal bibi abvɔɔn, me ndɔɔ yi ayoo ndɛ, bvool kwɛn bɔ abvuul m'ãluu ã bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Kɛn a Yeso ákeyi nkal ɔ̃baan, me ndɔɔ yi abuɛɛn.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oboo ekal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso ákeyiool. Afalisaye y'ayiool b'ãngel ábvi nsɛn tsotsoo a ndɛ. Bɔ áfi ãla mam mbueel mã Ngalile, ye mã Yude, ye bviil li Yelusalem. Waan e Mfam Nziã éli ye Yeso, kwɛn ndɛ aboo baal ba y'ãluu. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Enseel oŋɔ̃, baal ayi y'ekal ki ebiri bɔ nkal a ekal. Bɔ ákebii ãyal m'aswɛɛl mbuul ondɛ onse nzɔ, bvool asuul ndɛ ke nkwel a Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Kɛn a bɔ k'ákekoo k'aswɛɛl ndɛ wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn embuul énduru olɔɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ anɔɔn ke ywel a sɛɛ, ayɛɛl ãnzanza, bu aswɛɛl ekal okyɛ ke nkwel a Yeso, ke mviil ã baal bueel. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso okiool o bɔ, ndɛ olieel mbuul ondɛ bubu: «Ndoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, adzeel ãbi ã yɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye bu abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam bubu: «Mbuul wu ndyam nã ali? Ndɛ asiaan Nziã! Ndɛ k'ayɛɛ kwɛn wu abedzeel ãbi kɛn a Nziã ndyam wɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Kɛn onge bɛn Yeso otaal ãtsam m'ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi etsam byɛ obobɔ? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Ayɛɛn ndiri: “Adzeel ãbi ã yɛ”, oyɔ k'eli ndɔɔ yi mpal m'oyɛɛn wɛ, kɛn ayɛɛn ndiri: “Tɛɛn yi”, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru mpal m'oyɛɛn! <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ngesɛ, ebvaan byɛ eyɛɛ kwɛn Muaan a mbuul oli y'omfam b'adzeel ãbi me nsie yi.» Obobɔ, ndɛ wu Yeso olieel mbuul ondɛ ndiri: «Tɛɛn, wal ekal e yɛ, bvool yi nzɔ!»<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Bam kɛn a me lio olɔ, mbuul ondɛ hɛ̃ otɛɛn ke nkwel a baal bueel, owel ekal ki éli ndɛ bɔ nkal a kyɛ, bu ayɛn nzɔ, bvool ayi atuɛɛn Nziã me nkuul a nkuul. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Baal bueel b'áli oŋɔ̃ ɛ̃kam bu ɛ̃si bɔ, bvool ayoo buɔ. Bɔ alweel Nziã, bvool ayɛɛn ndiri: «Bee nonɔ̃ emwɛn ãndɔɔ m'emwã!»<figure style="fig" alt="La guérison d’un paralytique" file="WA03824b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="5.17-26" /><verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osuaal o Lebvi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso opal, bvool omwɛn mbuul wu awal mpal wɛn nkuũ Lebvi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nkuũ Lebvi hɛ̃ Matie: Etal </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 9:9">Mat 9.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:14-15">Mak 2.14-15</ref></char>.</note> Ndɛ áli me nsɛn ke mboo a ndɛ yi ɔ̃sal. Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Luɛɛn a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Lebvi otɛɛn, osiil eluɔ bvieel, bu aluɛɛn a ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Lebvi obɛɛl pfuun me ndɔɔ a Yeso, ke nzɔ a ndɛ. Baal b'awal mpal akyam, ye baal bakyɛ hɛ̃ ákedza ye bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Afalisaye y'ayiool b'ãngel b'áli nkel ngamɔ̃ ye bɔ, abvi bɔ okwee. Bɔ bu alieel ayio a Yeso bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi edza byɛ ye baal b'awal mpal, ye baal b'ãbi ba?» <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Baal ba kɛɛ-kɛɛ k'ali ye kɔɔ li ɔ̃boo wɛ, kɛn abieel b'ali ye kɔɔ e ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />M'emfa kiki, mɛ̃ ke ngyi me ndɔɔ yi eta baal ba dzu mbel wɛ, be yenta mɛ̃ mbel baal b'ãbi, kwɛn bɔ akaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndɔɔ yi etal ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Baal bakyɛ alieel Yeso bubu: «Ayio a Dzaã ye b'Afalisaye abekal me nzal bvool abebuɛɛn, kɛn a ba yɛ abedza bvool abenywã.» <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Me lio li asa bal, ɔ̃baal k'asuul anga-ndoo a ndɛ me nzal wɛ, ŋ'eli ndɛ kɛn ye bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Kɛn ãtsoo ãkieel ãya m'ambaal ɔ̃baal onse bɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ akieel abee odza m'ãlio omɔ̃<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeso oli onge ɔ̃lam. Ŋ'eli ndɛ mboo mɔ̃ y'ayio, bɔ ali y'esɛ, olɔ kɛn ke lio li esa bɔ ãbuɛɛn mã me nzal wɛ. Kɛn a ke mbee epfu e ndɛ, ayio àkoo k'asa mɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yi alaal mpiri a ndɛ.</char></note>.»<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Yeso hɛ̃ oti bɔ mboo yi: «K'eli ye mbuul wu ambaal mpɛɛl ekɔ ki enyiɔɔn wɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abaan ekɔ ki tsɔɔn. Ndɛ asa obobɔ, ndɛ ol'obiil ekɔ ki enyiɔɔn, mpɛɛl ekɔ ki enyiɔɔn yi etsiil ndɛ hɛ̃ olɔ k'ebvaan y'ekɔ ki tsɔɔn wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />M'emfa kiki, mbuul hɛ̃ k'abekaal mbal m'ãlili onse ãmfel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mfel yi Ayuda ákesa yɔ m'ebaan bvi anyam.</char></note> m'ãmaãyiil wɛ. Ndɛ asa obobɔ, mbal m'ãlili ol'ãbwel ãmfel omɔ̃: Ãmfel ol'ãbool, mbal bu ãtsɔɔn me nsie. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Mbal m'ãlili, ebvaan alɔ mɔ̃ kɛn onse ãmfel m'ãlili<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ãmboo omɔ̃ ãnge-mbuaal ŋ'ayɛɛn wɛn Yeso ákeyɛɛn Ayuda ndiri bɔ k'akoo k'anɔɔn a ndɛ y'onkɔɔ nkuul ngamɔ̃ wɛ.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Mbuul k'abedzii mbal m'ãlili, ke mbee a ŋ'enywi ndɛ mbal m'ãmaãyiil wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, abeyɛɛn ndiri: “Mbal m'ãmaãyiil ãnduru obvie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeso oyɛɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ me ndɔɔ Ayuda bakyɛ b'abee Nsia yi Ngesɛ, me ndɔɔ yi aluɛɛn onkɔɔ o bɔ.</char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Yeso oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a saba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mak 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Me tsoo ngelemɔ̃ li saba, Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ ákebwel onse ãnguun. Ayio a ndɛ aki nsia yi bele, anyuɔɔn yɔ onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ bɔ, bu adzi yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Afalisaye bakyɛ alieel bɔ bubu: «Otsɛn omã b'esa byɛ ãndɔɔ m'eluo ãngel baal osa me tsoo li saba?» <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ k'etsiɔ m'ési David wɛ? Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ndɛ ye b'áli ye ndɛ ayoo nzal. <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Ndɛ osam onse Nzɔ a Nziã, owel amampa b'áwi Nziã ãkab. Ndɛ odzi bɔ, owi hɛ̃ b'áli ye ndɛ, onkyam ŋɛn ãngel ã Moyize ãliaal ndiri b'adza amampa obɔ kɛn a angaa-a-Nziã<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Sa 21.1-6</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Yeso bvool olieel bɔ ndiri: «Muaan a mbuul oli Mfam a tsoo li saba.»<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuul wu ékwi kuɔɔl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Me tsoo e saba ekyam, Yeso osam onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn, bu abvi oyiool. Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ékwi kuɔɔl ki elam áli oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye ákekyab Yeso, me ndɔɔ yi atal owɛɛl ndɛ oboo mbuul ondɛ me tsoo e saba, kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ elyal ki afɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Onge bɛn Yeso áyɛɛ ãtsam mi ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, ndɛ olieel mbuul wu ékwi kuɔɔl ondɛ ndiri: «Tɛɛn ke nkwel a baal bueel.» Ndɛ otɛɛn, bu asyel nkwel. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yeso bu afuul bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ mfuul byɛ bubu: Me tsoo e saba, ãngel ã bia-byɛ ãtam bia-byɛ emã osa, obi wuo obvɛ? Ebvaan ebvuul elaã e mbuul wuo ebam ndɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Yeso otal bɔ bam bueel, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ olieel mbuul wu ékwi kuɔɔl ndiri: «Naan kuɔɔl e yɛ!» Ndɛ osi obobɔ, kuɔɔl e ndɛ bu ebvaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye ayi mpuru bibi, bvool ayɛɛn bam-a-bam bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi esa bia-byɛ Yeso wu?»<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osuaal b'antam kuun ye buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, Yeso oyɛn nkal a nkio, me ndɔɔ yi abuɛɛn. Ndɛ obuɛɛn tsia wu ɔ̃tsiin. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, ndɛ oti ayio a ndɛ mbel, bvool osueel baal kuun ye buaal onse bɔ, bu ati bɔ m'antam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Antam ange-kuun ye buaal ali baal b'eyuɔɔl Yeso. Ndɛ owi bɔ okwɛn ye waan me ndɔɔ yi asa ãndɔɔ me nkuũ a ndɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Tal ãnkuũ ã bɔ: Simɔ̃, wu eloo ndɛ hɛ̃ me Piɛɛl, y'Andele wu muaan-ngoo a Piɛɛl, ye Dzak, ye Dzaã, ye Filipe, ye Baatelemi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />ye Matie, ye Toma, ye Dzak wu muaan a Alefe, ye Simɔ̃ wu áketa hɛ̃ me Dzelot,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adzelot éli nkel a Ayuda ba y'ebal ki ɔ̃kiri a bɔ. Bɔ ákedzwaan me ndɔɔ yi apaal ɔ̃kiri a bɔ onse okwɛn o baal a Lom.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />ye Yuda wu muaan a Dzak, ye Yuda wu Isikaliot, wu átiɔ Yeso.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso atee baal, bvool aboo ba y'ãluu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yeso y'antam a ndɛ asool nkal a nkio, bu atɛɛn ke mboo yi liɛɛn. Ŋ'etɔ bɔ oŋɔ̃, bɔ amwɛn ayio a ndɛ bibi. Baal bibi hɛ̃ b'áfi Yude, Yelusalem, y'ola bo Tiil ye bo Sidɔ̃, mã nku-a-nku a nzal, áli oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Baal áyi me ndɔɔ yi ayoo ndɛ, bvool kwɛn ndɛ aboo bɔ ãluu. Yeso hɛ̃ oboo baal bam bueel b'áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Mbuul ndyam wueel ákebii k'anywɛn me Yeso, ke ngwel wɛ mpɛn ngamɔ̃ ékepal onse ndɛ, bvool ékeboo bɔ bueel.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esɛ y'ãwua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Obobɔ, Yeso otal ayio a ndɛ, bvool olieel bɔ bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">«Esɛ ngamfɛn ola byɛ b'aywal,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:20">ke ngwel wɛ Okwɛn o Nziã oli bo byɛ!<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Esɛ ngamfɛn ola byɛ b'eli me nzal meba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">ke ngwel wɛ byɛ ekieel ebɔɔ bvi-odza bvi enduru ɔ̃ndel!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">Esɛ ngamfɛn ola byɛ b'ebelel meba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:21">ke ngwel wɛ byɛ ekieel esyob!<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Esɛ ngamfɛn ola byɛ, ŋɛn baal abebyal byɛ, abetiɔ byɛ eboo, abetoo byɛ ɛ̃tswɛ, abekwee byɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn byɛ ekiool Muaan a mbuul. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Esia mpal, bvool edzɔɔl m'esɛ, ŋ'ekieel esa bɔ byɛ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. Taa-taa bam, Nziã okwee byɛ ebva-kab ki enɛn. Ke ngwel wɛ, ankiɔɔn a bɔ ási aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã abubu.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Kɛn ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'apfel,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:24">ke ngwel wɛ byɛ emeebɔɔ bvieel, byɛ bvool ki ebekiaal pyɛ!<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'eli ye bvam bvieel meba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">ke ngwel wɛ byɛ ekieel ekal me nzal.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">Ãwua ola byɛ, byɛ b'ebesyob meba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:25">ke ngwel wɛ byɛ ekieel eluɔɔl bvool elel.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ãwua ola byɛ bueel, okɛɛn baal bueel abeyɛɛn obvɛ me ndɔɔ a byɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 6:26">Ke ngwel wɛ, ankiɔɔn a bɔ áyɛɛn obvɛ me ndɔɔ aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn ba mfya m'emfa kiki.»<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Odzii b'ataal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />«Kɛn a byɛ b'eyoo mɛ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn ye byɛ wɛn: Edzii bɛn k'adzii byɛ wɛ, esa b'abyal byɛ obvɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Endɔɔl b'abwel byɛ enkɛɛ kuɔɔl, ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a b'atuaal byɛ mpal. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ŋɛn mbuul obɛɛl yɛ empal me bal ngelemɔ̃, kaal ndɛ hɛ̃ bal likyɛ. Okɛɛn ndɛ owel yɛ kadzaka, yɔɔl ndɛ awal hɛ̃ simisi. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Okɛɛn mbuul osɔɔ eluɔ ola yɛ, wa ndɛ kyɛ. Ŋɛn mbuul owel eluɔ e yɛ, bee ndɛ kyɛ oyiaan. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Esa bakyɛ ãndɔɔ m'edzii byɛ kwɛn bɔ asa byɛ mɔ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />«Okɛɛn byɛ edzii kɛn a baal b'abedzii byɛ, ebva-kab ki awa byɛ ki efa kwɛn? Ke ngwel wɛ, anga-ãbi hɛ̃ abedzii b'adzii bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Okɛɛn byɛ esa obvɛ kɛn a me b'abesa byɛ obvɛ, ebva-kab ki ekiaal byɛ ki efa kwɛn? Anga-ãbi hɛ̃ abesa obobɔ. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Okɛɛn baal b'esuɔɔn byɛ nzi ali kɛn a b'eyɛɛ byɛ kwɛn bɔ olɔ abveel byɛ yɔ, ebva-kab ki ekiaal byɛ ki efa kwɛn? Onkyam baal b'ãbi hɛ̃ abesuɔɔn baal b'ãbi bakyɛ nzi, kwɛn bɔ abveel bɔ yɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />«Kɛn a byɛ, edzii bɛn k'adzii byɛ wɛ, esa bɔ obvɛ. Esuɔɔn bɔ nzi hɛ̃, ebee okiaal kwɛn bɔ abveel byɛ yɔ. Obobɔ, byɛ èbɔɔ ebva-kab ki enɛn, byɛ hɛ̃ èkal baan a Nziã-a-Mpuu, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ abesuo obvɛ o ndɛ ola baal bɛn k'atuɛɛn ndɛ wɛ, ye baal b'ãbi. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Tal a byɛ oluul me nyiĩ. Obobɔ, byɛ hɛ̃ ekal ye nyiĩ onge ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obee b'ãndɔɔ ã bakyɛ otsiil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />«Ebee ãndɔɔ ã bakyɛ otsiil, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ hɛ̃ abee mã byɛ otsiil. Ebee bakyɛ me mbyel obam, kwɛn abee byɛ hɛ̃ me yɔ obam. Edzeel bakyɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ adzeel byɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Ewa bakyɛ eluɔ, kwɛn awa byɛ hɛ̃. Àlɔ eluɔ bvam bibi onse angɔrɔ a byɛ. Ànyam bvool àsiɔ bɔ, kwɛn bɔ aluul apal mpu. Ke ngwel wɛ, àwa byɛ m'emvɛɛl li ewa byɛ bakyɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yeso bvool oti bɔ mboo yi: «Ɔ̃nkwa-mviil olɔ osuo ngaburu-ɔ̃nkwa-mviil nkuul? Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, bɔ ange-buaal olɔ abvi onse ywɛn! <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />K'eli y'ɔ̃yio wu onduru ɔ̃yiool a ndɛ wɛ. Kɛn ɔ̃yio wueel wɛn ayiool ndɛ ãndɔɔ ngesɛ àkal onge ɔ̃yiool a ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Yeso bvool olieel bubu: «Ndɔɔ mã yi emwɛn yɛ efeel ki eli onse dziil e nga-ndoo a yɛ, kɛn a yɛ k'amwɛn epaal ki ekwii ki eli onse dziil e yam wɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Emfa emã kyɛn yɛ koo k'ayɛɛn nga-ndoo a yɛ wɛn: “Ndoo, sa mɛ̃ mbaal yɛ efeel ki eli onse dziil e yɛ”, yɛ wɛn k'amwɛn epaal ki ekwii ki eli onse dziil e yam wɛ? Mbuul wa nzɛɛn-yuaal! Mbaal tsɔɔn epaal ki ekwii ki onse dziil e yam! M'emfa okyɛ, yɛ olɔ obvi omwɛn kal-a-kal, m'ombaal b'efeel ki eli onse dziil e nga-ndoo a yɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃ti ye nsia e ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />«Ɔ̃ti wa ngesɛ k'aburu nsia yi mbi-mbi wɛ. Ɔ̃ti wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi hɛ̃ k'aburu nsia yi ngesɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Ke ngwel wɛ, abeyɛɛ ɔ̃ti ndyam wueel me nsia e ndɛ. K'akoo m'oka o nsia yi fig m'ɔ̃ti wu ãnsiɛɛn wɛ, k'akoo m'oka o nsia yi bvine hɛ̃ m'ɔ̃ngɔngɔɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Emfa kiki, mbuul wa ngesɛ asa obvɛ b'ofa onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ. Kɛn a mbuul wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi asa obi b'ofa onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃nywã a mbuul apaal ãndɔɔ m'ãluul tɔ onse ɔ̃kwal a ndɛ.»<figure style="fig" file="HK00112c.tif" size="span" copy="Horace Knowles, © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society," ref="6.44" /><verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãnzɔ m'emfa bviaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />«Otsɛn omã b'eta byɛ mɛ̃ wɛn: “Mfam, Mfam!”, kɛn a byɛ k'esa ãndɔɔ m'etam mɛ̃ byɛ osa wɛ? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Esa mɛ̃ nsuo byɛ emfa e mbuul ndyam wueel wu aya ola mɛ̃, ayoo ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃, bvool asa ãndɔɔ m'etam mɛ̃ ndɛ osa: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ndɛ oli onge mbuul wɛn ŋ'etuu ndɛ nzɔ a ndɛ, otsam ywɛn li ela, bu abɛɛn nzɔ a ndɛ otuu nkal a nkɔɔn. Me lio li eyi mpel, ãdza ã nzal ãyi mvel ke nzɔ, kɛn a mɔ̃ k'ãkoo k'ãbal nzɔ oyɔ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ atuu yɔ ngesɛ. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Kɛn a mbuul wu yoo ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃, k'asi ãndɔɔ me ntam mɛ̃ ndɛ osa wɛ, oli onge mbuul wu obɛɛn nzɔ otuu nkal a nsie ntu, k'abɛɛn yɔ otuu nkal a nkɔɔn wɛ. Ŋ'eyi ãdza ã nzal mvel ke nzɔ oyɔ, yɔ ebvi kɛn a me lio olɔ, bu etsɔɔn.»<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yeso obvuul ɔ̃nkyal a mfam a ambwel-mbwel wa Lom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Ŋ'eman Yeso ãndɔɔ mam mbueel oyɛɛn ye baal b'ákeyoo ndɛ, ndɛ oyɛn Kapelanahum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Okɔ, éli ye mbiri a ambwel-mbwel ngɔmɔ̃ wa Lom. Ndɛ áli y'ɔ̃nkyal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ékedzii ndɛ bibi. Ɔ̃nkyal ondɛ áli y'ãluu mɛn emeesiil k'ambaal ampie. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Ŋ'eyoo mbiri a ambwel-mbwel ondɛ nsia a Yeso, ndɛ oyuɔɔl akuul-kuul b'Ayuda ke kwɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ayeluɔɔn Yeso kwɛn ndɛ ayebvuul ɔ̃nkyal a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ ola Yeso, bɔ abvi ndɛ obuɛɛn bibi, bu ayɛɛn ndɛ bubu: «Mbuul wu obvaan kwɛn yɛ wuaal a ndɛ! <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ odzii baal a bia-byɛ, bu atuu bia-byɛ nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn.» <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Obobɔ, Yeso oyɛn ye bɔ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Ŋ'etɔ bɔ tsotsoo a nzɔ, mbiri a ambwel-mbwel oyuɔɔl andoo a ndɛ ayeyɛɛn Yeso bubu: «Mfam, bee nzuru a yɛ yam mpal otuaal, mɛ̃ ke mvaan wɛ kwɛn yɛ sam onse nzɔ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ emwɛn kwɛn mɛ̃ ke mvaan m'oya ola yɛ myam wɛ. Yɛɛn kɛn a ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃, ɔ̃nkyal a mɛ̃ olɔ obvuul! <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ebelweel amfam ba ke ywel a mɛ̃. Kɛn a mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ndi y'ambwel-mbwel ba ke nsɛn a mɛ̃ b'ayoo mɛ̃. Mɛ̃ ongyɛɛn ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn: “Yi!”, ndɛ oyɛn. Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn wukyɛ wɛn: “Ya!”, ndɛ hɛ̃ oyi. Bvool okɛɛn mɛ̃ ntam ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃ wɛn: “Sa bubu!”, ndɛ hɛ̃ osi obobɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Ŋ'eyoo Yeso ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, ndɛ okam bam bibi, okɔɔl, bu ayɛɛn ye baal b'ákeluɛɛn a ndɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, onkyam ola baal b'Isalayel, mɛ̃ kɛn amwɛn okiool bo bubu wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Ŋ'ebvool baal obɔ nzɔ a mbiri a ambwel-mbwel, bɔ ayebɔɔ ɔ̃nkyal o ndɛ oyii nzuru kɛɛ-kɛɛ.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oseel nsam a bɔɔl ke Nayin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyɛn ola b'ata me Nayin. Ayio a ndɛ y'embuul ki bibi ákeyi ye ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ sua ɔ̃nywã wu ola, ndɛ omwɛɛn ye baal b'ákeyi ebiĩ odziool k'ãmpiɛɛn. Ɔ̃kaal wu ékwi muaan áli ɔ̃pfiil. Ndɛ áli kɛn a y'ensuu e muaan ngemɔ̃ olɔ li ékwi. Baal b'ola obɔ bibi ákeyi ndɛ osuul. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ŋ'emwɛn Mfam Yeso ɔ̃kaal ondɛ, ndɛ nyiĩ a ndɛ ebɔɔ yam bibi, bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Oŋɔ̃ wuun, bee obelel!»<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Yeso osyel tsotsoo ebɛɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebɛɛ li bɔ me lio olɔ éli kɛn a kal-a-kal.</char></note>, okwaal lɔ. Baal b'ákebiri lɔ bu atɛɛn. Ndɛ bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Nsam a bɔɔl, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn yɛ wɛn siool!» <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Obobɔ, muaan wu ákwi obvi nsɛn, bvool obvi oyɛɛn. Yeso bu abveel ndɛ ola ngoo. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Baal bam bueel buɔ obɔɔ. Bɔ bu abvi Nziã olweel ndiri: «Ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃nɛn opal onse bia-byɛ! Nziã oyewuaal a baal a ndɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Nsia a Yeso etsɔɔn me nsie a Yude yam yueel, y'ãla mã nku-a-nku a yɔ.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus ramène à la vie le fils d'une veuve" file="WA03823b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="7.11-17" /><verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayio b'etam Dzaã Batis ola Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Ayio a Dzaã awi ndɛ nsia a emvieel obvɛ bvam bvieel. Obobɔ, ndɛ oti buaal onse bɔ mbel, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />bu atam bɔ ola Mfam Yeso, me ndɔɔ yi ayefuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃mvuul wu ebekiaal bee yɛ, wuo mbuul ɔ̃kyam?» <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ ola Yeso, bɔ ayɛɛn ndɛ bubu: «Dzaã Batis otam bee ola yɛ, kwɛn bee efuul yɛ wɛn: “Ɔ̃mvuul wu ebekiaal bee, yɛ wuo wu àya, wuo mbuul ɔ̃kyam?”»<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Kɛn a me lio alili olɔ, Yeso obvuul baal bibi b'áli y'ãluu, y'ãmpal m'emfa bwɛn emfa, bvool otswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi mi éli onse baal. Ndɛ hɛ̃ odzweel baal bɛn k'ákemwɛn wɛ mviil. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso obveel ayio a Dzaã bubu: «Eyeyɛɛn Dzaã ãndɔɔ m'emwɛn byɛ ye m'eyoo byɛ:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:22">Baal b'ékwi mviil ayii amwɛn ngesɛ, baal b'adzuu tetɔɔ̃ abvi odzuu ngesɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:22">baal b'ali y'ãluu me leba abvi obvuul, ankɛn ayii ayoo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:22">baal b'ákwi ayii asiool, aywal hɛ̃ ayii ayoo Nsia yi Ngesɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:18-19">Edz 29.18-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 35:5-6">35.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">61.1-2</ref></char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Esɛ ola mbuul wɛn k'ayɔɔl okiool o ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ wɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl ayio a Dzaã, Yeso obvi oyɛɛn ye baal b'áli oŋɔ̃ me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wu Dzaã. Ndɛ ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Wu eyetal byɛ nkal ɔ̃baan nã? Mbuul wɛn onge ɔ̃mbɛɛl wa tyob-tyob wu enziool mfel? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, byɛ nã eyetal? Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu olaal ekɔ bvi ɔ̃bvɛn? Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃! Ke ngwel wɛ, baal b'abelaal ekɔ bvi ɔ̃bvɛn, bvool b'ali y'opfel, bɔ abekal onse ãnzɔ m'akwɛn! <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Wu eyetal byɛ nã? Ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã? Hɛɛ̃, taa-taa! Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ndɛ bam onduru ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã! <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Dzaã oli mbuul wɛn ákel onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã me ndɔɔ a ndɛ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">“Tal, mɛ̃ èyuɔɔl ntam a mɛ̃ atsɔɔn nkwel a yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:27">me ndɔɔ yi afaal yɛ ɔ̃siɔɔn<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAL 3:23">23</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn k'eli ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu áburu me nsie yi wu ánduru Dzaã wɛ. Kɛn a onse Okwɛn o Nziã meba ŋã, mbuul wu obvool mbee wu ondruru ndɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Baal bam bueel ye baal b'awal mpal ayoo ãtee ã Dzaã, bɔ akiool kwɛn Nziã oli dzu, bvool ayewal opongo o Dzaã. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Kɛn Afalisaye y'ayiool b'ãngel abee k'awal opongo o Dzaã. M'emfa okyɛ, bɔ abee ãndɔɔ m'ékedzii Nziã bɔ osa.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yeso bvool olweel bubu: «Obobɔ, mɛ̃ baal ba nonɔ̃ ba y'anã emvɛɛl bɔ? Bɔ onge anã ali? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Tal! Bɔ ali onge baan b'abvi nsɛn ke taan me ndɔɔ yi asa ɛ̃taan, ayɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">“Bee esio byɛ mpaa, byɛ k'ekɛn wɛ!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 7:32">Bee eyam byɛ ãnziĩ m'ãwua, byɛ hɛ̃ k'elel wɛ!”<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Dzaã oyewa baal opongo. Ndɛ obee k'adza, obee k'anywã, byɛ etɔ m'oliaal wɛn: “Ndɛ oli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi!” <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Muaan a mbuul oyi, adza, anywã, byɛ bvool etɔ m'oliaal wɛn: “Etal mbuul wu! Ndɛ ɔ̃sal kɛn odza, kɛn onywã! Ndɛ oli ndoo a baal b'awal mpal ye baal b'ãbi!” <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Kɛn ãyal ã Nziã ãmɔɔn onse baal bam bueel b'akiool mɔ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso omwɛɛn y'ɔ̃kaal nga-ãbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Ɔ̃falisaye ngɔmɔ̃ oti Yeso mbel me ndɔɔ yi ayedza ola ndɛ. Yeso osam onse nzɔ a ndɛ, bvool owel mboo m'odza. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, onse ola obɔ éli y'ɔ̃kaal nga-ãbi ngɔmɔ̃. Ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ndiri Yeso obvi nsɛn ke misa onse nzɔ a Ɔ̃falisaye ondɛ, ndɛ owel ɔ̃langa ngɔmɔ̃ wu alebat wu aluul m'ãnasi. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Ndɛ oyetɛɛn ke mbee a Yeso, ke ntaã e ndɛ. Ndɛ alel, ãnsia ã ndɛ ãbuaal ntaã e Yeso. Ndɛ ayiaal yɔ me mfu e ndɛ, abuun yɔ bu apwɛɛ yɔ ãnasi omɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Ŋ'emwɛn Ɔ̃falisaye wu áti Yeso mbel obobɔ, ndɛ oyɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam onse ɔ̃kwal bubu: «Taa-taa bam, okɛɛn mbuul wu oli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, ndɛ olɔ akaayɛɛ kwɛn ɔ̃kaal wu abekwaal ndɛ wu, oli ɔ̃kaal nga-ãbi!» <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel Ɔ̃falisaye bubu: «Simɔ̃, mɛ̃ ndi ye ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn yɛ.» Ɔ̃falisaye obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛɛn, Ɔ̃tee!»<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Baal buaal áli y'ebiin e mbuul ngɔmɔ̃. Mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel ásuɔɔn nzi bibi, wa buaal ásuɔɔn ɔ̃bvɛn wuwu nsa kuun. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Onge bɛn bɔ k'ákekoo k'afuru ebiin e bɔ wɛ, ngaa-nzi ombaal bɔ bvɛ. M'ãtsam ã yɛ, onse mbaal obɔ ange-buaal, wu àdzii ndɛ bibi wɛn?» <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Simɔ̃ obveel ndɛ ndiri: «M'ãtsam ã mɛ̃, olɔ ekal mbuul wu embaal ndɛ ebiin ki enduru olɔ.» Yeso oyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ li y'ɔ̃dzoo.»<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Obobɔ, Yeso okɔɔl ol'ɔ̃kaal ondɛ, bu alieel Simɔ̃ bubu: «Yɛ amwɛn ɔ̃kaal wu? Mɛ̃ nsam onse nzɔ a yɛ, yɛ ke wi mɛ̃ ãdza m'esuɔɔl ntaã wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ, ndɛ obueel ntaã e mɛ̃ m'ãnsia ã ndɛ, bvool oyieel yɔ me mfu e ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Yɛ ke buun mɛ̃ wɛ, ndɛ mbuul wɛn, mwɛn esam mɛ̃ ŋã, ndɛ k'ayɔɔl k'abuun ntaã e mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Yɛ ke pwɛɛ mɛ̃ ãnasi m'ɔ̃tswɛ wɛ. Ndɛ mbuul wu pwɛɛ mɛ̃ mɔ̃ me ntaã. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, okɛɛn ndɛ osuo dzii li enɛn li, me ndɔɔ yɛn adzeel boo-boo li ãbi ã ndɛ. Mbuul wɛn adzeel ãbi ã ndɛ kɛn etsi-tsiri, ndɛ asuo dzii hɛ̃ kɛn etsi-tsiri.» <verse eid="LUK 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Yeso bu ayɛɛn y'ɔ̃kaal ondɛ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn adzeel ãbi ã yɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Baal b'abvi nsɛn ke misa ye ndɛ, abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Mbuul wu nã ali, kwɛn ndɛ asa ãmbɛɛ̃ m'adzeel ãbi ã baal?» <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Kɛn a Yeso olieel ɔ̃kaal ondɛ bubu: «Okiool o yɛ obvuul yɛ. Yi ngesɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Akaal b'ákewuaal a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1-2" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyɛn onse bviil bwɛn a bviil, y'ola bwɛn ola. Okɔ, ndɛ áketee bvool áketsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Okwɛn o Nziã. Antam ange-kuun ye buaal, y'akaal ke kwɛ áli ye ndɛ. Akaal obɔ bɛn tsɔɔn Yeso ábvuul bɔ m'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi y'ãluu. Ãnkuũ ã bɔ mɔ̃ bu: Mali wu abeta me Mali wa Magadala, wu épaal Yeso ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi nsiaan onse ndɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />ye Dzane wu ɔ̃kal a Swudza, ngɔmɔ̃ onse asal b'áketal ãndɔɔ ã nzɔ a Elode, ye Sidzaã, y'akaal akyam boo-boo. Bɔ ákewuaal a Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ m'opfel o bɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a ɔ̃kwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Baal afi m'ãbviil m'ãbviil, bu ayi ola Yeso. Onge bɛn embuul e baal bibi ébvɔɔn, ndɛ oti mboo yi: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />«Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ oyɛn oyekwɛn nsia onse ãnguun ã ndɛ. Me lio li ékeyiri ndɛ yɔ, yinkyɛ ebvi nkal a nkuul. Baal adzieel yɔ, bvool anywɛn ayedza yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Nsia yinkyɛ ebvi onse nsie yi eli y'ãnkɔɔn. Yɔ emɛn, kɛn a yɔ k'eyiil m'okɛɛ wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn nsie k'éli ye bwal wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Nsia yinkyɛ bvool ebvi onse ɛ̃ti mi ãnsiɛɛn. Yɔ emɛn nkuul ngamɔ̃ y'ɛ̃ti omyɛ̃. Myɛ̃ bu ɛ̃foo ekwɛn obvɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Kɛn a nsia yinkyɛ bvool ebvi nkal a nsie yi ngesɛ. Yɔ emɛn, bvool eburu. Ekwɛn ɔ̃mɔ̃-ɔ̃mɔ̃ eburu nsia ɔ̃nkam.» Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso obiool ndiri: «Yɔɔl kwɛn wa y'ãtswi m'ayoo, ayoo!»<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otsɛn b'ebeyɛɛn Yeso m'ãmboo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Ayio a Yeso afuul ndɛ bubu: «Otsɛn o mboo oyɔ omã?» <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Nziã osi kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãli m'elwɔɔn, m'ãtal Okwɛn o Nziã. Kɛn ola baal bakyɛ, bɔ ayoo mɔ̃ m'ãmboo me ndɔɔ yɛn:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">“Bɔ atal, ki amwɛn pyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 8:10">bɔ ayoo, otsɛn okwaal wɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Edz 6.9</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otsɛn o mboo a ɔ̃kwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />«Otsɛn o mboo oyɔ bɔ bu: Ekwɛn eli Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Ndɔɔ a nsia yi ebvi nkal a nkuul, esuo baal bɛn, ŋ'eyoo bɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ Ɔ̃pfu oyi, bu ambaal lɔ onse ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi asa kwɛn bɔ abee lɔ okiool, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ bɔ hɛ̃ abee obvuul. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Ndɔɔ a nsia yi ebvi nkal nsie y'eli y'ãnkɔɔn, esuo baal bɛn, ŋ'eyoo bɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã, bɔ akiool lɔ y'esɛ. Kɛn a bɔ k'ayɔɔl lɔ elɔ ɛ̃dza wɛ, bɔ akiool lɔ kɛn a me lio etsi-tsiri. Me lio li eyi ãmpal onse bɔ, bɔ k'abekiool lɔ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Ndɔɔ a nsia yi ebvi onse ɛ̃ti mi ãnsiɛɛn, esuo baal bɛn, ŋ'eyoo bɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã, lɔ k'eburu nsia yi eyel onse bɔ wɛ, me ndɔɔ ãtsam, y'opfel, y'efua bvi ɔ̃kiri, bvi efoo lɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ndɔɔ a nsia yi ebvi me nsie yi ngesɛ, esuo baal bɛn, ŋ'eyoo bɔ Endɔɔ e Nziã, ayɔɔ lɔ onse ɛ̃kwal mi ngesɛ, bvool mi kal-a-kal. Bɔ akwee lɔ y'osɛ-mwiĩ bueel, bu aburu nsia.»<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a mbunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mak 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />«Mbuul andɛɛl mbunda, k'akoo k'apfeel ndɛ kantin wɛ, wuo k'akoo k'asuul ndɛ ke nsɛn a ntal wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ andɔɔl ndɛ ke ywel a misa, kwɛn baal b'asam onse nzɔ amwɛn kal-a-kal. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãli m'odziɔɔn ã̀mɔɔn. Ãndɔɔ mbueel mɛn baal k'ayɛɛ wɛ, àyɛɛ mɔ̃, bvool ã̀pal kal-a-kal. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ekal y'onkyab m'emfa ki eyoo byɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu oli y'eluɔ, àlweel ndɛ bvikyɛ. Kɛn a wu oywɛn eluɔ, àwɛɛl ndɛ onkyam ki etsi-tsiri ki ebetsam ndɛ ndiri ndɛ amaabɔɔ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeso ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri: Baal b'adzii k'abɔɔ Endɔɔ e mɛ̃ otsɛn, Nziã alweel bɔ oyɛɛ b'Endɔɔ e ndɛ.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngoo ye baan-ngoo a Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mak 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Ngoo ye baan-ngoo a Yeso ayi ola ndɛ. Kɛn a bɔ k'akoo k'amwɛɛn ye ndɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ embuul. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Obobɔ, ayɛɛn Yeso ndiri: «Ngoo ye baan-ngoo a yɛ ali onkwel-a-nzi: Bɔ adzii k'amwɛn yɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Kɛn a ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ngoo ye baan-ngoo a mɛ̃ ali baal b'ayoo Endɔɔ a Nziã, bvool alweel lɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso otɛɛl mfel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso osam onse ebɛɛ y'ayio a ndɛ. Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Ebwel ongwel a nzal!» Bɔ bu ayɛn. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Me lio li eyii etsiil bɔ, Yeso olaal twal. Enseel oŋɔ̃, mfel ndyam wa kokɔ obvi opob me nzal. Ebɛɛ ebɛɛn oluul m'ãdza, bvool esiil etsi-tsiri kwɛn bɔ adziin.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Ayio asyel tsotsoo a Yeso, aseel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, Mfam, siool, bia-byɛ olɔ ekwii!» Ndɛ osiool, opɛɛn mfel y'epoo, ndiri: «Ebva mfyɛ!» Obobɔ, mfel ofi, empoo hɛ̃ efi, ɔ̃lii bu abvi. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ndɛ bu alieel ayio ndiri: «Okiool o byɛ abɔ?» Buɔ obɔɔ bɔ, ɛ̃kam hɛ̃ ɛ̃si bɔ. Bɔ bu abvi ofuul bam-a-bam ndiri: «Wu mbuul wa bwɛn-a-bwɛn? Ndɛ apɛɛn mfel yi ãdza! Ãdza ãyoo ndɛ, mfel hɛ̃ oyoo ndɛ!»<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus apaise une tempête" file="DN00439b.tif" size="col" copy="Darwin Dunham, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="8.22-25" /><verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obvuul mbuul wu áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Yeso y'ayio a ndɛ atɔ ongwel a nzal k'ɔ̃kiri wu eli bviil li Ngelesa, wu oli nsɔɔ̃-a-nsɔɔ̃ a nsie yi Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Ŋ'epal Yeso onse ebɛɛ, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli onse bviil olɔ oyemwɛɛn ye ndɛ. Mbuul ondɛ áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. Etel émeeyiil ki éyii ebekal ndɛ kɛn odzuũ, bvool k'ákekal hɛ̃ onse nzɔ wɛ, ndɛ ákekal kɛn onse ãmpiɛɛn. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ Yeso, ndɛ obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a ndɛ, bvool obvi ɛ̃sɔɔl okuaal ndiri: «Yeso, Muaan a Nziã-a-Mpuu, yɛ ye mɛ̃ ndɔɔ mã? Mɛ̃ nduɔɔn yɛ, bee mɛ̃ mpal otuaal!» <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Ndɛ oyɛɛn obobɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn Yeso átam ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi k'apal onse ndɛ. Ãlio bibi, ɔ̃fel ondɛ ákesiin ndɛ. Obobɔ, baal ákekuru ndɛ mviɔɔl ye mviil m'ãmpaa, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ abee obal. Kɛn a ndɛ áketsiil mɔ̃, bvool ɔ̃fel ondɛ ákebiri ndɛ onse ɔ̃baan.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yeso ofuul mbuul ondɛ ndiri: «Nkuũ a yɛ nã?» Ndɛ obveel ndiri: «Nkuũ a mɛ̃ “Booboo”.» Ndɛ oyɛɛn obobɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃́li bibi onse ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Ɛ̃fel omyɛ̃ ɛ̃lɛɛn Yeso ndiri: «Mebee bee onse ywɛn e mbaa oyuɔɔl ndoo!»<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, éli y'ɔ̃kel wu anguru wu ákedza tsotsoo oŋɔ̃, ke ywel a nkio. Ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃lɛɛn Yeso ndiri: «Meyɔɔl bee emesam onse anguru ba!» Yeso bu awi myɛ̃ nkuul yi ayesam onse anguru. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Myɛ̃ bu ɛ̃pal onse mbuul ondɛ, ɛ̃yesam onse anguru. Obobɔ, anguru bam bueel akuul nzuru nkal a nkio, ayeyiool onse nzal, bu adziin onse yɔ.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Ŋ'emwɛn baal b'ákebuaal anguru emfa ki ebwel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ buɔ obɔɔ, bu abal. Bɔ ayɛn ayetsal nsia oyɔ onse bviil li Ngelesa y'ãla mã nku-a-nku a lɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Baal bu ayi ayetal ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel. Ŋ'etɔ bɔ tsotsoo a Yeso, bɔ ayebɔɔ mbuul wu epal ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi onse ndɛ abvi nsɛn ke nkwel a ndɛ wu Yeso, alaal ekɔ, amaabvool bam m'ombuul o ndɛ. Baal buɔ bu obɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Baal b'ámwɛn mbueel m'ã́bwel alieel bɔ emfa ki ábvuul mbuul wu áli y'ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, baal bam bueel ba nsie yi eli bviil li Ngelesa ayɛɛn Yeso ndiri apal onse nsie a bɔ, ayi lela, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ ayoo buɔ bam bibi. Obobɔ, Yeso osam onse ebɛɛ, bu abvool ongwel a nzal. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Mbuul wu épal ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi onse ndɛ oluɔɔn Yeso kwɛn oŋɔ̃ ndɛ ayi ye ndɛ. Kɛn a Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />«Bvool ola o yɛ, bvool liaal baal ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'esi Nziã yɛ!» Obobɔ, mbuul ondɛ oyebiool onse bviil lam lueel, ãndɔɔ m'esi Yeso ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obvuul ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃, bvool oseel muaan a Yayilus wu ɔ̃kaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Ŋ'ekɔɔl Yeso ongwel a nzal, embuul eyɔɔ ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ baal bam bueel ákekiaal ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Obobɔ, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Yayilus oyi ola ndɛ. Ndɛ áli mfam a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn. Ndɛ obvi ãbuo ke nkwel a Yeso, bvool oluɔɔn kwɛn ndɛ wu Yeso ayi nzɔ a ndɛ, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />ke ngwel wɛ ɔ̃ndɛɛl a ndɛ muaan ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal, wu áli me mvel nku-a-nku a kuun ye yuaal, ákekɔɔ ye lepfu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Ŋ'ékeyi Yeso okɔ, ɔ̃bɔbɔ a baal ádzii ndɛ, bvool mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ákeywɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Onse oŋɔ̃, éli y'ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli y'ãluu m'ékepal ãkel. Ãluu omɔ̃ ál'ãmaãyiil ye ndɛ mvel kuun ye yuaal. Ndɛ ál'amaatsal nzi yueel, me ndɔɔ yi ákeyi nzuru oboo ol'aboo. Kɛn a mbuul wu ákoo m'otɛɛl b'ãkel omɔ̃ k'áli wɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ol'Ayuda, oluu b'epal ãkel osa kwɛn mbuul akal ye mbiin ke nkwel a Nziã. Etal onse </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 15:25-33">Lev 15.25-33</ref></char>.</note> <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Ndɛ oyi ke mbee a Yeso, bvool onywɛn me nswɛɛ a ekɔ e ndɛ. Kɛn a me lio alili, ndɛ ãkel omɔ̃ ãtɛɛn. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yeso ofuul baal ndiri: «Wu onywɛn me mɛ̃ nã?» Baal bam bueel atwɛn ndiri bɔ k'anywɛn me ndɛ wɛ. Piɛɛl bu alieel Yeso ndiri: «Mfam, embuul mpii edzii yɛ bvool ebeywɛn yɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mbuul onywɛn me mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, mpɛn ngamɔ̃ epal onse mɛ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ omwɛn kwɛn amaayɛɛ ndɔɔ yi esi ndɛ. Y'etiɔɔl lam lueel, ndɛ oyebva ãbuo ke nkwel a Yeso. Ndɛ bu alieel Yeso ke nkwel a baal bam bueel otsɛn b'enywɛn ndɛ me ndɛ, y'emfa ki ebvuul ndɛ kɛn a me lio alili. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Muaan a mɛ̃, okiool o yɛ obvuul yɛ, yi ngesɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Kɛn a ŋ'ékeyɛɛn Yeso oŋɔ̃, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ ofi nzɔ a Yayilus, oyewa ndɛ nsia ndiri: «Muaan a yɛ mpii amaakwa, bee kɛn a Ɔ̃tee mpal yi ngwel obetuaal!» <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Ŋ'eyoo Yeso obobɔ, ndɛ olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Oyɛɛ ke kal ye buɔ wɛ, kal kɛn a y'okiool, muaan a yɛ àbvuul!»<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Ŋ'etɔ Yeso ke nzɔ a ndɛ wu Yayilus, ndɛ k'akiool kwɛn mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ asam onse nzɔ ye ndɛ wɛ. Wu ekiool ndɛ k'asam kɛn a Piɛɛl, ye Dzaã, ye Dzak, ye tal bwɛn a ngoo a muaan. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Baal bam bueel ákebool elel ki kokɔ, bvool áluul m'ãwua me ndɔɔ a muaan. Yeso bu ayɛɛn bɔ ndiri: «Ebee obelel! Ndɛ k'akwi wɛ, ndɛ kɛn a twal alaal.» <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Kɛn a baal abvi ndɛ osyob, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ ayɛɛ kwɛn muaan amaakwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Kɛn a Yeso osiin kuɔɔl e muaan, bvool oyɛɛn bam kokɔ ndiri: «Muaan, siool!» <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Kɛn a me lio alili, ndɛ ɔ̃fiaal okɔɔl, bu atɛɛn ɔ̃kiri. Yeso bu atam kwɛn awa ndɛ bvi-odza. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Tal ye ngoo a ndɛ ɛ̃kam ɛ̃bɔɔ bɔ. Kɛn a Yeso oluo bɔ k'ata mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ ɔ̃sam a ndɔɔ yi ebwel.<figure style="fig" alt="Guérison de la fille de Jaïros" file="WA03826b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="8.49-56" /><verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yeso oyuɔɔl antam ange-kuun ye buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso obvool antam a ndɛ ange-kuun ye buaal, bvool owi bɔ waan y'omfam b'atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel myam mvieel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi, ye b'aboo anga-ãluu. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Ndɛ otam bɔ k'ayetsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Okwɛn o Nziã, bvool m'oyeboo anga-ãluu. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Ŋ'èyi byɛ dzwɛ, ebee eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ obiri, ekal ɔ̃mpaã, ekal ɔ̃paa, ekal mampa, ekal nzi. Wu a biri ɛ̃nkuru mviaal pyɛ! <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ŋɛn ayɔɔ byɛ onse nzɔ ngamɔ̃, ekal kɛn onse nzɔ oyɔ tiil ye k'embal byɛ ola obɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />K'ola b'abee byɛ oyɔɔ, epal onse bɔ. Ŋ'eyii epal byɛ, ekweel ɔ̃fel a ntaã e byɛ. Okyɛ èkal eliĩ ki esuo kwɛn bɔ asi obibi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Antam bu ayɛn. Onse ãla mam mbueel m'ékebwel bɔ, bɔ áketsal Nsia yi Ngesɛ, bvool ákebvuul baal ba y'ãluu.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buɔ b'Elode me ndɔɔ a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Elode Antipas wu áli ɔ̃kwɛn k'etswi e nsie ki Ngalile oyoo nsia a ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'ã́kebwel. Ndɛ ebɔɔ e nsie bu edziɔɔn. Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ondɛ Dzaã Batis osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Eli, mbuul wu oyebvool!» Bakyɛ bvool ákeyɛɛn ndiri: «Ngɔmɔ̃ onse aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ba tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn, mbuul wu osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Kɛn Elode ákeyɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: «Mɛ̃ mpii étsiil Dzaã Batis ɔ̃tswɛ. Ke mbuul wu ebeyoo mɛ̃ nsia a ndɛ, m'ãndɔɔ m'ɛ̃kam m'ebesa ndɛ, bvool nã?» Obobɔ, ndɛ oyii abii k'amwɛn Yeso.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oliil baal amiil ataan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Antam abvool ola Yeso, bu alieel ndɛ mam mbueel m'esi bɔ. Obobɔ, Yeso olieel bɔ ndiri ayi ye ndɛ me pyɛ lela ye baal, m'etswi ki bviil li ata me Betesayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Kɛn a ŋ'eyoo baal nsia yi eyɛn bɔ, bɔ anɔɔn a ndɛ. Ndɛ oyɔɔ bɔ, oyɛɛn bɔ ãndɔɔ m'Okwɛn o Nziã, bvool oboo anga-ãluu b'áli ye kɔɔ li obvuul. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Ŋ'eyii ekwal bviil, antam ange-kuun ye buaal asyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, bvool alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Bveel baal ba, kwɛn bɔ ayi onse ãla y'ãŋaan m'ãli m'opal ba, me ndɔɔ yi ayebii bvi-odza, y'ãmboo m'ala twal. Ke ngwel wɛ, bia-byɛ ŋã eli nkal ɔ̃baan.» <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Ewa bɔ bvi-odza byam!» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee eli kɛn a y'amampa ataan y'answi buaal. Bee eyesuun bvi-odza, me ndɔɔ yi eliil olɔɔ o baal ba bueel?» <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Nzal-a-ŋɛn, onse baal b'áli oŋɔ̃, abɔɔl áli nku-a-nku amiil ataan. Yeso bu alieel ayio a ndɛ ndiri: «Emviaal baal nsɛn m'ãnkel m'ãnkel, nkel ngamɔ̃ baal sua ãku-ãtaan.» <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Antam asi obobɔ, bu amvieel baal bam bueel nsɛn. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Yeso bu awel amampa ange-ataan y'answi ange-buaal. Ndɛ oseel mviil ke ywel, obuɛɛn kwɛn Nziã andɔɔl bɔ kuɔɔl. Ndɛ otsiil bɔ, bu awi ayio bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi akab baal bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Baal bam bueel bu adzi ayool. Bɔ abiri etswel-etswel bvi ésiil m'etsaka kuun ye bviaal.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus rassasie une foule (les disciples ramassent les restes)" file="WA03856b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="9.16-17" /><verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piɛɛl olieel ndiri Yeso oli Mãsia</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Mak 8.27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso ákebuɛɛn me pyɛ, ayio a ndɛ áli oŋɔ̃. Ndɛ ofuul bɔ bubu: «Baal abeyɛɛn ndiri mɛ̃ nã ndi?» <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Bɛn ndiri yɛ Dzaã Batis, bɛn ndiri yɛ Eli. Bakyɛ bvool ndiri yɛ li ngɔmɔ̃ onse aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã ba tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn, wu osiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi.» <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Yeso bu afuul bɔ ndiri: «Ke byɛ, byɛ eyɛɛn wɛn mɛ̃ nã ndi?» Piɛɛl obveel ndiri: «Yɛ li Mãsia wu eyuɔɔl Nziã!»<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yeso bu awi bɔ ãnkunkwa mam bibi kwɛn bɔ mbuul ndɔɔ oyɔ oliaal wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Ndɛ olweel bubu: «Ebvaan kwɛn Muaan a mbuul amwɛn mpal yam boo-boo. Akuul-kuul b'Ayuda, y'amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã, y'ayiool b'ãngel àtiɔ ndɛ eboo. Àbam ndɛ, kɛn a me tsoo li ãtyel, ndɛ àsiool.»<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emfa ki aluɛɛn a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel baal bam bueel bubu: «Okɛɛn mbuul odzii k'aluɛɛn a mɛ̃, ebvaan ndɛ abee elaã e ndyam bvool obesiɔɔl. Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, ndɛ ebvaan abiri enkulusu e ndɛ, bvool aluɛɛn a mɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu odzii k'abvuul elaã e ndɛ, ndɛ àywɛn a lɔ. Kɛn a mbuul wu àywɛn elaã e ndɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, wu àbɔɔ elaã li taa-taa. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Ŋɛn mbuul obɔɔ opfel b'ɔ̃kiri a nsie ndyam wueel, bvel emã li ebɔɔ ndɛ, okɛɛn ndyam oywɛn elaã wuo obiil lɔ? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Okɛɛn mbuul oyoo opfuru me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, wuo me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ ã mɛ̃, mɛ̃ wu Muaan a mbuul hɛ̃ ekieel eyoo opfuru me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, ŋ'ekieel eya mɛ̃ onse okwɛn o mɛ̃, b'oli okwɛn o Taal, y'ãnzwel m'ɔ̃nsensal. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ kwɛn onse ŋã, eli ye baal bakyɛ bɛn k'àkwa wɛ, ye k'emwɛn bɔ Okwɛn o Nziã.»<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oswɛɛl emfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ke mpuɔ̃ abwɛn m'eyɛɛn Yeso ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ onɔɔn nkal a nkio ye Piɛɛl, ye Dzaã ye Dzak, me ndɔɔ yi abuɛɛn. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ŋ'eyii ebuɛɛn ndɛ, osu o ndɛ oswɛɛl emfa, ekɔ e ndɛ hɛ̃ eyii kyam fuu bvool ebvi onyɛɛn. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Pfa! Baal buaal abvi ombwɔɔ ye ndɛ. Éli Moyize y'Eli. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Bɔ ákenyɛɛn me mbaa yi efi ola Nziã. Ɔ̃sam wu éketa bɔ ye ndɛ átal dzwɛ li ékeyi ndɛ okwa ke Yelusalem, m'ombɛɛl b'ɔ̃sal.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Piɛɛl ye b'áli ye ndɛ ayiool me twal lam bɔɔ. Ŋ'esiool bɔ, bɔ amwɛn Yeso ye baal ange-buaal onse mbaa yi efi ola Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Me lio lɛn Moyize y'Eli ayii asiil Yeso, Piɛɛl olieel ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, okal ŋã y'obvie! Etuu asɛɛ atyel: ngɔmɔ̃ wa yɛ, ngɔmɔ̃ wa Moyize, ngɔmɔ̃ wu Eli.» Kɛn a Piɛɛl k'ábɔɔ b'ékeyɛɛn ndyam otsɛn wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Me lio li ékeyɛɛn ndɛ, epɛn eyefoo bɔ. Obobɔ, ayio buɔ bo kokɔ obɔɔ bɔ, ŋ'esam bɔ onse epɛn. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Nkii ngamɔ̃ eyɛɛn fa onse epɛn, bu eyɛɛn ndiri: «Wu bu Muaan a mɛ̃ wu asueel: Eyoo ndɛ!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">Edz 42.1</ref></char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Ŋ'eman nkii oyɔ oyɛɛn, Yeso osiil ndyam sii. Ayio aweel pi, bvool me lio olɔ, bɔ k'ati mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ ɔ̃sam wu ãndɔɔ m'emwɛn bɔ wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obvuul muaan ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli y'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ela esiool, Yeso y'ayio ange-atyel asool ke ywel a nkio. Baal boo-boo ayemwɛɛn ye ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Onse baal obɔ, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ obiool bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, mɛ̃ mbuɛɛn yɛ, mewuaal a mɛ̃ muaan wu bɔɔl wu! Mɛ̃ ndɛ ɔ̃kyam pyɛ! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Lio bwɛn a lio, ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi abesiin ndɛ. Oŋɔ̃, me lio olɔ, muaan obvi ɛ̃sɔɔl ota, obvi okwa swii-swii, bvool ãfel ãbvi opal k'ɔ̃nywã. Ɔ̃fel ondɛ abepeel ndɛ kɛn a ke mbee a ŋ'emeetuaal ndɛ muaan mpal yam bibi. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mɛ̃ nduɔɔn ayio a yɛ m'otswɛɛl b'ɔ̃fel ondɛ, bɔ k'akoo wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yeso bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Byɛ baal b'abi! Byɛ eywɛn a okiool! Mɛ̃ èkal ye byɛ tiil mpuanki? Mɛ̃ èkuru ɔ̃kwal wu ekal ye byɛ tiil lio emã?» Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ olieel mbuul ondɛ bubu: «Oŋɔ̃ ya ye muaan!» <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Ŋ'etɔ muaan tsotsoo a Yeso, ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi odzweel muaan me nsie, bvool onziool ndɛ bam kokɔ. Kɛn a Yeso oyɛɛn ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi, obvuul muaan, bvool obveel ndɛ ola tal. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Baal bam bueel ongɛɛ obɔɔ me ndɔɔ a waan e Nziã li enɛn.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="LUK 9:43">Yeso bvool owi nsia yi èkwa ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Onge bɛn mbuul bwɛn a mbuul ákekam me ndɔɔ ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'ékesa Yeso, ndɛ olieel ayio a ndɛ bubu: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />«Eyoo ãndɔɔ m'eyɛɛn mɛ̃ byɛ ngesɛ: Akieel atiɔ Muaan a mbuul me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ mbaal.» <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Kɛn ayio k'ábɔɔ ndɔɔ oyɔ otsɛn wɛ. Álwɔɔn bɔ otsɛn o yɔ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ abee otsɛn o yɔ oyɛɛ. Bɔ hɛ̃ áli ye buɔ b'afuul Yeso yɔ.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu onduru bakyɛ nã?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ayio abvi otsuun bam-a-bam, me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛ wu onduru bakyɛ onse bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yeso oyɛɛ ãtsam m'ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ. Obobɔ, ndɛ owel muaan wu ɔ̃tsi-tsiri ngɔmɔ̃, osuul ndɛ tsotsoo a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Ndɛ bu alieel ayio ndiri: «Mbuul wu ayɔɔ muaan wu me nkuũ a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ ayɔɔ. Mbuul wu ayɔɔ mɛ̃, ŋ'ayɔɔ mbuul wu atam mɛ̃ hɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, wu onduru otsiaal onse byɛ, wu onduru bakyɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wɛn k'ali ɔ̃taal a byɛ wɛ, wa byɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Obobɔ, Dzaã olieel Yeso ndiri: «Mfam, bee emwɛn mbuul wu atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi me nkuũ a yɛ. Bee bu eluo ndɛ obobɔ osa, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ k'abenɔɔn a yɛ onse nkel a bee wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ebee ndɛ oluo k'asa obobɔ. Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wɛn k'ali ɔ̃taal a byɛ wɛ, ŋ'ali wa byɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ola ngɔmɔ̃ bo nsie yi Samali obee Yeso oyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ŋ'eyii ekoo lio li esiil Yeso ɔ̃kiri, ndɛ okuru bam kwɛn ebvaan ndɛ ayi Yelusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Ndɛ oyuɔɔl antam atsɔɔn nkwel a ndɛ. Bɔ bu ayɛn. Bɔ asam onse ola ngɔmɔ̃ bo nsie yi Samali, me ndɔɔ yi afaal ndɛ mboo yi ayɔɔ ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Kɛn a baal b'ola obɔ abee k'ayɔɔ ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ ákeyi Yelusalem. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Ŋ'emwɛn ayio a ndɛ, Dzak ye Dzaã, obobɔ, bɔ ayɛɛn ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, okɛɛn ye dzii, yɔɔl kwɛn bee eyɛɛn kwɛn nzyel àbva nkal a bɔ, bvool atsoo bɔ mbaa!»<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yeso okɔɔl otal bɔ, bu apɛɛn bɔ bam kokɔ. [«Byɛ k'eyɛɛ ɔ̃fel wu awa byɛ ãtsam m'emfa okyɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Muaan a mbuul k'ayi me ndɔɔ yi abam elaã baal wɛ, ndɛ oyi me ndɔɔ yi abvuul myɛ̃.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.56 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔ̃luo ondɛ k'ákel ndɛ onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>»] Bɔ bu ayɛn onse ola onkyam.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Emfa ki anɔɔn a Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Me lio li ékeyi bɔ, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ olieel Yeso ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ènɔɔn a yɛ k'ãmboo mam mbueel m'èyi yɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Ambwel ali y'ãywɛn m'akal, anywɛn hɛ̃ ali y'ãnzɔ. Kɛn a Muaan a mbuul k'ali ye mboo yi awuun wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Yeso olieel mbuul ɔ̃kyam bubu: «Luɛɛn a mɛ̃!» Kɛn a mbuul ondɛ obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, mewa mɛ̃ kɛn nkuul yi eyedziool mɛ̃ taal.» <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yeso bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Yɔɔl b'ákwi-ákwi adziool ebiĩ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.60 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ oyɔ edzii k'eyɛɛn ndiri: Ɔ̃sal a yɛ ke wu adziool b'amaakwa wɛ!</char></note>. Me b'otal yɛ, yi y'aliaal baal nsia yi Okwɛn o Nziã!»<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Mbuul wukyɛ bvool olieel Yeso ndiri: «Mfam, mɛ̃ nzii k'enɔɔn a yɛ. Kɛn a ŋ'ɛ̃kwel, mewa mɛ̃ nkuul kwɛn mɛ̃ yendɛɛl baal a nzɔ a mɛ̃.» <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Mbuul wu obɛɛn k'asal nguun, bvool otal mbee, k'abvaan k'asal me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Yeso otam ayio ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan ye buaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ke mbee ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, Mfam osueel ayio ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan ye buaal (72) akyam. Ndɛ bu atam bɔ me buaal a buaal, kwɛn bɔ atsɔɔn onse ãbviil y'ãla mam mbueel m'ékeyi ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Nsia eli bibi onse nguun, kɛn asal b'aka yɔ k'ali bibi wɛ. Eluɔɔn ola nga-nguun ayuɔɔl asal akyam bvool, m'oyeka o yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Eyi! Mɛ̃ ntam byɛ onge baan b'emɛmɛɛ̃ onse angɔ. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Ebee eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ obiri, ekal nzi, ekal ɔ̃paa, ekal asimpal. Ebee me nkuul oyiil me ndɔɔ yi ebio baal. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Ŋ'èsam byɛ onse nzɔ ngamɔ̃, ŋ'ɛ̃kwel ebio anga-yɔ wɛn: “Yɔɔl kwɛn opi okal ye baal a nzɔ yi!” <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Okɛɛn mbuul wu odzii opi akal onse nzɔ oyɔ, opi o byɛ òkal ye ndɛ. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, bɔ òkɔɔl ola byam. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Ekal onse nzɔ oyɔ, edza bvool enywã bvi àbuun byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ɔ̃sal ebvaan abɔɔ furu li ɔ̃sal a ndɛ. Ebee me nzɔ bwɛn a nzɔ obwel. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Onse bviil lam lueel li èsam byɛ, okɛɛn baal b'oŋɔ̃ ayɔɔ byɛ, edza bvi àbuun byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Eboo baal b'ali y'ãluu oŋɔ̃, bvool eyɛɛn baal bam bueel bubu: “Okwɛn o Nziã osyel tsotsoo a byɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Kɛn onse bviil lam lueel li èsam byɛ, okɛɛn baal b'oŋɔ̃ k'ayɔɔ byɛ wɛ, epal nkal abal-bal, bvool eyɛɛn baal bueel bubu: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />“Onkyam ɔ̃fel a bviil e byɛ wu ondɛɛl me ntaã e bee, bee ekweel ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ebveel byɛ ndɛ! Kɛn a byɛ ebvaan eyɛɛ kwɛn Okwɛn o Nziã osyel tsotsoo a byɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, fool li baal b'ola obɔ, ekieel enduru li baal ba Sodom.»<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãbviil m'ãbee Yeso okiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />«Ãwua ola yɛ, bviil li Koladzin! Ãwua ola yɛ, bviil li Betesayida! Ke ngwel wɛ, emwã bvi nsi mɛ̃ ola byɛ, okɛɛn mɛ̃ ési bvɛ ke Tiil ye Sidɔ̃, kɛn baal b'okɔ olɔ ákaalaal angɔrɔ, bvool ákaakel efuru me nzuru, me ndɔɔ yi asuo kwɛn bɔ akaal ɛ̃kwal! <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, fool li byɛ ekieel enduru li baal ba Tiil ye Sidɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Me b'otal yɛ, yɛ wu bviil li Kapelanahum, yɛ atsam kwɛn àndɛɛl yɛ tiil ke ywel? Mfya, Nziã akieel akweel yɛ tiil k'ola o b'ákwi-ákwi!» <verse eid="LUK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Yeso bvool olieel ayio a ndɛ ndiri: «Mbuul wu oyoo byɛ, wu oyoo mɛ̃. Mbuul wu otiɔ byɛ eboo, ŋ'atiɔ mɛ̃ hɛ̃ eboo. Mbuul wu otiɔ mɛ̃ eboo, ŋ'atiɔ wu atam mɛ̃ eboo hɛ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayio ange-ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan ye buaal ayebvool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Ayio ange-ɛ̃kuun-nsiaan ye buaal ayebvool. Bɔ aluul m'esɛ, bvool ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mfam, onkyam ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃lweel bee, me lio li eketswɛɛl bee myɛ̃ me nkuũ a yɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ekemwɛn k'efa Ɔ̃pfu ywel abva me nsie onge ɔ̃bɛɛn-a-nzyel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã, nkuũ a Ɔ̃pfu («diable» m'empuru) wu mfam a ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi yi ndyam eli «Satanas» me Ngelek («Satana» m'Engal, «Satan» m'empuru). M'emfa ki ekaal bee, bee eti ãnkuũ omɔ̃ ãnge-mbuaal («Satan» ye «diable») m'Ɔ̃pfu.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Etal! Mɛ̃ ngwi byɛ okwɛn b'edziaal antaal y'angiɛ̃-miin, ye b'enyam waan lam lueel li Ɔ̃pfu wu ɔ̃taal a bia-byɛ, eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ k'ekoo k'etuaal byɛ mpal wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Kɛn a byɛ ebee mpaa osia me ndɔɔ yɛn ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi ɛ̃lweel byɛ, esia mpaa me ndɔɔ yɛn Nziã amaaswɛn ãnkuũ ã byɛ ke ywel!»<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso osia mpaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Kɛn a me lio olɔ, Yeso oluul m'esɛ ki ewi Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal. Ndɛ olieel ndiri: «Taal, Mfam a ywel ye nsie, mɛ̃ mveel yɛ ãtuɛɛn, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ alwɔɔn ãndɔɔ mã ol'anga-ãyal ye baal b'ali y'ɛ̃nkaan. Kɛn a yɛ suo mɔ̃ ola baal b'ali onge baan b'abwee. Taa-taa Taal, yɛ ádzii kwɛn ekal obobɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Ndɛ bu alieel b'áli oŋɔ̃ ndiri: «Tal a mɛ̃ owi mɛ̃ eluɔ bvam bvieel. Mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ayɛɛ Muaan wɛ, okɛɛn ke Taal wɛ, mbuul hɛ̃ si ngɔmɔ̃ k'ayɛɛ Taal wɛ, okɛɛn ke Muaan wɛ. Kɛn a Muaan odzii k'asuo Taal ola baal bakyɛ, kwɛn bɔ hɛ̃ ayɛɛ ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso osɔɔn ayio a ndɛ, bu ayɛɛn kɛn a ye bɔ bubu: «Esɛ ola baal b'amwɛn ãndɔɔ m'emwɛn byɛ mã! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bibi y'akwɛn ba tsɔɔn ádzii k'amwɛn m'emwɛn byɛ, kɛn a bɔ k'ámwɛn mɔ̃ wɛ! Bɔ ádzii k'ayoo m'eyoo byɛ, kɛn a bɔ k'áyoo mɔ̃ wɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a Ɔ̃samalia wa ngesɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Ɔ̃yiool-ãngel ngɔmɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yi akie Yeso, oyefuul ndɛ ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, mɛ̃ bwɛn esa, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ mbɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu bwɛn ɔ̃bu?» <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Yeso obveel ndɛ bubu: «Onse ãngel ã Moyize, ákel ndiri emã? Yɛ mɔ̃ otsɛn bwɛn-a-bwɛn abekwaal?» <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Mbuul ondɛ obveel bubu: «Yɛ àdzii Mfam Nziã a yɛ m'ɔ̃kwal a yɛ ndyam wueel, m'elaã e yɛ lam lueel, me mpɛn a yɛ yam yueel, m'ãtsam ã yɛ mam mbueel. Yɛ àdzii ngaburu-mbuul onge b'edzii yɛ nzuru a yam<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Det 6.5</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Obobɔ, Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ bveel ngesɛ. Sa obobɔ, yɛ olɔ bɔɔ elaã.» <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kɛn a onge bɛn ɔ̃yiool-ãngel odzii k'abɔɔ ɔ̃dzoo, ndɛ obveel Yeso ndiri: «Taa-taa! Ke ngamburu-mbuul a mɛ̃ nã?»<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yeso bu abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, mbuul áfi Yelusalem, ákeyi Dzeliko. Edzyal esiin ndɛ, ewɛɛl ndɛ eluɔ bvam bvieel bvi éli a ndɛ, bvool epfel ndɛ ɔ̃dzii. Bvɛ bu esiin nkuul eyɛn li bam, esiil ndɛ ɔ̃kwa-akwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, ngaa-a-Nziã ngɔmɔ̃ ákebwel me nkuul oyɔ. Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ mbuul ondɛ, ndɛ obwel me pyɛ, bu ayɛn li ndyam. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Emfa kiki, ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ wa nzɔ a Nziã otɔ ke mboo oyɔ, omwɛn mbuul ondɛ, oswɛɛl nkuul, bu ayɛn li ndyam. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Kɛn Ɔ̃samalia ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákebwel m'olɔ, atɔ oŋɔ̃, omwɛn mbuul ondɛ, ndɛ nyiĩ a ndɛ bu ebɔɔ yam bibi. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Ndɛ osyel tsotsoo a ndɛ, olɔ mbaal ye mbal kal ãbwɔɔ ã ndɛ, bu akuru ndɛ mɔ̃ m'ɛ̃pa mi ekɔ. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ondɔɔl ndɛ nkal a nyam a ndɛ, bvool bu abiri ndɛ ke nzɔ a anzii. Okɔ, ndɛ oboo ndɛ ngesɛ-ngesɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ela esiool, ndɛ opaal nzi yuaal yi ãbvieel. Owi yɔ ola nga-nzɔ oyɔ, bvool oyɛɛn ndɛ bubu: “Boo mɛ̃ mbuul wu ngesɛ. Ŋɛn yɛ tsal nzi nkyam me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, myam mbuul wu efuru yɛ yɔ, me lio li èbvool mɛ̃ me li.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbuul wu apfel ɔ̃dzii, ye ngaa-a-Nziã y'ɔ̃sal wa nzɔ a Nziã, b'eyɛɛn Yeso onse mboo yi, ali Ayuda. Ayuda y'Asamalia éli y'eka. Ɔ̃yiool-ãngel al'olɔ k'atsam ndiri Ɔ̃samalia olɔ koo k'awal mbuul wu abɛɛl ondɛ onge ngamburu-mbuul a ndɛ wɛ.</char></note>”»<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Ŋ'eman Yeso mboo oyɔ ota, ndɛ ofuul ɔ̃yiool-ãngel ondɛ ndiri: «M'ãtsam ã yɛ, onse baal ange-atyel obɔ, wu owel mbuul wu epfel edzyal ɔ̃dzii onge ngamburu-mbuul a ndɛ nã?» <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ɔ̃yiool-ãngel obveel ndiri: «Eli mbuul wu osi ndɛ obvɛ ondɛ.» Obobɔ, Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yi, sa hɛ̃ obobɔ!»<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ola Maate ye Mali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Ŋ'éli Yeso me nkuul y'ayio a ndɛ, ndɛ osam onse ola ngɔmɔ̃. Ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Maate oyɔɔ ndɛ onse nzɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Ndɛ áli ye mvɔɔl wu ɔ̃kaal wɛn nkuũ Mali. Ndɛ wu Mali oyebva nsɛn ke mviil ɛ̃ Mfam, bu abvi ãtee ã ndɛ oyoo. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, Maate ákefel y'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ nzɔ ndyam. Ndɛ osyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bvool oyɛɛn ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, k'esa yɛ mpal wɛ kwɛn mvɔɔl a mɛ̃ oyɔɔl mɛ̃ ebefel y'ɔ̃sal myam sii? Oŋɔ̃, meyɛɛn ndɛ ayewuaal a mɛ̃!» <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Mfam obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Maate, Maate, yɛ atuaal nzuru mpal m'ãtsam y'ãndɔɔ m'emfa bwɛn emfa. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Ndɔɔ kɛn a ngamɔ̃ eli y'ɔ̃bvɛn: Mali osueel ndɔɔ yi ngesɛ, yɛn k'akoo k'ambaal ndɛ yɔ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Yeso oyiool ayio a ndɛ emfa ki abuɛɛn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat 6.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso ákebuɛɛn ke mboo ngamɔ̃. Ŋ'eman ndɛ obuɛɛn, ɔ̃yio a ndɛ ngɔmɔ̃ olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, yiool bee hɛ̃ emfa ki abuɛɛn, onge b'eyiool Dzaã ayio a ndɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yeso olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ eboobuɛɛn, eyɛɛn wɛn:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">“Tal a bee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">yɔɔl nkuũ a yɛ ekal ye nsia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri baal ayɛɛ kwɛn Nziã oli ɔ̃nsensal, bvool alweel yɔ.</char></note>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:2">yɔɔl Okwɛn o yɛ oya!<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Wa bee tsoo bwɛn a tsoo bvi-odza bvi ekoo me ndɔɔ a bee!<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Dzeel ãbi ã bee,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">onge b'edzeel bee hɛ̃ b'asi bee obi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 11:4">Oyɛɛ ke yɔɔl kwɛn bee ebva m'ɔ̃mbio wɛ!”»<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yeso bvool olieel bubu: «Emeeyoo ndɔɔ yi: Okɛɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ oli ye ndoo: Nkal a kuku, ndoo ondɛ oyi oyeluɔɔn ola ndɛ ndiri: “Ndoo a mɛ̃, suɔɔn mɛ̃ nsuɔ tyel. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ndoo a mɛ̃ wukyɛ ofi odzuu, oyi ola mɛ̃. Kɛn a mɛ̃ ke ndi ye ki ebuun ndɛ wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Ŋɛn, nga-ndoo wu amaasam nzɔ, obveel ndɛ onse mwiĩ okɔ ndiri: “Yɔɔl mɛ̃ nkal pi, mɛ̃ emeewɔɔl nzɔ, mɛ̃ ye baan eyii me twal: Mɛ̃ ke nkoo k'ebesiool, me ndɔɔ yi ewa yɛ nsuɔ wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Obobɔ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ k'atɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi ayewa ndɛ yɔ me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ oli ndoo a ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ olɔ otɛɛn oyewa ndɛ bvi esɔɔ ndɛ, me ndɔɔ ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ a nga-ndoo ondɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Ebesɔɔ, àwa byɛ. Ebebii, byɛ èbɔɔ. Ebebɛɛl nzɔ, àdzweel byɛ yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu abesɔɔ, abewa ndɛ. Mbuul wu abebii, abebɔɔ. Mbuul wu abebɛɛl nzɔ, abedzweel ndɛ yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ondɛ tal nã wɛn muaan asɔɔ nswi ola ndɛ, ndɛ owi ndɛ ntaal ke mboo a nswi? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Wuo, ndɛ asɔɔ bi ola ndɛ, ndɛ owi ndɛ ngiɛ̃-miin? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Okɛɛn byɛ baal b'abi eyɛɛ k'ewa baan a byɛ eluɔ bvi ngesɛ, bvel-bvel Tal a byɛ wa ke ywel hɛ̃ àwa Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal ola baal b'asɔɔ ndɛ ola ndɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso atswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi me waan e Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, Yeso átswɛɛl ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi wu ákesuul mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ nkɛn. Ŋ'epal ɔ̃fel onse nkɛn ondɛ, mbuul ondɛ obvi oyɛɛn, embuul ki éli oŋɔ̃ ekam bibi. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Kɛn a baal bakyɛ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Mpɛn yi ebetswɛɛl ndɛ ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi yi ewi Beledzebul wu mfam a ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi!» <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Bakyɛ bvool atam ndɛ k'asa eliĩ ki esuo kwɛn ndɛ ofi ola Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi akie ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Kɛn onge bɛn Yeso ákeyɛɛ ãtsam ã bɔ, ndɛ oyɛɛn bɔ ndiri: «Okɛɛn baal b'okwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ adzwaan bam-a-bam, okwɛn obɔ obva, bvool ãnzɔ ã bɔ ãbva yɛn nkal a yɛn. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />M'emfa kiki, okɛɛn Ɔ̃pfu adzwaan ye ndyam, okwɛn o ndɛ otɛɛn bwɛn a bwɛn? Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ etɔ me mɛ̃ oyɛɛn wɛn, mɛ̃ wu etswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi me mpɛn yi ewa Beledzebul wu mfam ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Okɛɛn mpɛn yi etswɛɛl mɛ̃ ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi yi ewa Beledzebul mɛ̃, k'ayio a byɛ, bɔ myɛ̃ me mpɛn a nã abetswɛɛl? Obɔ otsɛn bɛn bɔ k'àwa byɛ ɔ̃dzoo wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Onge bɛn mɛ̃ etswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi me mpɛn a Nziã, ŋ'esuo kwɛn Okwɛn o Nziã oyi ola byɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Ŋ'ekiaal mbuul a mpɛn bvool wu li y'ãta nzɔ a ndɛ, eluɔ e ndɛ k'awal bvɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Okɛɛn mbuul wu onduru ndɛ mpɛn oyedzwaan ye ndɛ, bvool obvel ndɛ, mbuul ondɛ awɛɛl nga-mpɛn ondɛ ãta m'eketa ndɛ kaã me mɔ̃, bu akab opfel o ndɛ.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nga-mpɛn wu eyɛɛn Yeso ŋã, eli Ɔ̃pfu, wu bvel mpɛn eli ndyam wu Yeso.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Mbuul wɛn k'ali ye mɛ̃ wɛ, ɔ̃taal a mɛ̃ ali. Mbuul hɛ̃ wɛn k'abvool baal ye mɛ̃ wɛ, wu atsal.»<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obvool b'ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mat 12.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />«Ŋɛn ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi opal onse mbuul, ndɛ ayi ayebii mboo yi awuun onse ɔ̃baan wa kɛɛ-kɛɛ. Ndɛ okɛɛn k'abɔɔ yɔ wɛ, ndɛ ayɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Mɛ̃ èbvool onse nzɔ yi epal mɛ̃ onse yɔ tsɔɔn.” <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Ŋ'ebvool ndɛ, ndɛ oyebɔɔ yɔ amaakuɔɔn, bvool amaafaal eluɔ ngesɛ-ngesɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Obobɔ, ndɛ akɔɔl ayebii ɛ̃fel ɛ̃kyam nsiaan mi ɛ̃nduru ndɛ obi. Ndɛ abiri myɛ̃, ɛ̃yesam onse nzɔ oyɔ. Elaã e mbuul ondɛ enduru li eli tsɔɔn me fool.»<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esɛ ola baal b'ayoo Endɔɔ e Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Me lio li ékeyɛɛn Yeso obobɔ, ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal obiool ndɛ ndiri: «Esɛ ol'ɔ̃kaal wu ábiri yam e yɛ, bvool áwi yɛ ãbiaal!» <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Kɛn a Yeso obveel bubu: «Esɛ ndoo ola baal b'ayoo Endɔɔ e Nziã, bvool alweel lɔ!»<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obee k'asuo eliĩ</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Me lio li edzii embuul Yeso, ndɛ obvi baal oyɛɛn ndiri: «Baal ba lio li ali baal b'abi-abi: Bɔ abii eliĩ ki esuo kwɛn wu oyuɔɔl mɛ̃ Nziã, k'eli y'eliĩ ekyam ki asuo bɔ wɛ, eliĩ ki asuo bɔ kɛn a ki Dzonas. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Taa-taa bam, emfa ngemɔ̃ kyɛn Dzonas áli eliĩ me ndɔɔ a baal a Ninibve, emfa kiki hɛ̃, Muaan a mbuul àkal eliĩ me ndɔɔ a baal ba lio li. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, ɔ̃kwɛn wu ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃kiri wa Seba akieel atɛɛn, me ndɔɔ yi afɛn baal ba lio li, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áfi lela me ndɔɔ yi ayeyoo ãndɔɔ m'ékeyɛɛn Salomɔ̃ y'ãyal. Etal, ŋã eli ye mburu wu onduru Salomɔ̃<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɔ̃kwɛn wa Seba afɛn bɔ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ abee k'ayoo Yeso.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Me tsoo li ekieel etsiil Nziã ãndɔɔ ã baal, Baal ba Ninibve akieel atɛɛn me ndɔɔ yi afɛn baal ba lio li, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ ákaal ɛ̃kwal ke mbee ãtee ã Dzonas. Etal, ŋã eli ye wu onduru Dzonas.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baal ba Ninibve afɛn bɔ, ke ngwel wɛ ŋ'eyoo bɔ Yeso, bɔ k'aswɛɛl ɛ̃kwal wɛ.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbunda a nzuru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />«Mbuul andɛɛl mbunda, k'akoo k'alwɔɔn ndɛ wɛ, wuo k'akoo k'apfeel ndɛ saan wɛ. Kɛn a ndɛ andɔɔl ndɛ ke ywel a misa, kwɛn baal b'asam onse nzɔ amwɛn kal-a-kal. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Mviil ã yɛ hɛ̃ ãli mbunda a nzuru a yɛ: Okɛɛn mviil ã yɛ ãli ngesɛ, nzuru a yɛ yam yueel hɛ̃ eli onse okal-a-kal. Kɛn a ŋɛn mviil ã yɛ ãli ãbi-ãbi, nzuru a yɛ yam yueel hɛ̃ eli onse empeel. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Obobɔ, kal y'onkyab, kwɛn okal-a-kal b'oli onse yɛ obee empeel okɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />M'emfa okyɛ, okɛɛn nzuru a yɛ yam yueel eli onse okal-a-kal, epie si emɔ̃ onse empeel pyɛ, yɔ yam yueel èkal onse okal-a-kal, onge me lio li ebeyɛɛl mbunda yɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afalisaye y'ayiool b'ãngel ali baal ba nzɛɛn-yuaal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Me lio li ékeyɛɛn Yeso, Ɔ̃falisaye ngɔmɔ̃ oti ndɛ mbel, me ndɔɔ yi ayedza ola ndɛ. Yeso osam onse nzɔ a ndɛ bvool owel mboo m'odza. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ɔ̃falisaye okam ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ kwɛn Yeso k'asuɔɔl mviɔɔl wɛ ye k'edza ndɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ol'Afalisaye, osuɔɔl o mviɔɔl éli eliĩ ki okal tsɛtsɛ, m'emfa ki ɛ̃kiri ɛ̃ bɔ.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Mfam olieel ndɛ bubu: «Byɛ b'Afalisaye ebesuɔɔl mbiɔ ye saan onkwel-a-nzi, kɛn a onse ɛ̃kwal, byɛ eluul m'emfua e pfuul ye ki osa b'obi! <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Ewool e baal! Eyɛɛ ngesɛ kwɛn Nziã wu ási ãnzuru ã byɛ, oli hɛ̃ wu ási amwiĩ a byɛ!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.40 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeso ŋã odzii k'asuo ndiri Nziã odzii kwɛn nzuru wuo ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ mbuul, ãtsam ã mbuul wuo lelaã e ndɛ, bvieel ebvaan ekal tsɛtsɛ.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ekab aywal eluɔ bvi eli onse ãmbiɔ y'asaan a byɛ, obobɔ, ãndɔɔ ã byɛ mbueel ãkal dzu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Emfa ekyam ki akwaal otsɛn o ndɔɔ oyɔ kyɛ bu: Ekab aywal ɔ̃kwal ngɔmɔ̃, ke me ndɔɔ yɛn baal atal byɛ wɛ.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Ãwua ola byɛ b'Afalisaye! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ebembaal Nziã boo ngemɔ̃ onse ãboo kuun m'eluɔ bvam bvieel bvi ekwɛn byɛ onse ãnguun, onkyam li ãsɔɔ m'ãwa bvi-odza ãkiin. Kɛn a byɛ ebedzɛɛn k'esa bakyɛ ãndɔɔ m'emfa ki dzu y'odzii o Nziã: Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ mɛn ebvaan byɛ ekeesa, m'ãsiil odzɛɛn wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Ãwua ola byɛ b'Afalisaye! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn edzii k'ebva nsɛn k'ãmboo mã nkwel, bvool byɛ hɛ̃ edzii kwɛn abio byɛ k'ãmboo m'ebvɔɔn baal. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Ãwua ola byɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ eli onge ãmpiɛɛn mɛn k'amwɛn wɛ, bvool mɛn baal k'ayɛɛ kwɛn bɔ ŋã ke ywel a mɔ̃ abedzuul wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Obobɔ, ɔ̃yiool-ãngel ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli oŋɔ̃ ofuul Yeso bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, ŋ'eyɛɛn yɛ obobɔ, yɛ oŋɔ̃ mpii bee ɛ̃tswɛ too hɛ̃!» <verse eid="LUK 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ãwua ola byɛ hɛ̃, byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ebewa baal ãpfuũ m'ãli ye mpal m'obiri, kɛn a byam k'edzii k'enywɛn a mɔ̃ si ekal m'ɔ̃liɛɛn wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Ãwua ola byɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ebeboo ãmpiɛɛn m'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, b'ábam bɔ ankiɔɔn a byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Byɛ ŋ'esuo kwɛn byɛ etuɛɛn m'ési ankiɔɔn a byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ ábam aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, bɛn byɛ b'eboo ãmpiɛɛn ã bɔ! <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, Nziã m'ãyal ã ndɛ, áyɛɛn ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ekieel eyuɔɔl baan b'Isalayel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn y'antam, bɔ akieel abam bakyɛ, atuaal bakyɛ fool.” <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Obobɔ, etsob èbva nkal a baal ba nonɔ̃ ba, me ndɔɔ aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã b'ábam-ábam bɛɛn k'ábuo ɔ̃kiri, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />fa obam b'Abɛl tiil bo Dzakali, wu ábam mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a nkiin yi awa Nziã ãkab ye Nzɔ a Nziã<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Obɛ 4.8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20-21">2Ãl 24.20-21</ref></char></note>. Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn ye byɛ wɛn etsob okyɛ èbva nkal a baal ba nonɔ̃ ba!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Ãwua ola byɛ b'ayiool b'ãngel! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ ekuru nkuul yi ebiri baal ola Nziã. Byam bam hɛ̃ k'etwel nkuul oyɔ wɛ, b'adzii k'atwal yɔ, byɛ hɛ̃ ekii bɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Ŋ'epal Yeso onse nzɔ oyɔ, ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye ayi mpuru kokɔ ye ndɛ, bu abvi ndɛ ɛ̃mfuul ofuul m'ãndɔɔ bibi: <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Bɔ ákeywiin ndɛ abɛɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abii ndɛ m'elyal onse ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Oyɛɛ k'ekal baal ba nzɛɛn-yuaal onge Afalisaye wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Me lio olɔ, baal ábvɔɔn bam amiil bibi, m'emfa kyɛn bɔ abvi bakyɛ odziaal. Yeso obvi ayio a ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Oyɛɛ k'ekal baal ba nzɛɛn-yuaal onge Afalisaye wɛ. Epfuũ e bɔ bvi ebi-ebi eli onge lebviil<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ'asuo kwɛn epfuũ bvi Afalisaye bvi ebi-ebi ekɔɔn onse bakyɛ onge b'ekɔɔn lebviil onse pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ, bvool esa kwɛn lɔ efel.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Ndɔɔ yam yueel yi eli m'odziɔɔn ekieel epal kal-a-kal. Ndɔɔ yam yueel hɛ̃ yi eli m'ofoo, akieel ayɛɛl yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, ndɔɔ yam yueel yi eyɛɛn byɛ onse empeel, akieel ayoo yɔ me mwiĩ. Ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn byɛ m'ãmfi-mfya, onse ngwel-a-nzɔ, akieel abiool yɔ ke taan.»<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndɔɔ yi abal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />«Andoo a mɛ̃, mɛ̃ bvool ngyɛɛn byɛ bubu: Ebee baal obal! Ke ngwel wɛ, ki ekoo bɔ osa kɛn obam o nzuru, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ k'eli y'eluɔ ekyam ki ekoo bɔ osa wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Byɛ eyɛɛ mbuul wu ebal byɛ? Mɛ̃ esuo byɛ ndɛ: Wu ebal byɛ Nziã wɛn ke mbee a ŋ'embaal ndɛ elaã e mbuul, oli y'okwɛn b'ayuɔɔl ndɛ ke ywɛn e mbaa. Taa-taa bam, wu ebal byɛ ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Answiĩ ataan, abetiɔ bɔ m'enzi-nzi etsi-tsiri. Mfya? Kɛn a Nziã k'adzɛɛn si ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Onkyam mfu y'ɔ̃tswɛ a byɛ, ndɛ oyɛɛ ɔ̃bvɛn a yɔ. Oŋɔ̃, ebee ye buɔ okal. Byɛ eli y'ɔ̃bvɛn, enduru answiĩ bibi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okiool wuo obee o Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />«Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Mbuul wu akiool ke nkwel a baal ndiri ndɛ oli wa mɛ̃, mɛ̃ wu Muaan a mbuul hɛ̃ ekieel ekiool ndɛ ke nkwel ãnzwel ã Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Kɛn a mbuul wu abee mɛ̃ ke nkwel a baal, mɛ̃ wu Muaan a mbuul hɛ̃ ekieel ebee ndɛ ke nkwel ãnzwel ã Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Mbuul wu ayɛɛn obi-obi me mɛ̃ wu Muaan a mbuul, akieel adzeel ndɛ. Kɛn a wu asiaan Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal, k'akieel abɔɔ odzeel wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Ŋɛn abvi byɛ mbal k'ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, wuo ke nkwel amfam y'akwɛn, ebee otsam m'ãndɔɔ m'èyebveel byɛ, wuo m'emfa ki èyeyɛɛn byɛ, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />ke ngwel wɛ kɛn a me lio alili, Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal akieel ayiool byɛ ãndɔɔ m'ekieel eyɛɛn byɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a ɔ̃pfel wu oywɛn ãyal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse baal olieel Yeso ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, yɛɛn muaan-ngoo a mɛ̃ akab ɛ̃swal ɛ̃ taal ye mɛ̃, awa boo li mɛ̃.» <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ndoo a mɛ̃, wu osuul mɛ̃ ntwel wu atsiil ãndɔɔ ã byɛ, wuo wu akab ɛ̃swal ɛ̃ byɛ nã?» <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ndɛ bu alieel baal bam bueel bubu: «Ekal y'onkyab! Ebee ye pfuul o nzi okal. Ke ngwel wɛ, elaã e mbuul k'eli me ndɔɔ obɔɔ o ndɛ wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ oli y'opfel bam bibi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Obobɔ, Yeso oti baal mboo yi: «Ãnguun m'ɔ̃pfel ngɔmɔ̃ ã́buru ndɛ nsia yam bibi. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ndɛ otsam ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Mɛ̃ bwɛn a bwɛn esa? Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ke ndi ye mboo yi nkwa yi ekwɛɛ mɛ̃ nsia wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Ndɛ bu ayɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Aã-yii, mɛ̃ mpii bubu esa: Mɛ̃ ètsal mboo yi ebekwɛɛ mɛ̃ eluɔ, mɛ̃ ètuu yi enduru okuun, kwɛn mɛ̃ ndɔ nsia e mɛ̃ y'opfel o mɛ̃ bokyɛ onse okɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, mɛ̃ nkoo k'eyɛɛn wɛn: Sa mɛ̃ ngwuun, mɛ̃ nza, mɛ̃ nywã bvool nsia mpaa, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ ndi y'eluɔ bibi me ndɔɔ amvel bibi.” <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Kɛn a Nziã oyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: “Ee, ewool e mbuul! Yɛ mpii ŋ'àkwa kɛn a me nsia wu. Obobɔ, eluɔ bvi ebvool-ebvool yɛ, wu àtwal bvel olɔ nã?”» <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Yeso bu alweel ndiri: «Mbuul wu abvool eluɔ me ndɔɔ a ndyam, wɛn k'ali y'opfel me ndɔɔ a Nziã wɛ, ntɔ a ndɛ èkal obobɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okal y'okiool me Nziã</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Me ndɔɔ elaã e byɛ, ebee otsam me bvi èdza byɛ, me ndɔɔ a nzuru a byɛ, ebee otsam me bvi èlaal byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Ke ngwel wɛ, elaã e byɛ enduru bvi-odza m'ɔ̃bvɛn, nzuru a byɛ hɛ̃ enduru ekɔ m'ɔ̃bvɛn. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Etal enkunkwaan, bvɛ k'ekwɛn wɛ, bvɛ hɛ̃ k'etsam wɛ, bvɛ k'eli si ekal y'ãngɔɔ̃ wuo y'ãmboo ãkyam m'akwɛɛ bvi-odza wɛ. Kɛn a Nziã abeliil bvɛ. Byɛ k'enduru anywɛn me dzuun wɛ? <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Ondɛ mbuul nã wɛn me ndɔɔ ãtsam ã ndɛ okoo k'alweel etsu-tsoo m'elaã e ndɛ? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Okɛɛn endo-ndɔɔ bvi etsi-etsi, byɛ k'ekoo k'esoo bvɛ wɛ, k'otsɛn omã b'etsam byɛ me m'ãsiil? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Etal emfa ki ekwel bviĩ, bvɛ k'esal wɛ, bvɛ hɛ̃ k'etuu ekɔ wɛ. Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, onkyam Salomɔ̃ y'opfel bueel b'éli a ndɛ, k'álaal ekɔ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ onge bviĩ obvɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Bviĩ bvɛn nonɔ̃ ŋã eli, ɔ̃suu àtsiil, atyel onse mbaa. Okɛɛn Nziã alaal bvɛ m'emfa okyɛ, oŋɔ̃ b'ekwɛɛn ndɛ olaal byɛ, baal b'okiool otsi-tsiri! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Obobɔ, ebee nguo okɛɛ me ndɔɔ yi ebii ki edza byɛ, wuo ki enywã byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Baal b'abebii bvɛ owuun wɛ bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. Me ndɔɔ a byɛ, byɛ eli ye Tal wu oyɛɛ kwɛn byɛ eli ye kɔɔ li eluɔ obvɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn, ebii Okwɛn o Nziã, ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ awa byɛ bvi esiil.»<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Opfel bo ke ywel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />«Ebee ye buɔ okal, byɛ b'eli onge muaan-nkel a emɛmɛɛ̃! Nzal-a-ŋɛn Tal a byɛ omwɛn ngesɛ k'awa byɛ Okwɛn o ndɛ! <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Etiɔ eluɔ bvi eli a byɛ bvool ewa nzi oyɔ aywal. Ebuo ɛ̃paa myɛn k'ɛ̃twɔɔl wɛ. Ekwɛɛ opfel bɛn ke ywel k'ofa wɛ. Okɔ, mbuul a pfuul k'akoo k'asyal tsotsoo wɛ, asieel hɛ̃ k'akoo k'adza bɔ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mboo yi eli opfel o byɛ, ɔ̃kwal a byɛ hɛ̃ àkal okɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asal b'ali y'onkyab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />«Ewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wu esal, esuul a mbunda a byɛ akal m'okaan! <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Ekal hɛ̃ onge asal b'akiaal mfam a bɔ, me lio li efa ndɛ pfuun li bal. Ŋ'èyebvool ndɛ, kɛn a ndɛ abɛɛl nzɔ, bɔ hɛ̃ adzweel ndɛ yɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Esɛ ol'asal bɛn ŋ'ekieel ebvool mfam a bɔ, ndɛ àyebɔɔ bɔ onse onkyab! Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn ndɛ mbuul wu àlaal ekɔ ki ɔ̃sal, àmviaal bɔ nsɛn ke misa, àwa bɔ bvi-odza. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Okɛɛn mfam oyebvool nkal a kuku, wuo sua ŋ'eyii ekuaal nswee wu ɛ̃kwel, ndɛ ayebɔɔ bɔ onse onkyab, bɔ àkal y'esɛ ki bibi.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Eyɛɛ bubu: Okɛɛn nga-nzɔ abeyɛɛ lio li eya mbuul a pfuul, ndɛ olɔ k'awi ndɛ nkuul yi esam ndɛ onse nzɔ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Byɛ hɛ̃, ekal y'onkyab! Ke ngwel wɛ, byɛ k'eyɛɛ lio li èya Muaan a mbuul wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bvɛ y'ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Obobɔ, Piɛɛl ofuul Yeso bubu: «Mfam, yɛ mboo oyɔ oŋɔ̃ kɛn a me bee ti, wuo me baal bueel hɛ̃?»<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Mfam obveel ndiri: «Ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bvɛ bvool wa y'ãkaã nã ali? Mpii wɛn, mfam a ndɛ akieel asuul ndɛ mbuul wu àtal asal a ndɛ bam bueel, àwa bɔ bvi-odza me lio li ngesɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Esɛ ol'ɔ̃sal ondɛ, wɛn ŋ'èyebvool mfam a ndɛ, ndɛ àyebɔɔ ndɛ abesa obobɔ! <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mfam àsuul ɔ̃sal ondɛ mbuul wu atal ãndɔɔ ã ndɛ mam mbueel. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Kɛn a ŋɛn ɔ̃sal ondɛ obvi oyɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Mfam a mɛ̃ k'ayebvool tswa-a-tswa wɛ”, ŋɛn ndɛ hɛ̃ obvi asal bakyɛ b'abɔɔl ye b'akaal obɛɛl, obvi odza, y'onywã, mbal ãbɔɔ ndɛ, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />mfam a ndɛ àyebvool me tsoo lɛn ndɛ k'aketsam wɛ, bvool me lio lɛn ndɛ hɛ̃ k'ayɛɛ wɛ. Obobɔ, mfam àwa ndɛ etumbu kyam ki enɛn, bvool àsuul ndɛ onse nkel a baal bɛn k'alweel Nziã wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Ɔ̃sal wu oyɛɛ ãndɔɔ m'edzii mfam a ndɛ, kɛn a ndɛ k'awa ɔ̃kwal m'osa mɔ̃ wɛ, akieel abɛɛl ndɛ ɔ̃dzii nyam wa bibi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Kɛn ɔ̃sal wɛn k'ayɛɛ m'edzii mfam a ndɛ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ osi ãndɔɔ mɛn ebvaan abɛɛl ndɛ, obɛɛl bo ndɛ òkal nkuaal-a-nkuaal. Mbuul wu abɔɔ bibi, ola ndɛ hɛ̃ àfuul ndɛ bibi. Mbuul wɛn awi ndɛ ɛ̃sal myam bibi osa, àfuul ndɛ myɛ̃ hɛ̃ bibi.»<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oya o Yeso obiri okab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />«Mɛ̃ mbaa ngyi ondɛɛl m'ɔ̃kiri, bvool mɛ̃ nzii kwɛn kɛn yɔ emeekaan! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ebvaan kwɛn adziil mɛ̃ onse fool onge b'abedziil mbuul onse ãdza me lio li opongo. Ɔ̃kwal a mɛ̃ oli y'ãwua tiil ye k'ekoo lio olɔ! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Byɛ etsam wɛn mɛ̃ opi ngyi owa onse ɔ̃kiri? Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, me ndɔɔ oya o mɛ̃, baal akab nzuru. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ke ngwel wɛ, meba ŋã, yam li baal ataan ol'etsɔɔn: atyel epie ngemɔ̃, buaal hɛ̃ epie ngemɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Tal k'àbemwɛɛn ye muaan wu bɔɔl wɛ, muaan wu bɔɔl k'àbemwɛɛn ye tal wɛ. Ngoo k'àbemwɛɛn ye muaan wu ɔ̃kaal wɛ, muaan wu ɔ̃kaal k'àbemwɛɛn ye ngoo wɛ. Okɔ wu ɔ̃kaal k'àbemwɛɛn y'ɔ̃kal a muaan wɛ, ɔ̃kal a muaan k'àbemwɛɛn y'okɔ wu ɔ̃kaal wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oyɛɛ b'ãlio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yeso ákeyɛɛn baal bvool ndiri: «Me lio li emwɛn byɛ epɛn epal k'etswi ki edziin tal, kɛn a me lio olɔ, byɛ eyɛɛn wɛn: “Mvel àndwɔɔ!” Oŋɔ̃ mvel hɛ̃ ondwɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Okɛɛn bvool mfel ofi etswi ki nsɛn, byɛ wɛn: “Nonɔ̃, mwiĩ àyebal wa kokɔ.” Oŋɔ̃ mwiĩ hɛ̃ obal wa kokɔ. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Baal ba nzɛɛn-yuaal, byɛ eyɛɛ k'etal eliĩ bvi emwɛn byɛ ke ywel wuo me nsie ngesɛ-ngesɛ, otsɛn omã bɛn byɛ k'eyɛɛ k'etal m'esa Nziã me lio li ngesɛ-ngesɛ wɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Obveel b'ondoo y'ɔ̃taal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />«Otsɛn omã bɛn byɛ k'eyɛɛ me byam emfa ki dzu ki asa ãndɔɔ wɛ? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Okɛɛn mbuul obvi yɛ mbal, ŋ'eyii eyi byɛ otsuun, sa mpɛn kwɛn, ŋ'eli byɛ kɛn me nkuul, yɛ faal ndɔɔ oyɔ ye ndɛ m'ɔ̃kwal. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, mbuul ondɛ ol'owi yɛ me mviɔɔl mi antwel, antwel awi yɛ m'ambwel-mbwel, ambwel-mbwel awel yɛ aywɛɛn me bwal. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, yɛ k'àpal onse okɔ wɛ tiil ye k'efuru yɛ ebiin e yɛ kyam kieel.»<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Pilate obam baal a Ngalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Kɛn a me lio olɔ, baal ayewa Yeso nsia ndiri: «Pilate atam baal a Ngalile obam, me lio li ekewa bɔ Nziã ãkab.» <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ ŋ'etsam wɛn baal a Ngalile b'abam m'emfa okyɛ, b'anduru baal a Ngalile bakyɛ m'ãbi? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃! Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn ŋɛn byɛ k'ekaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ wɛ, byɛ èkwa bam bueel onge bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Emeetsam me ndɔɔ a baal kuun ye mpuɔ̃ b'ákwi ŋ'ébvi nzɔ yi ɛ̃kiri-ɛ̃kiri yi Silohe: Bɔ b'ánduru baal bam bueel ba Yelusalem m'ãbi? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃! Kɛn a mɛ̃ bvool eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Okɛɛn byɛ k'ekaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ wɛ, byɛ èkwa bam bueel onge bɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a ɔ̃ti wa fig wɛn k'aburu nsia wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Obobɔ, Yeso bvool oti bɔ mboo yi: «Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ áli y'ɔ̃ti wa fig onse nguun a ndɛ yi bvine. Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ndɛ oyi nsia yi ɔ̃ti ondɛ oka, kɛn a ndɛ ki abɔɔ pyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Obobɔ, ndɛ oyɛɛn ɔ̃sal a ndɛ ndiri: “Yɛ amwɛn! Mvel tyel yɔ bu yɛn mɛ̃ ebeya nsia y'ɔ̃ti wa fig wu obii, kɛn a mɛ̃ ki ebebɔɔ pyɛ. Oŋɔ̃ tsiil kɛn a ndɛ! Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ abekɔɔn mboo yi ngwel.” <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Ɔ̃sal obveel ndɛ bubu: “Mfam! Meyɔɔl ndɛ kɛn amekal bvool mvel wu, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ nsam nsie yiɛɛ-kɔ k'etsɛn e ndɛ, bvool ndɔ ãsɔɔ oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Owɛɛl ndɛ okoo k'aburu me mvel wu àya, okɛɛn pyɛ, oŋɔ̃ mpii yɛ bu tam kɛn a ndɛ otsiil.”»<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Me tsoo li saba, Yeso obvuul ɔ̃kaal wa y'elyam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Me tsoo li saba, Yeso áketee onse nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, éli y'ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn ɔ̃fel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi áwi elyam ki émeesa ye ndɛ mvel kuun ye mpuɔ̃. Ndɛ ákekal kɛn ɔ̃nguo ebva, bvool k'ákekoo k'asiool dzu si m'etsi-tsiri wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso ɔ̃kaal ondɛ, ndɛ oti ndɛ mbel, bvool oyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: «Ngu, oluu o yɛ ŋ'ofi!» <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Obobɔ, ndɛ ondɔɔl ndɛ mviɔɔl. Kɛn a me lio olɔ, ɔ̃kaal ondɛ osiool dzu, bu abvi Nziã olweel. <verse eid="LUK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Ŋ'emwɛn mfam a nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn obobɔ, ndɛ oyoo nkyee bibi, me ndɔɔ yɛn Yeso obvuul mbuul me tsoo li saba. Kɛn a ndɛ osɔɔn embuul ki eli oŋɔ̃, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Eli y'ãtsoo ãsɛɛn m'ɔ̃sal, ebvaan kwɛn byɛ eya ãnzuru ã byɛ oboo m'ãtsoo omɔ̃, ke me tsoo li saba wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Kɛn a Mfam obveel ndɛ bubu: «Baal ba nzɛɛn-yuaal mpii byɛ! Me tsoo li saba, byɛ ndoo mbuul bwɛn a mbuul abenyiɔɔn ngwɛmbɛ wuo ane a ndɛ swɛ, me ndɔɔ yi abiri ndɛ ke mboo yi anywã ãdza, mfya? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />K'ɔ̃kaal wu, ndɛ mpii wa yam li Abalayam, bvool wu ésuul Ɔ̃pfu m'okuru fa mvel kuun ye mpuɔ̃. Bɛn kɛn k'ekeenyiɔɔn ndɛ me tsoo li saba wɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Me lio li eyɛɛn Yeso obobɔ, ataal a ndɛ bam bueel opfuru obɔɔ bibi, kɛn embuul ki éli oŋɔ̃ eluul m'esɛ m'ãndɔɔ m'ɛ̃kam m'ékesa ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo yi esia li mutaade</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yeso bvool oyɛɛn ndiri: «Okwɛn o Nziã onge emã oli? Mɛ̃ bɔ onge emã ememvɛɛl? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Bɔ mpii m'emfa ki oli: Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ owel esia li mutaade, okwɛn lɔ onse nguun a ndɛ. Lɔ emɛn, eyii ɔ̃ti, bvool anywɛn ayetuu ãnzɔ onse ãpɔɔ̃ ã ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a lebviil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yeso olweel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ Okwɛn o Nziã bvool y'eluɔ emã emvɛɛl? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Bɔ oli onge lebviil etsi-tsiri li ewel ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃, bu anzoo lɔ onse faline li boo-boo, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ pɔtɔ-pɔtɔ ndyam wueel ofel.»<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ wu ɔ̃tsi-ɔ̃tsi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat 7.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Ŋ'ékeyi Yeso Yelusalem, ndɛ ákebwel onse ãbviil y'ãla bvool áketee. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ ofuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, ɔ̃bvɛn a baal b'ekieel ebvuul Nziã kieel akal kɛn ɔ̃tsi-tsiri?» Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />«Esa mpɛn, me ndɔɔ yi esam m'ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ wu ɔ̃tsi-ɔ̃tsi, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, bibi akieel abii k'asam, kɛn a bɔ k'àkoo m'osam wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Ŋ'èkoo lio, mfam a nzɔ àtɛɛn, bvool àwɔɔl yɔ. Okɛɛn byɛ esiil onkwel-a-nzi, byɛ ol'ebɛɛl edzoo, bvool ol'eluɔɔn ndiri: “Mfam, Mfam, dzweel bee nzɔ!” Kɛn a ndɛ ol'obveel byɛ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ byɛ wɛ, byɛ bam kwɛn efi!” <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Kɛn a byɛ ol'ebvi ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: “Bee mpii édzi, énywi ye yɛ, yɛ mpii áketee onse abal-bal a bviil e bee.” <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ndɛ bvool ol'obveel byɛ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ byɛ wɛ, embal bam tsotsoo a mɛ̃, byɛ baal b'ãbi eli!” <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Oyɔ mboo yɛn byɛ ekieel elel, bvool edza miin me lio li èmwɛn byɛ Abalayam, y'Isak, ye Dzakab, bvool y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bam bueel onse Okwɛn o Nziã. Kɛn a byɛ, àtyal byɛ onkwel-a-nzi! <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Baal àfa etswi ki epal tal ye ki edziin lɔ, àfa nkio ye nsɛn. Bɔ àyewal ãmboo, me ndɔɔ yi adza onse Okwɛn o Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />M'emfa okyɛ, baal bakyɛ bɛn me lio li ali ke mbee, akieel akal ke nkwel, bakyɛ bɛn me lio li ali ke nkwel, akieel akal ke mbee.»<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ye Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Kɛn a me lio olɔ, Afalisaye ke kwɛ asyel tsotsoo a Yeso, bu awi ndɛ ãnkunkwa bubu: «Pal onse nsie yi, yi li yam lela ye ŋã, ke ngwel wɛ Elode odzii k'abam yɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Eyeyɛɛn mbuul wu ãyal ãbi onge mbwel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">M'ɔ̃nywã wa Ngelek, mbwel, nyam wu asuo ndiri mbuul wɛn otsɛn pyɛ, wuo mbuul wu abetsal ãkel ã baal a ndyam.</char></note> ondɛ ndiri mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn wɛn: “Nonɔ̃, mɛ̃ etswɛɛl ɛ̃fel mi ɛ̃bi-ɛ̃bi bvool eboo anga-ãluu. Ɔ̃suu, mɛ̃ bvool èsa obobɔ. Ongwel ɔ̃suu, mɛ̃ ol'emeembɛɛl ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃.” <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Kɛn a nonɔ̃, y'ɔ̃suu, y'ongwel ɔ̃suu, ebvaan kwɛn mɛ̃ enɔɔn nkuul a mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, obvie abam ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã kɛn a ke Yelusalem.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Aa, baal a Yelusalem! Baal a Yelusalem! Byɛ b'ebebam aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, b'ebetyal baal b'eyuɔɔl Nziã byɛ ãnkɔɔn! Nsa kwɛ yi édzii mɛ̃ k'ebvool byɛ tsotsoo a mɛ̃ onge b'epfee nswee baan onse ãpab! Kɛn a byɛ k'énzii obobɔ wɛ! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Oŋɔ̃, nzɔ a byɛ, ŋ'àyiri yɔ me byam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ bam wɛn: Byɛ k'èbemwɛn mɛ̃ bam wɛ, tiil lio li ekieel eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: “Yɔɔl kwɛn wu aya me nkuũ a Mfam Nziã akal y'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl!”»<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yeso bvool oboo mbuul me tsoo li saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Me tsoo li saba, Yeso oyi odza ola mfam a Afalisaye ngɔmɔ̃. Baal b'áli oŋɔ̃ ákeliɔɔl ndɛ ãyal pyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu áli y'ãluu m'ebebiin nzuru áli ke nkwel a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yeso ofuul ayiool b'ãngel y'Afalisaye bubu: «Me tsoo li saba, ãngel ã bia-byɛ ãwa nkuul wuo ãluo k'aboo mbuul?» <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Kɛn a bɔ k'abveel ndɛ ndɔɔ wɛ. Obobɔ, Yeso osiin mbuul wa y'ãluu ondɛ, oboo ndɛ, bu ayɛɛn ndɛ ndiri ayi nzɔ. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso osɔɔn b'áli oŋɔ̃, bu ayɛɛn bɔ ndiri: «Ŋɛn muaan a mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ, wuo ngwɛmbɛ a ndɛ, obvi onse ɔ̃tob me tsoo li saba, ndɛ bam ayepaal ndɛ tswa-tswa!» <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Oŋɔ̃, bɔ bvool k'abɔɔ ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛn ndɛ wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osuaal o mboo yi mbee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso kwɛn baal b'áti mbel ákesuaal ãmboo mã nkwel, ndɛ owi bɔ luo bubu: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />«Ŋɛn mbuul oti yɛ mbel yi adza ke bal, bee nsɛn oyebva ke mboo yi nkwel. Owɛɛl onse b'ati mbel, eli ye mbuul wu onduru yɛ bvɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Owɛɛl hɛ̃ ndɛ wu ati byɛ bam bueel mbel oyeyɛɛn yɛ ndiri: “Tɛɛn, wa mbuul wu mboo oyɔ.” Obobɔ, yɛ olɔ yoo opfuru bibi k'abvool ayebva nsɛn ke mboo yi mbee! <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Kɛn a ŋ'eti mbuul yɛ mbel, yi y'abva nsɛn ke mboo yi mbee, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ me lio li esam ndɛ wu ati yɛ mbel, ndɛ ndyam ayɛɛn yɛ ndiri: “Ndoo a mɛ̃, ya y'abva nsɛn ke nkwel kwɛn, ke mboo yi enduru ompal!” Obobɔ, yɛ olɔ bɔɔ dzuun li enɛn ke mviil ã baal bueel b'adza ye yɛ ke misa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu andɛɛl nzuru, àkuaal ndɛ, kɛn a wu akuaal nzuru, àndɛɛl ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel mbuul wu ati ndɛ mbel ndiri: «Ŋɛn yɛ abɛɛl pfuun, m'epal-epal wuo m'ãnkunkwal, ekal andoo a yɛ, ekal baan-ngoo a yɛ, ekal eburu e yɛ, ekal apfel b'akal tsotsoo a yɛ, bee bɔ mbel ota. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ ol'akieel ati yɛ hɛ̃ mbel me lio li ebɛɛl bɔ pfuun li bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi abveel nkaal. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ŋɛn yɛ abɛɛl pfuun, ngesɛ ta aywal mbel, y'ekal, ye b'ali y'elyam, y'ɛ̃nkwa-mviil. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Yɛ asa obobɔ, yɛ olɔ kal y'esɛ ki bibi, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ k'ali y'eluɔ kyɛn ol'abveel yɛ wɛ. Kɛn a Nziã akieel abveel yɛ bvɛ me lio li ekieel eseel ndɛ baal ba dzu.»<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a pfuun li enɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Ŋ'eyoo bɔ ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ngɔmɔ̃ onse b'áti mbel oyɛɛn Yeso ndiri: «Esɛ ola mbuul wu akieel adza onse Okwɛn o Nziã!» <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yeso obveel ndɛ me mboo yi eyɛɛn bubu: «Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ ábɛɛl pfuun li enɛn, ndɛ áti baal bibi mbel. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Ŋ'ekoo lio li odza, ndɛ oyuɔɔl ɔ̃sal a ndɛ k'ayɛɛn baal b'eti ndɛ mbel ndiri: “Eya, lio emeekoo!” <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Kɛn a bɔ bam bueel, mbuul bwɛn a mbuul obvi ndɛ odzeel osɔɔ. Mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel olieel ndɛ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ nsuun nguun ngamɔ̃ alili ŋã, ebvaan mɛ̃ eyi yɔ otal. Dzeel mɛ̃, bia-yɛ buaal!” <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Wukyɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: “Mɛ̃ nsuun angwɛmbɛ kuun me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal wu ãnguun, mɛ̃ ŋ'eyekie bɔ, dzeel mɛ̃, bia-yɛ buaal!” <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Wukyɛ bvool oyɛɛn ndiri: “Mɛ̃ mfi ɔ̃kal obaal alili ŋã, obɔ otsɛn bɛn mɛ̃ olɔ ke ngyi wɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />«Ŋ'ebvool ɔ̃sal ola mfam a ndɛ, ndɛ olieel ndɛ odzeel b'ebii ebii baal. Obobɔ, mfam a nzɔ mpuru eyi, ndɛ bu alieel ɔ̃sal a ndɛ ndiri: “Yi bam tswa-tswa onse abal-bal a bviil b'anɛn b'anɛn ye b'atsi-atsi, yia mɛ̃ aywal ŋã, y'ekal, y'ɛ̃nkwa-mviil, ye b'ali y'elyam.” <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ke mbee a lio etsi-tsiri, ɔ̃sal oyeyɛɛn ndɛ ndiri: “Mfam, mɛ̃ emeesa b'etam yɛ, kɛn ãmboo kɛn ãli.” <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Mfam bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: “Okɛɛn obobɔ, oŋɔ̃ yi m'ãnkuul, tsotsoo ãnguun, baal b'èmwɛn yɛ, sa bam kwɛn bɔ asam ola mɛ̃, kwɛn nzɔ a mɛ̃ eluul. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃, onse baal b'eti mɛ̃ mbel tsɔɔn, mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ k'àmbio bvi-odza e mɛ̃ wɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãndɔɔ m'asa m'oluɛɛn o Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Embuul kyam ki bibi ékeyi ye Yeso. Ndɛ okɔɔl osɔɔn bɔ, bu alieel bɔ bubu: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />«Mbuul wu aya ola mɛ̃, ebvaan kwɛn dzii li edzii ndɛ mɛ̃ enduru li edzii ndɛ tal a ndɛ, ngoo a ndɛ, ɔ̃kal a ndɛ, baan a ndɛ, baan-ngoo a ndɛ, ankyel a ndɛ, onkyam omwiĩ o ndyam. Okɛɛn k'obobɔ wɛ, ndɛ k'akoo m'okal ɔ̃yio a mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Mbuul okɛɛn k'abiri enkulusu e ndɛ bvool onɔɔn a mɛ̃ wɛ, ndɛ k'akoo m'okal ɔ̃yio a mɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />M'emfa kiki, okɛɛn mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse byɛ odzii k'atuu nzɔ yi nkal a ywel, ndɛ olɔ kɛn obvi nsɛn, me ndɔɔ y'asiɔɔl ɔ̃bvɛn a nzɔ oyɔ, bvool me ndɔɔ yi atal okɛɛn ndɛ oli ye dzi yi abiri ɔ̃sal tiil ntɔ, mfya? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ŋɛn ndɛ otsam nsie olɔ ãnkɔɔn, bvool k'akoo k'ambɛɛl nzɔ otuu wɛ, ndɛ ol'okal mbuul wu esyob wu eyɛɛn baal bueel ndiri: <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />“Tal ngaburu wu: Nzɔ ndɛ obɛɛn otuu, bvool k'abebɔɔ mpɛn yi ambɛɛl yɔ wɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Kɛn a m'emfa okyɛ, mfam ngɔmɔ̃ okɛɛn ayedzwaan eta ye mfam wukyɛ, ndɛ olɔ kɛn obvi nsɛn otal okɛɛn ambwel-mbwel amiil kuun (10.000) b'eli a ndɛ, ndɛ olɔ okoo k'ayedzwaan eta y'ɔ̃taal a ndɛ wa y'ambwel-mbwel amiil ãku-mbuaal (20.000), mfya? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ kwɛn ndɛ olɔ k'akoo wɛ, ndɛ ol'oyuɔɔl atwel ol'ɔ̃taal a ndɛ ŋ'eli ndɛ kɛn lela, kwɛn bɔ asoo ãndɔɔ m'opi.» <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Eli emfa kiki me ndɔɔ a byɛ. Mbuul wɛn k'akiool k'asiil eluɔ bvieel bvi eli a ndɛ wɛ, ndɛ k'akoo m'okal ɔ̃yio a mɛ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃ngwa wu oywɛn obvie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />«Ɔ̃ngwa oli eluɔ ki y'obvie. Kɛn a ndɛ okɛɛn oyii wel, emfa emã ki abveel obvie o ndɛ? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ndɛ ŋ'ayii ɔ̃sal pyɛ, ekal m'obvieel o nsie, ekal m'osuul o yɔ dzoo-dzoo, esiil kɛn a k'ata ndɛ pfɛɛ. Yɔɔl kwɛn wu oli y'ãtswi m'ayoo, ayoo!»<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Mboo yi emɛmɛɛ̃ ki edziɔɔn bvool edzuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Baal bam bueel b'awal mpal ye baal b'ãbi asyel tsotsoo a Yeso me ndɔɔ yi ayoo m'eyɛɛn ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Afalisaye y'ayiool b'ãngel ayoo nkyee ye Yeso, ɔ̃tswɛ-pa ndiri: «Ndɛ abeyɔɔ baal b'ãbi, bvool abedza ye bɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yeso bu ati bɔ mboo yi: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />«Onse byɛ, okɛɛn mbuul oli y'emɛmɛɛ̃ ɔ̃nkam (100), emɛmɛɛ̃ ngemɔ̃ edziɔɔn, ndɛ ol'osuul emɛmɛɛ̃ ɛ̃kuun-bva ye bva (99) bvi esiil onse ɔ̃baan, me ndɔɔ yi ayebii ngemɔ̃ ki edziɔɔn, tiil ye k'ebɔɔ ndɛ kyɛ, mfya? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ kyɛ, y'esɛ kyam kieel, ndɛ ol'ondɔɔl kyɛ nkal esɔɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Ndɛ atɔ nzɔ, ndɛ ol'obvool andoo a ndɛ ye b'akal tsotsoo a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi aliaal bɔ ndiri: “Esia mpaa ye mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ mwɛn emɛmɛɛ̃ e mɛ̃ ki edziɔɔn!” <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Emfa ngemɔ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, esɛ ki eli ke ywel me ndɔɔ a mbuul ãbi ngɔmɔ̃ wu okaal ɔ̃kwal, enduru ki me ndɔɔ a baal ɛ̃kuun-bva ye bva (99) ba dzu bɛn k'ali ye kɔɔ li akaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a nzi yi edziɔɔn bvool edzuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />«Kɛn a m'emfa kiki, okɛɛn ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ oli ye nzi yi ãbvieel kuun, ŋɛn ndɛ bvieel ngemɔ̃ etswel, ndɛ andɛɛl mbunda, akuɔɔn nzɔ bvool abii lɔ ngesɛ-ngesɛ, tiil ye k'emwɛn ndɛ lɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Ndɛ amwɛn lɔ, ndɛ ol'obvool andoo a ndɛ ye b'akal tsotsoo ye ndɛ, me ndɔɔ yi aliaal bɔ ndiri: “Esia mpaa ye mɛ̃, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ mwɛn nzi e mɛ̃ yi edziɔɔn!” <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Emfa ngemɔ̃, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn esɛ bibi ol'ãnzwel ã Nziã me ndɔɔ a mbuul a ãbi ngɔmɔ̃ wu okaal ɔ̃kwal.»<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a muaan wu adziɔɔn bvool odzuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yeso bvool olieel ndiri: «Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ áli yɛ baan buaal b'abɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Wu ɔ̃kiɔɔl olieel tal ndiri: “Taal, kab opfel o yɛ, wa boo li e mɛ̃.” Obobɔ, tal okab opfel o ndɛ mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a baan ange-buaal. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ke mbee ãtsoo ãtsi-tsiri, muaan wu ɔ̃kiɔɔl ondɛ otiɔ boo li opfel li ndɛ, otwel nkuul, bu ayɛn ye nzi yi ndɛ k'ɔ̃kiri wa lela. Okɔ ndɛ obɔɔ̃ nzi yi éli a ndɛ m'esɛ bvi ɔ̃kiri. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Ke mbee a ŋ'ebɔɔ̃ ndɛ yɔ yam yueel, ɔ̃lɔɔ osam m'ɔ̃kiri ondɛ, ndɛ bu abvi okaan. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ndɛ oyebii ɔ̃sal ola mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kiri ondɛ. Mbuul ondɛ otam ndɛ onse ãnguun ã ndɛ, m'oyebuaal b'anguru. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ŋ'enduru ndɛ nzal, ndɛ oboodzii k'adza eluɔ bvi edza anguru, kɛn a wu owi ndɛ bvɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Obobɔ, ndɛ obvi otsam, bvool oyɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Asal a tal a mɛ̃ bueel abedza onge b'edzii bɔ, bɛn mɛ̃ kwɛn wu ebepɛn ɔ̃la me nzal! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Mɛ̃ èbvool ola tal a mɛ̃, bvool èyɛɛn ndɛ bubu: Taal, mɛ̃ nsi obi ke mviil ã Nziã, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nsi obi ke mviil ã yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Mɛ̃ ke mvaan wɛ kwɛn yɛ bvool wal mɛ̃ onge muaan a yɛ. Wal mɛ̃ onge ngɔmɔ̃ onse asal a yɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Obobɔ, ndɛ otwel nkuul, okɔɔl ola tal.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Ŋ'éli ndɛ kɛn lela ye nzɔ, tal otaal ndɛ, nyiĩ a muaan yam ebɔɔ, otsuu ntiin m'oyeyɔɔ o ndɛ, bu abuun ndɛ ke nkii. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Muaan olieel ndɛ bubu: “Taal, mɛ̃ nsi obi ke mviil ã Nziã, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ nsi obi ke mviil ã yɛ. Mɛ̃ ke mvaan wɛ kwɛn yɛ bvool wal mɛ̃ onge muaan a yɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Kɛn a tal olieel asal a ndɛ bubu: “Eya tswa-a-tswa y'ekɔ ki enduru obvie, bvool elaal ndɛ endaa m'ɔ̃liɛɛn, y'asimpal me ntaã. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Eyia muaan-ngwɛmbɛ wu ɔ̃lam wa ye mbaal, bvool ebam ndɛ. Bia-byɛ edza, esia mpaa. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Ke ngwel wɛ, muaan a mɛ̃ wu emwɛn byɛ wu ákwi, bvool oyebvool mwiĩ! Ndɛ ádziɔɔn, bvool odzuul!” Obobɔ, bɔ abɛɛn pfuun.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Me lio olɔ, muaan wu ɛ̃kwel áli k'ãnguun. Ŋ'eyii ekɔɔl ndɛ, ndɛ atɔ tsotsoo a nzɔ, ndɛ oyoo nkyal e sio y'enkiin ki ãkɛn. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Ndɛ oti ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ mbel, bu afuul ndɛ otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel. <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Ɔ̃sal obveel ndɛ ndiri: “Mvɔɔl a yɛ oyebvool nzuru kɛɛ-kɛɛ, obɔ otsɛn bɛn tal a yɛ obam muaan-ngwɛmbɛ wu ɔ̃lam wa ye mbaal.”<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Etɔ oŋɔ̃, muaan wu ɛ̃kwel oyi mpuru, bu abee nzɔ osam. Obobɔ, tal opal oyelɛɛn ndɛ me ndɔɔ yɛn ndɛ asam nzɔ. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Kɛn a muaan obveel tal ndiri: “Meyoo, mvel eyii yam bibi yi ebekiɔɔn mɛ̃ ebenzɔɔ me yɛ ɛ̃sal osa, k'eli ye tsoo si ngelemɔ̃ li mbee mɛ̃ ontam o yɛ wɛ. Kɛn a tsoo si ngelemɔ̃ pyɛ li ewi yɛ mɛ̃ onkyam muaan-ntab, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbɛɛl pfuun y'andoo a mɛ̃! <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Bɛn muaan a yɛ wu ayebvool, ndɛ wu obɔɔ̃ nzi e yɛ yueel m'akaal-nga-esio, me ndɔɔ a ndɛ, yɛ bu bam muaan-ngwɛmbɛ wu ɔ̃lam wa ye mbaal!” <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Tal obveel ndɛ ndiri: “Muaan a mɛ̃, ãtsoo mbueel yɛ li ye mɛ̃, bvool bvam bvieel bvi ndi a mɛ̃ eli bvi yɛ. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Kɛn a bia-byɛ ebvaan ebɛɛl pfuun bvool esia mpaa, ke ngwel wɛ mvɔɔl a yɛ wu ákwi, bvool oyebvool mwiĩ, ndɛ ádziɔɔn, bvool odzuul!”»<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mboo yi ɔ̃sal nga-ãyal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yeso oyɛɛn hɛ̃ y'ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Ɔ̃pfel ngɔmɔ̃ áli y'ɔ̃sal wu áketal opfel o ndɛ. Baal ayefɛn ndɛ ndiri: “Ɔ̃sal a yɛ abɔɔ̃ yɛ opfel.” <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Mfam bu ati ndɛ mbel, ofuul ndɛ bubu: “M'eyoo mɛ̃ me nkuũ a yɛ omɔ̃ ãmã? Sa mɛ̃ ɔ̃tsiɔ wu ɔ̃sal a yɛ ndyam wueel, ke ngwel wɛ yɛ ŋ'àmbal k'ɔ̃sal a mɛ̃.” <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Ɔ̃sal wu bu abvi oyɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Mfam a mɛ̃ ŋ'ambaal mɛ̃ k'ɔ̃sal a ndɛ, mɛ̃ ngyii bwɛn-a-bwɛn èsa? Osal b'ãnguun, mɛ̃ mpɛn pyɛ. Olaa b'eluɔ, mɛ̃ ndi y'opfuru. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ee, mɛ̃ ngyɛɛ emfa ki èsa mɛ̃, kwɛn baal ayɔɔ mɛ̃ ola bɔ ke mbee a ŋ'ambaal mɛ̃ k'ɔ̃sal.” <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Ndɛ oti mbuul ngɔmɔ̃-ngɔmɔ̃ mbel b'áli y'ebiin e mfam a ndɛ. Ndɛ ofuul mbuul wu ɛ̃kwel bubu: “Yɛ li y'ebiin e mfam a mɛ̃ ki kwɛ?” <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ndɛ obveel ndiri: “Ebiin eli ki atɔn a mbaal m'olibve ɔ̃nkam (100).” Ɔ̃sal oyɛɛn bubu: “Wal ɔ̃nkaan wu tswa-tswa, swɛn wɛn ebiin eli ki atɔn ãku-ãtaan (50).” <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ ofuul wukyɛ ndiri: “Ke yɛ, ebiin ki yɛ kwɛ eli?” Mbuul ondɛ obveel ɔ̃sal ndiri: “Ebiin eli ki asak ɔ̃nkam (100) ba nsia yi bele.” Ɔ̃sal bvool olieel ndɛ ndiri: “Wal ɔ̃nkaan, swɛn wɛn bɔ ali ɛ̃kuun-mpuɔ̃ (80).” <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Ŋ'eyoo mfam ãndɔɔ m'esi ɔ̃sal wu ɔ̃bi ondɛ, ndɛ okiool ndɛ m'ãyal m'ãbi m'esi ndɛ omɔ̃. Taa-taa bam, baal b'abii opfel b'ɔ̃kiri abesa ãndɔɔ y'ãyal onse bam-a-bam. Bɔ anduru b'adzii k'adzuu onse okal-a-kal ãyal.»<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Mɛ̃ bvool eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Esa kwɛn m'opfel b'ãyal ãbi, byɛ ebɔɔ andoo. M'emfa okyɛ, ŋ'ekieel efa opfel obɔ, bɔ àyɔɔ byɛ k'ãmboo m'ɔ̃bu. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Mbuul wu oli dzu onse ãndɔɔ m'ãtsi-ãtsi, ndɛ hɛ̃ oli dzu onse ãndɔɔ m'ãnɛn. Wɛn k'ali dzu onse ãndɔɔ m'ãtsi-ãtsi wɛ, ndɛ k'ali dzu onse m'ãnɛn hɛ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Obobɔ, ŋɛn byɛ k'eli dzu m'ãndɔɔ ã nzi yi epfuru baal wɛ, wu àwa byɛ opfel bo taa-taa nã? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Obobɔ, byɛ ŋɛn k'eli dzu m'eluɔ bvi mbuul ɔ̃kyam wɛ, Nziã k'àwa byɛ opfel bo byam b'ekwee ndɛ byɛ wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Ɔ̃nkyal ngɔmɔ̃ k'akoo m'okal m'amfam buaal wɛ: Okɛɛn ndɛ abyal ngɔmɔ̃, adzii wukyɛ, okɛɛn ndɛ akuru nzuru me ngɔmɔ̃, afiɛɛn wukyɛ. Okɛɛn byɛ eli ankyal a nzi, byɛ k'ekoo k'esal me ndɔɔ a Nziã wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyoo Afalisaye ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ abvi Yeso osyob, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ b'áli ye pfuul o nzi. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Yeso bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ ebesuo kwɛn byɛ eli dzu ke mviil ã baal, ŋ'esa kwɛn, Nziã oyɛɛ ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, ãndɔɔ m'elweel baal, Nziã asiaan mɔ̃.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Baal áli ke nsɛn a ngel a Moyize y'ɛ̃nkaan mi aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã tiil lio li Dzaã Batis. Bɛɛn me lio olɔ, abeliaal Nsia yi Ngesɛ yi Okwɛn o Nziã. Mbuul bwɛn a mbuul abesa mpɛn me ndɔɔ yi asam onse bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Onkyam ŋɛn baal bvool k'abekal ke nsɛn a ngel wɛ, ywel ye nsie ekoo m'obwel bam ɔ̃kwɛɛl pyɛ. Etɔ m'ɔ̃nkaan wa ngel, si ekal mpɛɛl a ndɛ k'ekoo m'ombal bam wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Mbuul abee ɔ̃kal a ndɛ, oyebaal ɔ̃kaal ɔ̃kyam, ndɛ ŋ'afel ngel a bal. Bvool mbuul wu obaal ɔ̃kaal wu ebee ɔ̃lam, ŋ'afel ngel a bal hɛ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo yi Ɔ̃pfel ye Ladzaal wu ɔ̃ywal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yeso bvool oti mboo yi: «Éli y'ɔ̃pfel ngɔmɔ̃ wu ákelaal ekɔ bvi ebvɛ-ebvɛ bvool bvi ɔ̃bvɛn. Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo li omwiĩ o ndɛ, ndɛ áli onse obɛɛl o pfuun y'esɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Éli hɛ̃ y'ɔ̃ywal ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Ladzaal wu áli bɔ k'ɔ̃nywã a nzɔ a opfel ondɛ. Nzuru a ndɛ éli yam m'ãbwɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Ndɛ kwɛn k'áli y'efua ki adza ãmpɛɛl m'eluɔ m'ãfa ywel a misa wu ɔ̃pfel, amva aya ndɛ ãbwɔɔ m'ãnɛn olie. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Ɔ̃ywal okwi, ãnzwel ãbiri ndɛ ke mboo yi eli Abalayam. Ɔ̃pfel hɛ̃ okwi, adziool ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />K'ola o b'ákwi-ákwi, ndɛ oyii amwɛn fool li bibi. Ndɛ aseel mviil, ndɛ otaal Abalayam, ye Ladzaal tsotsoo ye ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Ndɛ obvi obiool bubu: “Taal wu Abalayam, sio mɛ̃ nyiĩ! Tam Ladzaal, kwɛn ndɛ atob nswɛɛ a ɔ̃liɛɛn a ndɛ onse ãdza, me ndɔɔ yi awa mɛ̃ elam efyɛ, ke ngwel wɛ mɛ̃ emwɛn fool bibi onse mbaa yi.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />«Abalayam obveel ndɛ ndiri: “Muaan a mɛ̃, ebvaan yɛ ayɛɛ wɛn yɛ ábɔɔ obvɛ bibi m'omwiĩ o yɛ, kɛn a Ladzaal áli onse fool. Meba ŋã, fool li ndɛ efi, kɛn a yɛ boomwɛn mpal. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Yɛɛ bvool kwɛn, ywɛn li ela eli mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a byɛ ye bee. Obobɔ, b'adzii k'afa kwɛn ayi okɔ, k'akoo m'otsiil lɔ wɛ, b'okɔ hɛ̃ k'akoo m'otsiil lɔ aya ola bee wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Ɔ̃pfel olweel bubu: “Okɛɛn obobɔ taal, mɛ̃ buɛɛn yɛ, oŋɔ̃ tam kɛn a ndɛ ayi onse nzɔ a tal a mɛ̃! <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ ndi ye baan-ngoo ataan. Yɔɔl kwɛn ndɛ ayewa bɔ ãnkunkwa, kwɛn bɔ hɛ̃ abee ke mboo yi fool yi oya!”»<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />«Abalayam obveel ndɛ bubu: “Baan-ngoo a yɛ ali y'ɔ̃nkaan a Moyize bvool y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi awa bɔ ãnkunkwa, ayoo bɔ!” <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Ɔ̃pfel obveel bubu: “Taal wu Abalayam, k'obobɔ wɛ, ŋɛn mbuul ofi ola b'ákwi-ákwi okɔɔl oyeyɛɛn ye bɔ, bɔ ol'akaal ɛ̃kwal.” <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Abalayam obveel ndɛ ndiri: “Bɔ okɛɛn k'ayoo Moyize y'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã wɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ olɔ k'akaal ɛ̃kwal wɛ, onkyam ŋɛn mbuul wu osiool oyewa bɔ ãnkunkwa.”»<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Obi y'odzeel o bakyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yeso olieel ayio a ndɛ bubu: «Ãndɔɔ m'ãbiri baal onse ãbi k'ãkoo k'ãywɛn wɛ. Kɛn ãwua bibi me mbuul wu asa kwɛn bakyɛ asa mɔ̃! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Ngesɛ akuru ndɛ nkɔɔn yi enɛn me nkii, bvool atyal ndɛ me nzal, ye k'esa ndɛ kwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse ebe-baan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ebe-baan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋã, ekoo hɛ̃ k'eyɛɛn ndiri baal bɛn okiool kɛn owam wɛ.</char></note> bvi ebva onse ãbi. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Ekal y'onkyab!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Okɛɛn muaan-ngoo a yɛ osi yɛ obi, suo ndɛ obi b'esi ndɛ. Okɛɛn ndɛ okiool obi o ndɛ, dzeel ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ŋɛn me tsoo ndɛ osi yɛ obi nsa nsiaan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeso ŋã ŋ'adzii k'asuo ndiri edzeel bakyɛ ndel pyɛ. Etal hɛ̃ onse </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 18:21-35">Mat 18.21-35</ref></char>.</note>, ndɛ abebvool ola yɛ me ndɔɔ yi ayɛɛn yɛ ndiri: “Mɛ̃ nsi yɛ obi: Dzeel mɛ̃”, yɛ abedzeel ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okiool</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Antam alieel Mfam Yeso ndiri: «Suul okiool o bee okal b'onɛn.» <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Mfam obveel bɔ ndiri: «Okɛɛn byɛ eli y'okiool si ekal m'otsiaal onge esia li mutaade, byɛ ekoo k'eyɛɛn ɔ̃ti wu wɛn: “Yeb nzuru ŋã, yi akwɛn yɔ onse ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa”, ndɛ àsa b'etam byɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãndɔɔ m'esa ɔ̃sal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />«Onse byɛ, mbuul nã wɛn okɛɛn ndɛ oli y'ɔ̃sal wu abesal ndɛ ãnguun, wuo wu abebuaal ndɛ anyam, ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ ndɛ ofi ãnguun, ndɛ ol'olieel ndɛ ndiri: “Yi abva nsɛn tswa-a-tswa ke misa?” <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃, ndɛ ol'olieel ndɛ ndiri: “Laan mɛ̃ ãtuo, swɛɛl ekɔ bvi ɔ̃sal, me ndɔɔ yi ayiaal a mɛ̃ mɔ̃ ŋã, kwɛn mɛ̃ nza bvool nywã. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, yɛ fu abedza, abenywã.” <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Mfam ol'obveel ɔ̃sal ondɛ ãtuɛɛn me ndɔɔ ɔ̃sal wu etam ndɛ ndɛ osa? Hɛɛ̃-hɛ̃! <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Eli emfa kiki me ndɔɔ a byɛ: Ŋ'eman byɛ ɔ̃sal ndyam wueel wu atam byɛ osa, eyɛɛn wɛn: “Bee kɛn asal eli. Bee kɛn ɔ̃sal wu atam bee osa esi.”»<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obvuul baal kuun ba y'ãluu me leba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Me lio li ékeyi Yeso Yelusalem, ndɛ obwel mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a Samali ye Ngalile. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Ŋ'eyii esam ndɛ onse ola ngɔmɔ̃, baal kuun b'áli y'ãluu me leba, ayi me ndɔɔ yi ayemwɛɛn ye ndɛ. Kɛn a bɔ atɛɛn lela. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Bɔ abvi oluɔɔn bibi ndiri: «Mfam Yeso, sio bee nyiĩ!» <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso bɔ, ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Eyi eyesuo nzuru ol'angaa-a-Nziã.» Me lio li eyii eyi bɔ okɔ, bɔ ayii tsɛtsɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Ŋ'emwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ kwɛn ndɛ obvuul, ndɛ okɔɔl bam kɛn a me nkuul-a-nkuul, aya alweel Nziã bam kokɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ, ndɛ obvi ãbuo mbwii me nsie ke nkwel a Yeso, bu abveel ndɛ ãtuɛɛn. Ndɛ áli Ɔ̃samalia. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Obobɔ, Yeso ofuul ndiri: «B'abvuul, ke kuun ali wɛ? Ke bakyɛ b'ange-bva, kwɛn ali? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Wu oyebvool, me ndɔɔ yi ayebveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, kɛn ɔ̃nzii wu?» <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Tɛɛn, yi! Okiool o ye obvuul yɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oya b'Okwɛn o Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Afalisaye afuul Yeso bubu: «Lio emã li èya Okwɛn o Nziã?» Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Okwɛn o Nziã k'òya m'emfa ki amwɛn me mviil bubu wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Baal k'ayɛɛn bubu wɛ: “Etal, bɔ oli ŋã!”, wuo: “Bɔ oli ku!” Ke ngwel wɛ, eyɛɛ ngesɛ wɛn, Okwɛn o Nziã oli onse byɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsoo li oya o Muaan a mbuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ olieel ayio ndiri: «Ãtsoo ã̀ya mɛn byɛ ekieel edzii k'emwɛn si ekal tsoo ngelemɔ̃ li Muaan a mbuul, kɛn a byɛ k'èmwɛn lɔ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Baal akieel ayɛɛn byɛ ndiri: “Ndɛ oli ŋã!” Wuo: “ndɛ oli ku!” Ol'ebee oyi, olɔ ebee ntiin otsuu. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Ke ngwel wɛ, m'emfa kyɛn ɔ̃bɛɛn-a-nzyel ke ywel ayɛɛl ɔ̃kiri ndyam wueel, èkal emfa kiki me tsoo li eya Muaan a mbuul. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ŋ'ɛ̃kwel kɛn ebvaan ndɛ amwɛn fool bibi, bvool ebvaan baal ba lio li atiɔ ndɛ eboo hɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />M'ãtsoo m'èya Muaan a mbuul, ãndɔɔ ãkieel ãbwel onge m'ébwel mɔ̃ me lio e Nowa. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Me lio olɔ, baal ákedza, ákenywã, ákebaal, bvool ákewa baan a bɔ k'ãbal, tiil tsoo li ésam Nowa onse ebɛɛ. Me tsoo olɔ, mpel yi enɛn éyi, bvool ébam baal bam bueel. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Ãndɔɔ ãkieel ãbwel hɛ̃ m'emfa ki ébwel mɔ̃ me lio e Loti. Me lio olɔ, baal ákedza, ákenywã, ákesuun eluɔ, áketiɔ eluɔ, ákekwɛn, bvool áketuu ãnzɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Kɛn a tsoo li épal Loti onse Sodom, Nziã ási kwɛn mvel wu ãkyal a mbaa andwɔɔ, bu abam baal bam bueel. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Ãndɔɔ ãkieel ãkal emfa ngemɔ̃ hɛ̃ me tsoo li èpal Muaan a mbuul.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Me tsoo olɔ, okɛɛn mbuul oli ke ywel a nzɔ, ndɛ abee obesool, me ndɔɔ yi àyewal eluɔ e ndɛ bvi eli onse nzɔ. Emfa kiki hɛ̃, okɛɛn mbuul oli onse ãnguun, ndɛ abee nzɔ obekɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Emeetsam me m'ã́bwel m'ɔ̃kal a Loti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Mbuul wu àbii k'abvuul elaã e ndɛ, àywɛn a lɔ. Mbuul hɛ̃ wu àywɛn a lɔ, wu àbvuul lɔ. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, me tsia ondɛ, baal buaal b'akieel akal me twal nkal a ntal ngamɔ̃, akieel awal ngɔmɔ̃, akieel asiil wumɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Akaal buaal b'akieel atswa nsia mboo mɔ̃, akieel awal ngɔmɔ̃, akieel asiil wumɔ̃. [ <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Abɔɔl buaal b'akieel asal mboo mɔ̃ onse ãnguun, akieel abiri ngɔmɔ̃, akieel asiil wumɔ̃<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">«Abɔɔl buaal b'akieel asal mboo mɔ̃ onse ãnguun, akieel abiri ngɔmɔ̃, akieel asiil wumɔ̃.» Ndɔɔ yi k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>.]» <verse eid="LUK 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Obobɔ, ayio afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãkieel ãbwel kwɛn-a-kwɛn?» Ndɛ obveel bɔ bubu: «Mboo yi èkal ebiĩ, yi èbvɔɔn angɔ-nywɛn.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri baal bueel akieel ayɛɛ mboo yi ekieel ebwel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃.</char></note>»<figure style="fig" alt="Maison avec toit en terrasse" file="LB00234c.tif" size="col" copy="Louise Bass, © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994" ref="17.31" /><verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Mboo a twel y'ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yeso oti bɔ mboo, me ndɔɔ yi asuo bɔ kwɛn bɔ ebvaan abebuɛɛn Nziã ãlio mam mbueel, owɔɔl wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Onse bviil ngelemɔ̃, éli ye twel ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn k'ákebal Nziã ndyam wɛ, k'áli hɛ̃ ye bvɛɛ e mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Onse bviil olɔ, éli hɛ̃ y'ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃pfiil wu ákeya twel ondɛ oliaal ndiri: “Tsiil ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ y'ɔ̃taal a mɛ̃!” <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ãlio boo-boo, twel ondɛ ákebee kɛn obee. Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, ndɛ oyɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam bubu: “Onkyam ŋɛn mɛ̃ k'ebebal Nziã wɛ, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ke ndi ye bvɛɛ e mbuul si ngɔmɔ̃ wɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />onge bɛn ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil wu abewɛɛl mɛ̃, ngesɛ mɛ̃ nsiil ndɔɔ a ndɛ y'ɔ̃taal a ndɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ tiil ye k'efa ndɔɔ oyɔ, ndɛ bvool abee mɛ̃ nkyal obeya osa.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Mfam olweel bubu: «Eyoo emfa ki eyɛɛn twel wu ɔ̃bi-ɔ̃bi ondɛ! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Obobɔ, byɛ b'etsam wɛn Nziã k'atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal b'ésueel ndɛ, b'abelel ola ndɛ tsia ye mwiĩ wɛ? Ndɛ ol'osuul bɔ abekiaal kɛn okiaal? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ndɛ àtsiil ãndɔɔ a bɔ tswa-a-tswa. Kɛn a ŋ'èya Muaan a mbuul, ndɛ olɔ oyebɔɔ b'ali y'okiool me Nziã me nsie?»<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo a Ɔ̃falisaye y'ɔ̃twal-mpal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yeso bvool oti mboo yi, me ndɔɔ a baal b'abetsam ndiri bɔ b'ali dzu ke mviil ã Nziã, bvool abefiɛɛn bakyɛ: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />«Tsoo ngelemɔ̃, baal buaal ayɛn Nzɔ a Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi abuɛɛn. Ngɔmɔ̃ ali Ɔ̃falisaye, wukyɛ áli mbuul wu awal mpal. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Ɔ̃falisaye otɛɛn, bvool obuɛɛn onse ɔ̃kwal bubu: “Ee Nziã, mɛ̃ mveel yɛ ãtuɛɛn, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi onge baal b'asiil wɛ: Bɔ ali baal a pfuul, baal bɛn k'ali dzu wɛ, ye b'aturu anga-akal. Mɛ̃ ntuɛɛn yɛ hɛ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn mɛ̃ ke ndi onge ɔ̃twal-mpal wu wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Onse eyenge ɔ̃tsiin, mɛ̃ ebesa ãbuɛɛn mɛn k'adza wɛ nsa yuaal. Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ebewa yɛ boo ngemɔ̃ onse ãboo kuun m'obɔɔ o mɛ̃ bam bueel.” <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Me b'otal ɔ̃twal-mpal, ndɛ otɛɛn li ndyam lela, mviɔɔl m'ɔ̃kwal, k'ákedzii bam si ekal k'aseel mviil ke ywel wɛ, bvool oyɛɛn ndiri: “Ee Nziã, sio mɛ̃ nyiĩ, mɛ̃ ndi mbuul a ãbi.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yeso bu alweel ndiri: «Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ɔ̃twal-mpal, me lio li ebvool ndɛ nzɔ, oyii mbuul wa dzu ke nkwel a Nziã, k'Ɔ̃falisaye wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, mbuul wu andɛɛl nzuru, àkuaal ndɛ, kɛn a mbuul wu akuaal nzuru, àndɛɛl ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ye baan b'abwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Baal abiri baan b'abwee ola Yeso, kwɛn ndɛ andɔɔl bɔ kuɔɔl. Ŋ'emwɛn ayio obobɔ, bɔ ayiaan baal obɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Kɛn a Yeso otam kwɛn aya ye bɔ ola ndɛ, bvool oyɛɛn ndiri: «Eyɔɔl baan b'abwee aya ola mɛ̃, ebee bɔ nkuul okii. Ke ngwel wɛ, Okwɛn o Nziã oli bo baal b'ali onge baan b'abwee. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wɛn k'ayɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã onge muaan wu ɔ̃bwee wɛ, k'akoo k'asam onse bɔ hɛ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso y'ɔ̃pfel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Mfam ngɔmɔ̃ ofuul Yeso ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee wa ngesɛ, ki esa mɛ̃ emã, kwɛn mɛ̃ mbɔɔ elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu?» <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɔɔ mã yi eta yɛ mɛ̃ me mbuul wa ngesɛ? K'eli ye mbuul wa ngesɛ wɛ, wa ngesɛ kɛn a Nziã ndyam. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Yɛ yɛɛ kwɛn ãngel ãyɛɛn bubu: “Oyɛɛ ke dzuu y'ɔ̃kal wuo y'ɔ̃lam a mbuul wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke bam mbuul wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke turu eluɔ e mbuul wɛ. Oyɛɛ ke buru ngandoo-mbuul ndɔɔ wɛ. Lweel tal ye ngoo a yɛ.”» <verse eid="LUK 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Mbuul ondɛ obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ebekiaal ãngel omɔ̃ mam mbueel, fa obwee o mɛ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Ŋ'eyoo Yeso ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ olieel ndɛ bubu: «Eywɛn yɛ kɛn ndɔɔ ngamɔ̃: Tiɔ eluɔ bvam bvieel bvi eli a yɛ, kab nzi oyɔ aywal. Obobɔ, yɛ àbɔɔ opfel ke ywel. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ya, luɛɛn a mɛ̃!» <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Ŋ'eyoo mbuul ondɛ obobɔ, ndɛ nzuru esool yam bibi. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ áli y'opfel bam bibi.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Ŋ'emwɛn Yeso kwɛn mbuul ondɛ nzuru esool yam bibi, ndɛ oyɛɛn ndiri: «Eli ye fool lam bibi kwɛn apfel asam onse Okwɛn o Nziã! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Eli ye fool kwɛn nyam wu ɔ̃mbiri ãpfuũ abwel onse pfee e nyuɔ̃. Kɛn osam b'ɔ̃pfel onse Okwɛn o Nziã, oyɔ ndɔɔ yi enduru fool yam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yeso ke ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri ɔ̃pfel k'akoo k'asam onse Okwɛn o Nziã wɛ, ndɛ odzii k'asuo ndiri ndɔɔ yi enduru okuun yi awa Nziã nkuul yi akal Mfam nkal omwiĩ o bia-byɛ, ekal ɔ̃pfel, ekal ɔ̃ywal.</char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Baal b'ayoo ãndɔɔ m'eyɛɛn Yeso afuul ndiri: «Ke m'emfa okyɛ, wɛn olɔ obvuul nã?» <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yeso obveel ndiri: «Ãndɔɔ mɛn baal k'akoo m'osa wɛ, Nziã asa mɔ̃.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi eyɛɛn Yeso edzii k'esuo kwɛn, baal k'akoo k'abvuul me mpɛn a bam wɛ, kɛn a Nziã wu okoo m'obvuul o bɔ.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Piɛɛl bu alieel Yeso ndiri: «Tal, bee esiil bvam bvieel bvi éli a bee, me ndɔɔ yi eluɛɛn a yɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mbuul wu osiil nzɔ a ndɛ, ɔ̃kal a ndɛ, baan-ngoo a ndɛ, eburu e ndɛ, wuo baan a ndɛ, me ndɔɔ Okwɛn o Nziã, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />àbɔɔ eluɔ obvɛ bvi enduru me lio li, y'elaã li ɔ̃bu nkal ɔ̃bu, me lio li èya.»<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ okwa y'osiool o ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yeso obiri atam a ndɛ ange-kuun ye buaal me pyɛ, bvool olieel bɔ ndiri: «Etal, bia-byɛ ŋ'ebeyi Yelusalem, me ndɔɔ yɛn mam mbueel m'ékel aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã me ndɔɔ a Muaan a mbuul, ŋ'ayii asa mɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ke ngwel wɛ, àtiɔ ndɛ me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ. Àsyob ndɛ, àtuaal ndɛ mpal, àfaan ndɛ ãntɛɛ, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />àbɛɛl ndɛ, bvool àbam ndɛ. Kɛn a me tsoo li ãtyel, ndɛ àsiool.» <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Kɛn antam k'abɔɔ m'eyɛɛn Yeso otsɛn wɛ. Ãyɛɛn omɔ̃ ola bɔ k'ã́li kal-a-kal wɛ. Bɔ k'abɔɔ ɔ̃nki a ndɔɔ wu ékeyɛɛn ndɛ wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso obvuul ɔ̃nkwa-mviil ke Dzeliko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Ŋ'eyii Yeso tsotsoo ye Dzeliko, ɔ̃nkwa-mviil ngɔmɔ̃ ábvi nsɛn me pyɛ e nkuul, bvool ákelaa nzi ola baal. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Ndɛ oyoo enkiin ki embuul ki ékebwel, bu afuul otsɛn o ndɔɔ. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Baal abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yeso wa Nadzalet mbuul wu abwel!» <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ndɛ bu abiool ndiri: «Yeso, Muaan a David, sio mɛ̃ nyiĩ!» <verse eid="LUK 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Baal b'ákedzuu ke nkwel embuul abvi ndɛ opɛɛn ndiri asuul nkyal, kɛn a ndɛ bvool obiool bam kokɔ, ndiri: «Muaan a David, sio mɛ̃ nyiĩ!» <verse eid="LUK 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yeso otɛɛn bvool otam kwɛn aya ye ndɛ. Ŋ'etɔ bɔ ye ndɛ tsotsoo a Yeso, ndɛ ofuul ndɛ ndiri: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />«Ndɔɔ mã yi edzii yɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ nsa yɛ?» Ndɛ obveel Yeso ndiri: «Mfam, mɛ̃ nzii k'emwɛn bvool!» <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yeso bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Oŋɔ̃ mwɛn bvool! Onge b'elɔ yɛ okiool onse mɛ̃, yɛ ŋe bvuul!» <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Kɛn ɛ̃kiri-anka oŋɔ̃, ndɛ obɛɛn omwɛn bvool. Ndɛ obvi Yeso oluɛɛn onse otuɛɛn o Nziã. Ŋ'emwɛn baal bam bueel ndɔɔ yi ebwel, bɔ abvi Nziã olweel.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Yeso ye Dzatswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yeso osam onse bviil li Dzeliko, bu atsiil lɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, onse bviil olɔ, éli ye mbuul wɛn nkuũ Dzatswe. Ndɛ áli mfam a asal b'atwal mpal, bvool áli ɔ̃pfel. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Dzatswe ákebii k'amwɛn mbuul nga-nkuũ Yeso onse baal bueel obɔ, kɛn a ndɛ k'ákekoo k'amwɛn ndɛ wɛ, me ndɔɔ embuul, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ áli ɔ̃pfi-ɔ̃pfi. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Obobɔ, ndɛ otsuu ntiin oyɛn nkwel, bvool owueel ɔ̃ti, me ndɔɔ yi amwɛn Yeso, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ ákebwel m'olɔ.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Ŋ'etɔ Yeso ke mboo yi éli Dzatswe, ndɛ oseel mviil nkal a ndɛ, bu alieel ndɛ ndiri: «Dzatswe, sool tswa-a-tswa! Ke ngwel wɛ, nonɔ̃ ŋã, lɔɔ e mɛ̃ èkal ke nzɔ a yɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Dzatswe bu asool bam wa-a-wa, bu ayɔɔ Yeso y'esɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Ŋ'emwɛn baal bueel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ abvi Yeso ofiɛɛn ndiri: «K'amwɛn obɔ, Yeso oyɛn oyesam lɔɔ ola mbuul a ãbi!»<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Kɛn a Dzatswe otɛɛn ke nkwel a Mfam, bvool olieel ndɛ bubu: «Mfam, mɛ̃ èwa aywal epie ki opfel o mɛ̃. Okɛɛn mɛ̃ ewel nzi y'ɔ̃nduul ola mbuul, mɛ̃ èbveel ndɛ ɔ̃bvɛn wu asa ondɛ nsa nã.» <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Obobɔ, Yeso oyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ wu Dzatswe ndiri: «Nonɔ̃ ŋã, obvuul osam onse nzɔ yi, ke ngwel wɛ mbuul wu hɛ̃ oli ngɔmɔ̃ onse yam li Abalayam. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Ke ngwel wɛ, Muaan a mbuul oyebii bvool oyebvuul b'ádziɔɔn.»<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo yi asal atyel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Onge bɛn baal ákeyoo ãyɛɛn ã Yeso, ndɛ bvool oti mboo. Baal áketsam kwɛn Okwɛn o Nziã ol'omɔɔn tswa-a-tswa oŋɔ̃, me ndɔɔ yɛn Yeso al'oyii tsotsoo ye Yelusalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Mboo yi éti Yeso éli bubu: «Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ onse yam li okwɛn oyɛn oyebviaal mpu k'ɔ̃kiri wa lela, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ àyebvool, me ndɔɔ yi akal ɔ̃kwɛn a nsie a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Kɛn a ye k'ekeyi ndɛ, ndɛ oti baal kuun mbel onse asal a ndɛ, bu awi bɔ nzi yi ãbvieel kuun. Ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: “Eta obɔɔ̃ me nzi yi tiil k'èyebvool mɛ̃!” <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Kɛn a baal b'ɔ̃kiri a ndɛ ákebyal ndɛ. Obobɔ, bɔ ayuɔɔl baal ke mbee a ndɛ, kwɛn bɔ ayeyɛɛn ndiri: “Bee k'edzii kwɛn mbuul ondɛ akal ɔ̃kwɛn a bee wɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Onkyam obobɔ, ndɛ obvieel mpu, bu ayekɔɔl.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:15">«Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ, ndɛ oti asal b'éwi ndɛ nzi yi obɔɔ̃ mbel. Ndɛ ákedzii k'ayɛɛ ɔ̃ndɔɔl wu ébɔɔ bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ɔ̃sal wu ɛ̃kwel oyi, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: “Mfam, mɛ̃ mbɔɔ ɔ̃ndɔɔl wa nzii yi ãbvieel kuun.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Mfam obveel ndɛ ndiri: “Ngesɛ, yɛ ɔ̃sal wa ngesɛ li! Yɛ ŋ'esuo kwɛn yɛ li dzu me ndɔɔ yam yi nsi-nsiri. Obobɔ, mɛ̃ nsuul yɛ mfam nkal ãbviil kuun.” <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Ɔ̃sal wa buaal oyi, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: “Mfam, mɛ̃ mbɔɔ ɔ̃ndɔɔl wa nzi yi ãbvieel ãtaan.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Mfam obveel ndɛ ndiri: “Ee! Emfa kiki, mɛ̃ nsuul yɛ mfam nkal ãbviil ãtaan.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />«Ɔ̃sal wukyɛ bvool oyi hɛ̃, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: “Mfam, tal nzii e yɛ yɔ bu. Mɛ̃ ekwee yɔ m'otsɔɔn onse ekɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ eli ye buɔ o yɛ, yɛ li mbuul wa mviil mpɛn, yɛ abewal eluɔ bvɛn k'eli bvi yɛ wɛ, yɛ abeka bvɛn yɛ k'akwɛn wɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Mfam obveel ndɛ bubu: “Ɔ̃sal wu empwɛɛn! Yɛ bu àbva kɛn a m'ãyɛɛn ã yam obɔ. Yɛ ayɛɛ kwɛn mɛ̃ ndi mbuul wa mviil mpɛn, mɛ̃ wu ebewal eluɔ bvɛn k'eli bvi mɛ̃ wɛ, mɛ̃ wu ebeka bvɛn mɛ̃ k'ekwɛn wɛ, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />ke yɛ abee nzii e mɛ̃ ke nzɔ yi abekwɛɛ nzi oyesuul emã? Yɛ okɛɛn asi obobɔ, ŋe yemvool mɛ̃ ŋã, kɛn mɛ̃ ekeewal yɔ y'ɔ̃ndɔɔl!”»<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />«Oŋɔ̃ obɔ, mfam otam baal b'áli oŋɔ̃ ndiri: “Ewɛɛl ndɛ nzi yi ãbvieel oyɔ, ewa yɔ wu oli ye nzi kuun!” <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Kɛn a baal obɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: “Mfam, ndɛ mpii tsɔɔn oli ye yɔ kuun!” <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Mfam obveel bɔ bubu: “Mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Mbuul wu oli ndyam y'elu-luɔ, àlweel ndɛ bvikyɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eluɔ k'eli kɛn a bvi amwɛn me mviil wɛ, ekoo m'okal hɛ̃ ɔ̃sal wu etam Nziã mbuul osa.</char></note>. Kɛn a wɛn kyam pyɛ, àmbaal onkyam k'emã-mã ki esiil ye ndɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />«Me b'otal ataal a mɛ̃ bɛn k'ákedzii kwɛn mɛ̃ nkal ɔ̃kwɛn a bɔ wɛ, eya mɛ̃ ye bɔ ŋã, kwɛn atiɛɛn bɔ ãbwel ke nkwel a mɛ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osam o Yeso Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Ke mbee a ŋ'eyɛɛn Yeso ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ obvi nkwel e mbuul e baal, bu atwel nkuul yi eyi tiil Yelusalem. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Onge bɛn ndɛ al'ayii atɔ tsotsoo ola bo Betefadze ye bo Betani, nku-a-nku a nkio yi ata me nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve, ndɛ otam ayio a ndɛ buaal, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />ndiri: «Eyi onse ola b'otaal ke nkwel a byɛ ba. Me lio li esam byɛ onse bɔ, byɛ èmwɛn muaan-ane wu akuru me swɛ, wɛn mbuul mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn anɔɔn nkal a ndɛ wɛ. Enyiɔɔn ndɛ, eya ye ndɛ ŋã. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Okɛɛn mbuul ofuul byɛ ndiri: “Otsɛn omã b'enyiɔɔn byɛ ndɛ?”, byɛ èbveel kɛn a ndɛ wɛn: “Mfam oli ye kɔɔ e ndɛ.”»<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />B'étam Yeso ayɛn, amwɛn ãndɔɔ kɛn a m'emfa ki eyɛɛn ndɛ bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Me lio li eyii nyiɔɔn bɔ muaan-ane ondɛ, anga-ndɛ afuul bɔ ndiri: «Otsɛn omã b'enyiɔɔn byɛ muaan-ane ondɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Bɔ abveel bɔ ndiri: «Mfam oli ye kɔɔ e ndɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Bɔ abiri ndɛ ola Yeso. Bɔ bu ayel ekɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekɔ bvi émbaal bɔ, éli akadzaka obɔ.</char></note> e bɔ nkal ɔ̃nguo a ane, bvool bu asuul Yeso anɔɔn nkal a ndɛ<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Dza 9.9</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Ŋ'ékebwel ndɛ, baal ákeyal ekɔ e bɔ nkal a kuul. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Ŋ'eyii ekwɛɛn bɔ sua Yelusalem, me li nkuul yi efa nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve, embuul ki ayio eluul m'esɛ. Bɔ bu abvi Nziã olweel me nki yi kokɔ, me ndɔɔ emvieel bvam bvieel bvi émwɛn bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Bɔ ákeyɛɛn bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">«Yɔɔl kwɛn ɔ̃kwɛn wu aya me nkuũ a Mfam Nziã akal y'ondɔɔl o kuɔɔl!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">Bia-byɛ elweel Nziã wa ke ywel!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 19:38">Yɔɔl kwɛn opi okal mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a Nziã ye baal a ndɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Onse embuul okɔ, éli y'Afalisaye ke kwɛ. Bɔ ayɛɛn Yeso ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, pɛɛn ayio a yɛ akal pi!» <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Okɛɛn bɔ akal pi, ãnkɔɔn ã̀kuaal ɛ̃sɔɔl!»<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso olel me ndɔɔ a Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Ŋ'etɔ Yeso bam kɛn a tsotsoo a Yelusalem bvool ŋ'emwɛn ndɛ bviil olɔ, Yeso olel me ndɔɔ a lɔ, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />ndɛ bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Yɛɛl! Yelusalem, yɛ nonɔ̃ k'abɔɔ otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ m'ãwa yɛ opi wɛ! Kɛn a meba ŋã, alwɔɔn yɛ opi obɔ! <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Kɛn ãtsoo mã fool ã̀yeya me ndɔɔ a yɛ: Ataal a yɛ àdzii yɛ, me ndɔɔ yi adzɔɔ yɛ eta m'epie e yɛ bvam bvieel. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Bɔ àtsal yɛ, yɛ ye baal a yɛ, bɔ k'àsiil onkyam nkɔɔn ke ywel a yinkyɛ wɛ. Ke ngwel wɛ, yɛ k'áyɛɛ lio li éyi Nziã yɛ owuaal wɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso otswɛɛl atiɔ onse Nzɔ a Nziã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yeso osam onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bu abvi b'áketiɔ eluɔ onse yɔ otswɛɛl. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri onse ɔ̃nkaan wu ɔ̃nsensal, Nziã ayɛɛn bubu: «Nzɔ a mɛ̃ èkal nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn. Kɛn a byɛ emeesuul yɔ eyii mboo yi edziɔɔn baal a pfuul<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Edz 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Dze 7.11</ref></char></note>!»<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Yeso ákeyiool ãtsoo mam mbueel onse Nzɔ a Nziã. Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã, y'ayiool b'ãngel, y'akuul-kuul b'ola, ákebii ndɛ wu abam. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Kɛn a bɔ k'áyɛɛ emfa ki esa bɔ wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ baal bam bueel ákeyoo ndɛ owuun bam wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Ndɔɔ yi etal okwɛn o Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Tsoo ngelemɔ̃ onse ãtsoo omɔ̃, Yeso áketee onse Nzɔ a Nziã, bvool ákeliaal baal Nsia yi Ngesɛ. Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã, y'ayiool b'ãngel, y'akuul-kuul apal oŋɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Bɔ bu afuul ndɛ bubu: «Me liaal bee bam: Okwɛn b'ebesa yɛ ãndɔɔ mã, bo nã, wuo wu owi yɛ okwɛn obɔ nã?»<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Yeso obveel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ mveel byɛ ɔ̃mfuul wu, emeebveel mɛ̃ ndɛ: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Wu áyuɔɔl Dzaã me ndɔɔ yi awa baal opongo nã: Nziã wuo baal?» <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Kɛn a bɔ abvi otsuun bam-a-bam ndiri: «Bia-byɛ ebveel ndɛ wɛn: “Wu áyuɔɔl ndɛ Nziã”, ndɛ mpii ol'ofuul bia-byɛ ndiri: “Ke ki ébee byɛ Dzaã okiool emã?” <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Kɛn a ŋɛn bia-byɛ ebveel ndɛ wɛn: “Wu áyuɔɔl ndɛ baal”, baal bam bueel ol'abam bia-byɛ m'ãnkɔɔn. Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ bueel abekiool ndiri Dzaã áli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.»<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Obobɔ, bɔ abveel kɛn a Yeso ndiri: «Bee k'eyɛɛ mbuul wu áyuɔɔl Dzaã, me ndɔɔ yi awa baal opongo wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yeso bu abveel bɔ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ hɛ̃ k'èyɛɛn byɛ okwɛn b'ebesa mɛ̃ ãndɔɔ mã wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo yi asal a bvine b'abi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oti baal mboo yi: «Mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ ákwɛn nguun a bvine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ol'aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã bibi, nguun a bvine eli yam li Isalayel. Etal onse </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-7">Edz 5.1-7</ref></char>.</note>. Ndɛ obuun yɔ m'asal, bu ayɛn odzuu b'ayiil. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Lio eyekoo li aka nsia, ndɛ oyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkyal ngɔmɔ̃ ol'asal ba ke nguun a bvine, kwɛn bɔ awa boo e bvine li ndɛ. Kɛn asal obɔ abɛɛl ɔ̃nkyal ondɛ, bu abveel ndɛ ãkɛɛ-ãkɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Nga-nguun oyuɔɔl bɔ ɔ̃nkyal wa buaal. Ondɛ hɛ̃ bɔ abɛɛl, atoo ɛ̃tswɛ bvool abveel ndɛ ãkɛɛ-ãkɛɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Ndɛ bvool oyuɔɔl ɔ̃nkyal wu atyel. Ondɛ obɔ, bɔ atɛn, bu atswɛɛl ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />«Nga-nguun a bvine bu ayɛɛn ndyam-a-ndyam ndiri: “Mɛ̃ oŋɔ̃ bwɛn-a-bwɛn èsa? Sa mɛ̃ ngyuɔɔl bɔ kɛn a muaan a myam wu ɔ̃tio, owɛɛl bɔ awel ndɛ ye bvɛɛ.” <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Kɛn a ŋ'etaal asal obɔ muaan ondɛ ayeya, bɔ abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: “Etal wu akieel awal ɔ̃swal a tal oyii aya! Ebam kɛn a ndɛ, kwɛn oŋɔ̃ ɔ̃swal a nguun akal wa bia-byam!” <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Obobɔ, bɔ apaal ndɛ onse nguun a bvine, bu abam ndɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Yeso bu afuul ndiri: «Nga-nguun ol'osi baal obɔ emã? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Ndɛ àya ndyam, àtam k'abam asal obɔ, bvool àwa nguun a ndɛ a bvine okiaal me baal akyam.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Ŋ'eyoo baal ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bɔ ayɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɔɔ yi bubu ebee yam ola bee obwel!» <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Obobɔ, Yeso otal bɔ pii, bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Otsɛn omã b'ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">“Nkɔɔn yi éti atuu pfɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:17">eyii nkɔɔn yi nkiin yi nzɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Etal onse Ãnzii 118.22.</char></note>”?<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Mbuul ndyam wueel wu àbva nkal a nkɔɔn oyɔ, àtsɔɔn. Yɔ ebva nkal a mbuul, yɔ èkyɛɛl ndɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ofuru o mpal yi ɔ̃kwɛn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Ayiool b'ãngel y'amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã abɔɔ otsɛn kwɛn Yeso oti mboo oyɔ me bɔ. Obobɔ, bɔ ayii abii k'asiin ndɛ kɛn aŋã-ŋã oŋɔ̃. Kɛn a bɔ ayoo buɔ o baal. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Bɔ bu abvi Yeso oliɔɔl, bvool bu ayuɔɔl ndɛ baal b'asa empa ki akal dzu. Bɔ ayii abii Yeso m'elyal onse ãyɛɛn ã ndɛ, kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ ãyal m'àyefɛn ndɛ ola mfam wu áli dziil li ɔ̃kwɛn wa Lom ke nsie a bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Baal obɔ alieel Yeso bubu: «Ɔ̃tee, bee eyɛɛ kwɛn yɛ abeyɛɛn otaa-taa, bvool yɛ abetee ãndɔɔ m'ãli dzu. Yɛ ke li y'ɔ̃bɛɛ wɛ, yɛ abetee baal nkuul a Nziã onse otaa-taa. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Oŋɔ̃ meyɛɛn bee, bee efuru mpaa yi ɔ̃kwɛn a Lom, wuo ebee yɔ ofuru?»<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yeso oyɛɛ ndiri ondɛ bɛɛ aywiin ndɛ. Ndɛ bu abveel bɔ bubu: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />«Esuo mɛ̃ nzi ngamɔ̃ yi ãbvieel! Nkal a nzi oyɔ eli y'osu o mbuul ye nkuũ a ndɛ. Ke mbuul ondɛ nã?» Bɔ abveel ndiri: «Mbuul ondɛ eli Sedzaal.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sedzaal nkuũ a okwɛn bo Lom.</char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yeso bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Eluɔ bvi Sedzaal, ewa ola Sedzaal, bvi Nziã, ewa ola Nziã.» <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Kɛn a bɔ k'abɔɔ elyal onse ãndɔɔ m'ékeyɛɛn ndɛ ke nkwel a baal wɛ. Esi bɔ ɛ̃kam bibi m'emfa ki ébveel ndɛ ɔ̃mfuul ondɛ, bɔ bu awuun kɛn a pi.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃mfuul me ndɔɔ osiool o b'ákwi-ákwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Asaduseyɛ̃ ke kwɛ ayi tsotsoo a Yeso. Bɔ baal bɛn k'abekiool kwɛn b'ákwi akieel asiool wɛ. Bɔ afuul Yeso bubu: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />«Ɔ̃tee, Moyize ákel bee onse ngel ndiri: “Ŋɛn bɔɔl okwi osiil ɔ̃kal wɛn ndɛ k'abɔɔ muaan ye ndɛ wɛ, mvɔɔl a ndɛ àwal ɔ̃pfiil ondɛ kwɛn bɔ abuo esii e baal me nkuũ a Ɔ̃pfu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Det 25.5-6</ref></char></note>.”»<verse eid="LUK 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />«Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, éli ye yam ngelemɔ̃ li baan b'abɔɔl nsiaan. Muaan wu ɛ̃kwel obaal ɔ̃kal, kɛn a ndɛ k'abɔɔ muaan y'ɔ̃kaal ondɛ wɛ, ndyam bu akwi. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Muaan wa buaal obaal ɔ̃pfiil, okwi hɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Muaan wu atyel tiil wa nsiaan asi kɛn obobɔ. Bɔ bueel akwi wu osiil muaan ye ndɛ pyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ɔ̃kaal ondɛ hɛ̃ okwi. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Obobɔ, bee edzii K'eyɛɛ bubu: Ŋ'ekieel esiool b'ákwi-ákwi, ndɛ àkal ɔ̃kal nã onse baan-ngoo ange-nsiaan? Ke ngwel wɛ, bɔ bueel ange-nsiaan ábaal ndɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yeso obveel bɔ ndiri: «Onse ɔ̃kiri wu, akaal y'abɔɔl abebaal bakyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Baal b'emwɛn Nziã kwɛn bɔ akieel asiool onse b'ákwi, àyekal onse ɔ̃kiri wu àya. Kɛn okɔ, bɔ k'àbebaal bakyɛ bvool wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Bɔ hɛ̃ k'àkoo k'abekwa bvool wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ àkal onge ãnzwel. Bɔ bvool àkal baan a Nziã, ke ngwel wɛ Nziã oseel bɔ onse b'ákwi-ákwi. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Moyize ásuo kal-a-kal ndiri, baal b'ákwi-ákwi akieel asiool. Ndɛ ásuo obobɔ ke mboo yi eyɛɛn me muaan-ɔ̃ti wu ákekaan mbaa k'adzio wɛ. Taa-taa bam, ndɛ áti Mfam Nziã ndiri “Nziã a Abalayam, Nziã a Isak, Nziã a Dzakab.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Me lio li ékeyɛɛn Moyize, Abalayam, y'Isak ye Dzakab, b'ákpi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn.</char></note>» <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Yeso olweel bubu: «Nziã oli Nziã a baal b'amwiĩ-mwiĩ, onkyam b'eyɛɛn baal ndiri bɔ ámaakwa, ke ngwel wɛ ke mviil ã Nziã, baal bueel ali mwiĩ.»<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Oŋɔ̃ obɔ, ayiool b'ãngel ke kwɛ alieel Yeso ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, yɛ yɛɛn ngesɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Bɔ bvool k'abekie k'afuul ndɛ ɛ̃mfuul ɛ̃kyam wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mãsia ye David</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oyɛɛn bɔ bubu: «Baal abeyɛɛn ndiri: “Mãsia oli muaan a David.” Ki ebeyɛɛn bɔ obobɔ m'emã? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Ke David ndyam mpii oyɛɛn onse ɔ̃nkaan wu Ãnziĩ ndiri:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">“Mfam Nziã oyɛɛn ye Mfam a mɛ̃ bubu:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 20:42">Y'abva nsɛn ke kuɔɔl e mɛ̃ ki elam,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />tiil ye k'esa mɛ̃ kwɛn yɛ dziaal ataal a yɛ m'odziaal.”<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Ŋɛn David oti Mãsia me “Mfam a ndɛ”, emfa emã kyɛn Mãsia bvool akal muaan a David?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muaan ŋã, ŋ'ayɛɛn ndiri ɔ̃tiɔɔl a David wa lela.</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebee onge ayiool b'ãngel okal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Ŋ'ékeyoo embuul e baal ãyɛɛn ã Yeso, ndɛ oyɛɛn ayio a ndɛ bubu: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />«Ebee onge ayiool b'ãngel okal! Bɔ adzii k'abedzuu m'ekɔ bvi ela bvi ela bvi esa kwɛn baal abio bɔ ye dzuun m'ãnkuul. Onse ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn, bɔ abewal ãmboo ã dzuun, bvool k'ãpfuun, bɔ abesuaal ãmboo mã nkwel. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Bɔ abewal eluɔ kyam kieel ki eli y'akaal b'apfiil, bɔ abesa ãbuɛɛn m'ãla-m'ãla, me ndɔɔ yi asa empa onge bɛn bɔ ali baal ba ngesɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, Nziã akieel awa bɔ etumbu ki enduru ki baal b'asiil mpuru.»<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Kab li ewi ɔ̃kaal wu ɔ̃pfiil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Ŋ'éli Yeso kɛn onse Nzɔ a Nziã, ndɛ atyal mviil nku-a-nku a ndɛ, ndɛ omwɛn apfel b'ákelɔ ãkab onse nkab yi alɔ mɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Ndɛ omwɛn hɛ̃ ɔ̃kaal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃pfiil wu ɔ̃ywal. Ɔ̃kaal ondɛ oyelɔ enzi-nzi bvi ãbvieel bviaal. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ndɛ bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, ɔ̃pfiil wu ɔ̃ywal wu olɔ nzi yi enduru yi baal bam bueel. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bam bueel awi kab li nzi yɛn bɔ k'ali ye kɔɔ e yɔ wɛ, kɛn a ndɛ, onkyam ŋɛn ndɛ oli ɔ̃ywal, ndɛ owi nzi yi ekeedza ndɛ me yɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso oyɛɛn ndiri Nzɔ a Nziã ekieel etsɔɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Baal bakyɛ ákeyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a Nzɔ a Nziã ndiri yɔ eli y'ompal, m'ãnkɔɔn m'ãbvɛ-ãbvɛ m'áliɛɛn yɔ, y'eluɔ bvi áwi Nziã ãkab. Kɛn a Yeso oyɛɛn ndiri: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />«Ãtsoo ãya ke nkwel mɛn eluɔ bvieel bvi emwɛn byɛ bvi ekieel etsɔɔn: Nkɔɔn si ngamɔ̃ k'ekieel esiil nkal a yinkyɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãndɔɔ m'ãkieel ãya ye k'efa ɔ̃kiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Obobɔ, bɔ afuul Yeso ndiri: «Ɔ̃tee, lio emã li ekieel eya ãndɔɔ omɔ̃? Eliĩ emã ki ekieel esuo baal kwɛn lio li ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ekoo?» <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Ndɛ bu abveel bɔ bubu: «Ekal y'onkyab, kwɛn abee byɛ opfuru. Ke ngwel wɛ, baal bibi akieel aya me nkuũ a mɛ̃, ndiri: “Mɛ̃ ndyam ndi Mãsia!”, bvool ndiri: “Lio lam emeekoo!”» Yeso olweel bubu: «Ebee bɔ oluɛɛn! <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Ŋ'ekieel eyoo byɛ ɔ̃sam wu ãmvel, ye tsungaa wu ebii baal amfam a bɔ ombaal, ebee ye buɔ okal, ke ngwel wɛ, ebvaan kwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ tsɔɔn ãbwel ŋ'ɛ̃kwel. Kɛn ɔ̃kiri kieel k'afa alili oŋɔ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Yeso bvool olieel bɔ ndiri: «Ãyam ã baal ãkieel ãdzwaan ye mãkyɛ, okwɛn ngɔmɔ̃ okieel odzwaan ye bokyɛ hɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Nsie ekieel enziool nzuru kokɔ, m'ãmboo m'ãmboo, ekieel ekal y'ɛ̃lɔɔ y'eywiri. Ãndɔɔ m'ongɛɛ ãkieel ãbwel, eliĩ bvi enɛn hɛ̃ ekieel epal ke ywel.»<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />«Kɛn a ye k'ebwel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ mbueel, akieel asiin byɛ, akieel atuaal byɛ fool. Akieel awa byɛ me mviɔɔl mi amfam b'ãnzɔ m'ãbuɛɛn, kwɛn atsiil ãndɔɔ ã byɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nzɔ a ãbuɛɛn ol'Ayuda k'éli kɛn a mboo yi abuɛɛn wɛ, yɔ hɛ̃ éli mbal yi atsiil ãndɔɔ ã baal, m'ãtal onziã.</char></note>, akieel atyal byɛ m'ãbwal. Me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, akieel abiri byɛ k'ãmbal ol'akwɛn y'amfam. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãkieel ãya onse byɛ, kwɛn byɛ eyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Eyɛɛ bam ngesɛ bubu: Byɛ kieel k'etsam me ndɔɔ emfa ki ekieel etsuun byɛ k'ãmbal wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Ke ngwel wɛ, myam wu ekieel ewa byɛ ãyɛɛn y'ãyal m'ãsa kwɛn ataal a byɛ k'akieel akoo m'obee o mɔ̃ wɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ k'àbɔɔ ãyɛɛn m'abveel byɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />«Onkyam atal a byɛ, y'angoo a byɛ, ye baan-ngoo a byɛ, y'eburu e byɛ, y'anga-ndoo a byɛ, bɔ akieel atiɔ byɛ, bɔ hɛ̃ akieel asa kwɛn abam baal bibi onse byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Baal bueel akieel abyal byɛ me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Kɛn efu li ɛ̃tswɛ ɛ̃ byɛ si ngemɔ̃ k'ekieel epiool wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ekal y'osɛ-mwiĩ, obobɔ byɛ ebɔɔ elaã!»<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otsal o Yelusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />«Ŋ'ekieel emwɛn byɛ kwɛn ekel li ambwel-mbwel edzii Yelusalem, eyɛɛ kwɛn otsɔɔn o bviil olɔ ŋ'oyii tsotsoo. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Obobɔ, me lio olɔ, yɔɔl kwɛn baal a nsie yi Yude abal onse ãnkio. B'akieel akiɔɔl ke Yelusalem, apal onse oŋɔ̃. B'akieel akiɔɔl k'ãnguun, abee bviil obekɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãtsoo omɔ̃ ãkieel ãkal m'ewa Nziã baal etumbu, me ndɔɔ yi asa mbueel m'eyɛɛn Endɔɔ e Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />M'ãtsoo omɔ̃, ãwua ol'akaal b'ãyam, ye b'awa baan ãbiaal! Taa-taa bam, ekieel ekal ye fool lam bibi onse ɔ̃kiri wu, Nziã akieel asuo mpuru a ndɛ nkal a baal ba. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Akieel abam bakyɛ m'epwel, akieel ayebiri bakyɛ me mpɛn k'ɛ̃kiri mvieel. Baal bɛn k'ayɛɛ Nziã wɛ akieel akyɛɛl Yelusalem bvool anyam ndɛ, tiil ŋ'ekieel ekoo lio li awi bɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oya o Muaan a mbuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />«Ekieel ekal y'eliĩ bvi emwã onse tal, ye nswii, y'angam-a-ngam. Me nsie, ãyam ã baal ãkieel ãkal y'ãwua ye buɔ, me ndɔɔ a nkyal yi kokɔ yi efa k'ãdza m'ɔ̃ngwa y'epoo e mɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Ŋ'ekieel etsam baal m'ãndɔɔ m'ãkieel ãya, bɔ akieel akwa m'ongɛɛ o mɔ̃, ke ngwel wɛ eluɔ bvieel bvi ke ywel ekieel etiɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Obobɔ, akieel amwɛn k'eya Muaan a mbuul onse epɛn y'omfam ye waan lueel. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Ŋ'ekieel ebɛɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ obwel, etɛɛn, eseel mviil ke ywel, ke ngwel wɛ obvuul o byɛ ŋ'òsa oya.»<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mboo yi ɔ̃ti wa fig</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso oti bɔ mboo yi: «Etal ɔ̃ti wa fig wuo ɛ̃ti myam mvieel. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Ŋ'emwɛn byɛ kwɛn ɔ̃ti obvi onyuɔɔn, oŋɔ̃ byɛ eyɛɛ me byam wɛn ɔ̃bvu wa ngesɛ wu atsam eluɔ ŋ'ayii atɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />M'emfa kiki, ŋ'ekieel emwɛn byɛ kwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãbvi obwel, eyɛɛ kwɛn Okwɛn o Nziã oyii tsotsoo. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn baal ba lio li kieel k'akwa wɛ, ye k'èya ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Ywel ye nsie ekieel ebwel, kɛn ãyɛɛn ã mɛ̃ k'ãkoo k'ãbwel mam wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Okal y'onkyab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />«Ekal y'onkyab! Efua bvi enduru ɔ̃ndel, obɔɔ o mbal, ãtsam me ndɔɔ eluɔ bvi ɔ̃kiri, eluɔ obvɛ ebee ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ olyam owa! M'emfa okyɛ, tsoo olɔ kieel k'ebva enseel me ndɔɔ a byɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Onge b'esiin okii answi enseel, emfa kiki hɛ̃, tsoo olɔ ekieel ebva enseel me baal b'ɔ̃kiri ndyam wueel. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Oŋɔ̃ ekal y'onkyab, ebuɛɛn ãlio mbueel, kwɛn Nziã awa byɛ mpɛn yi ebvuul me mbueel m'ãya, bvool yi etɛɛn ke nkwel a Muaan a mbuul.»<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Me mwiĩ, Yeso ákeyiool onse Nzɔ a Nziã, m'ãnkunkwal, ndɛ ákeyi nkio a ɛ̃ti mi Olibve, tsia ákebwel ndɛ okɔ. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Obobɔ, ŋ'éketsa bviil, baal bueel ákeya Nzɔ a Nziã, me ndɔɔ yi ayoo ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Amfam b'Ayuda akuru Yeso mfoo yi mbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ãtsoo ãsiil ke kwɛ m'asa pfuun li adza amampa bɛn k'ali ye lebviil wɛ, li ata me Pfuun li Onduru. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel ákebii ãyal m'abam Yeso, kɛn a bɔ áli ye buɔ o baal.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda okiool k'atiɔ Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Obobɔ, Ɔ̃pfu osam onse ɔ̃kwal a Yuda, wu ata hɛ̃ m'Isikaliot, wu áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio kuun ye buaal. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ndɛ wu Yuda oyɛn oyetal amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'amfam b'ankiaal a Nzɔ a Nziã. Ndɛ oyekuru mfoo ye bɔ, me ndɔɔ yi atal emfa ki etiɔ ndɛ bɔ Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Bɔ asia mpal, bvool akuru k'awa ndɛ nzi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Yuda bu akiool. Ndɛ bu ayii abii lio li ngesɛ li etiɔ ndɛ bɔ Yeso, lio lɛn baal k'àyɛɛ wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃yɛɛl me ndɔɔ a pfuun li Onduru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Tsoo li pfuun li adza amampa bɛn k'ali ye lebviil wɛ ekoo. Me tsoo olɔ, abewa kab li muaan-emɛmɛɛ̃ wu adza me pfuun li Onduru. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yeso otam Piɛɛl ye Dzaã, ndiri: «Eyewal ɔ̃yɛɛl wa pfuun li Onduru, kwɛn bia-byɛ edza lɔ!» <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ dzii kwɛn bee eyewal ɔ̃yɛɛl a lɔ kwɛn?» <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Eyoo: Ŋ'èsam byɛ onse Yelusalem, byɛ èmwɛɛn ye mbuul wu obiri mbuu a ãdza, eluɛɛn a ndɛ tiil nzɔ yi èsam ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Byɛ èyɛɛn ye nga-nzɔ bubu: “Ɔ̃tee otam bee yɛ ofuul ndiri: Etswi e nzɔ ki èyedza mɛ̃ pfuun li Onduru y'ayio a mɛ̃ kyɛn?” <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Obobɔ, ndɛ àsuo byɛ etswi e nzɔ ki ywel, ki enɛn, ki amaafaal: Oyɔ mboo yi èwal byɛ ɔ̃yɛɛl wa pfuun.»<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Ŋ'eyɛn bɔ, bɔ ayebɔɔ ãndɔɔ kɛn a m'emfa ki elieel Yeso bɔ. Bɔ bu awel ɔ̃yɛɛl wa pfuun li Onduru.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɔ̃laan a Mfam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ŋ'ekoo lio, Yeso owel mboo, me ndɔɔ yi adza y'antam a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Mɛ̃ ndi y'esɛ bibi ki edza bvi-odza bvi pfuun li Onduru li ye byɛ, ye k'emwɛn mɛ̃ fool. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn, mɛ̃ kieel bvool k'ebedza pfuun li wɛ, tiil ye k'ekoo otsɛn o lɔ onse Okwɛn o Nziã.»<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Ndɛ owel mbiɔ, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, bu ayɛɛn bubu: «Ewal mbiɔ yi, ekab mbal m'onse yɔ mpɛ̃-a-mpɛ̃ a byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ bubu: Mɛ̃ kieel bvool k'ebenywã mbal ã bvine wɛ, tiil ye k'eya Okwɛn o Nziã.»<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ owel mampa, obveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, otsiil ndɛ, owi bɔ ndɛ, bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Yi nzuru a mɛ̃ yi ngwi mɛ̃ kab me ndɔɔ a byɛ: Ebesa obobɔ me ndɔɔ yi etsam mɛ̃!» <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Ŋ'eman bɔ pfuun odza, Yeso bvool owel mbiɔ, bu alieel ndiri: «Yi mbiɔ yi ondoo b'alili b'atɛn m'ãkel ã mɛ̃, m'ãtsɔɔn me ndɔɔ a byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Kɛn etal: Mbuul wu àtiɔ mɛ̃ abedza ke misa ye mɛ̃ ŋã. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ebvaan kwɛn Muaan a mbuul akwa m'emfa ki ewɛɛ Nziã, kɛn ãwua ola mbuul wu otiɔ ndɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Obobɔ, antam abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Ondɛ mbuul nã onse bia-byɛ wɛn ol'osi ndɔɔ yi m'emfa okyɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuul wu onduru bakyɛ nã?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ayio abvi bam-a-bam otsuun ndiri: «Wu onduru bakyɛ onse bia-byɛ nã?» <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Akwɛn b'ɛ̃kiri abenyam baal b'ɛ̃kiri omyɛ̃, amfam a myɛ̃ hɛ̃ adzii kwɛn ata bɔ me baal b'asa obvɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Kɛn a byɛ, ebee onge bɔ osa! Yɔɔl kwɛn wu onduru bakyɛ onse byɛ akal onge wu obvool mbee, wu oli mfam hɛ̃ akal onge ɔ̃sal. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ke yam, wu onduru bakyɛ nã, wu adza, wuo wu li ɔ̃sal? Eli wu adza, k'obobɔ wɛ? Kɛn a mɛ̃ ndyam ndi onge ɔ̃sal onse byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Byɛ, byɛ eli baal b'ekuru nzuru me mɛ̃ owuun wɛ onse ãmpal me mwɛn mɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Obɔ otsɛn bɛn, onge bɛn Taal owi mɛ̃ Okwɛn, mɛ̃ hɛ̃ ngwi byɛ nkuul yi edza ye mɛ̃ onse Okwɛn o mɛ̃. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />M'emfa okyɛ, byɛ èdza, bvool ènywã misa ngɔmɔ̃ ye mɛ̃ onse Okwɛn o mɛ̃. Byɛ èbva nsɛn m'ãkiri m'akwɛn, me ndɔɔ yi etsiil ãndɔɔ m'ãyam kuun ye mbuaal mã baan b'Isalayel.»<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piɛɛl akieel atwɛn ndiri ndɛ k'ayɛɛ Yeso wɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel Simɔ̃ Piɛɛl ndiri: «Simɔ̃, Simɔ̃, yoo: Ɔ̃pfu asɔɔ nkuul yi anziool byɛ onge b'asiɔ nsia me ndɔɔ yi akab yɔ y'efeel. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Kɛn a mɛ̃ ebuɛɛn me ndɔɔ a yɛ, kwɛn okiool o yɛ obee ofa. Me b'otal yɛ, ŋ'ekieel ebvool yɛ ola mɛ̃, yɛɛ k'awa andoo a dzii mpɛn!» <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Piɛɛl obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, mɛ̃ nkiool bam k'eyi bwal ye yɛ, onkyam k'ekwa hɛ̃ ye yɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yeso bu alieel ndɛ bubu: «Piɛɛl, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn, ye k'ekuaal nswee nonɔ̃, yɛ àtwɛn nsa tyel wɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">M'ákel me Yeso ŋ'ãyii ãkoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel ayio bubu: «Lyal ŋ'éyuɔɔl mɛ̃ byɛ nzi pyɛ, ɔ̃paa pyɛ, asimpal hɛ̃ pyɛ, byɛ éywɛn eluɔ?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Bee k'éywɛn eluɔ si ngemɔ̃ wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ndɛ bvool olieel bɔ ndiri: «Kɛn a meba ŋã, wu oli ye nzi, awal yɔ. Wu oli y'ɔ̃paa, awal ndɛ hɛ̃. Wɛn k'ali y'epwel wɛ, atiɔ ekɔ e ndɛ, kwɛn ndɛ asuun kyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ke ngwel wɛ, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn byɛ wɛn ákel onse ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã ndiri: “Baal awel mbuul wu onge edzuul.” Taa-taa bam, ebvaan kwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃ ãkoo onse elaã e mɛ̃. Ke ngwel wɛ, ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ãtal mɛ̃ ŋ'ãyii ãkoo.» <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Obobɔ, ayio abveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, epwel bviaal mpii bu!» Ndɛ bu abveel bɔ ndiri: «Ekoo!»<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ãbuɛɛn ã Yeso nkal a nkio yi ɛ̃ti mi Olibve</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso opal, oyɛn nkio yi ɛ̃ti mi Olibve, onge b'ebesa ndɛ tsɔɔn. Ayio a ndɛ hɛ̃ aluɛɛn a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Ŋ'etɔ ndɛ okɔ, ndɛ olieel bɔ ndiri: «Ebuɛɛn kwɛn byɛ ebee onse ɔ̃mbio obva!» <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Ndɛ osyel muaan lela ye bɔ, me la lɛn onge li etyal mbuul embangwel. Ndɛ obvi ãbuo, bu abuɛɛn bubu: <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />«Taal, okɛɛn yɛ dzii, siaal mbiɔ yi fool yi lela ye mɛ̃. Kɛn a yɔɔl kwɛn yɛ bee be nzii mɛ̃ osa, yɛ sa b'edzii yɛ.» [ <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Obobɔ, ãnzwel ãfi ywel, me ndɔɔ yi ãwɛɛl ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Ãwua mã bibi ãbɔɔ ndɛ, ndɛ bu abvi obuɛɛn y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃. Tsool li abwel-bwel eti ndɛ, eyii onge ãtɛɛ m'ãkel m'ãketswal me nsie.]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Ŋ'eman ndɛ obuɛɛn, ndɛ otɛɛn, okɔɔl ol'ayio. Ndɛ oyebɔɔ bɔ amaayiool me twal li ãwua. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Ndɛ bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Emã, byɛ eyii me twal? Etɛɛn, ebuɛɛn, kwɛn byɛ ebee m'ɔ̃mbio obva.»<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asiin Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Ŋ'ékeyɛɛn Yeso kɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, embuul e baal eloo. Mbuul wu ata me Yuda, wu áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio ange-kuun ye buaal, ákebiri bɔ. Ndɛ osyel tsotsoo a Yeso, me ndɔɔ yi abuun ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yeso bu alieel Yuda ndiri: «Obuun b'ebuun yɛ Muaan a mbuul, me ndɔɔ yi atiɔ ndɛ?»<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Ŋ'emwɛn ayio a Yeso ndɔɔ yi eyeya, bɔ afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Mfam, bee edzwaan ye bɔ m'epwel?» <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ opfel ɔ̃sal a ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn epwel, ndɛ bu atsɔɔ ndɛ tswi li elam. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Kɛn a Yeso oyɛɛn bubu: «Eyɔɔl, ekoo!» Ndɛ onywɛn a tswi e mbuul ondɛ, bu aboo lɔ.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso olieel amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'amfam b'ankiaal a Nzɔ a Nziã, y'akuul-kuul, b'áyi me ndɔɔ yi asiin ndɛ, ndiri: «Mɛ̃ edzuul ndi, kwɛn byɛ eya ola mɛ̃ y'epwel y'ɛ̃mpaã? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Ãtsoo mbueel, mɛ̃ éli ye byɛ onse Nzɔ a Nziã, byɛ k'esiin mɛ̃ wɛ. Meba ŋã, lio e byɛ li esal Ɔ̃pfu onse empeel ŋ'ekoo.»<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Piɛɛl otwɛn Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Ke mbee a ŋ'esiin bɔ Yeso, bɔ abiri ndɛ, bvool aswɛɛl ndɛ onse nzɔ a ngaa-a-Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn. Piɛɛl ákeluɛɛn a ndɛ lela. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Bɔ abvool mbaa kal-a-kal ekɔɔ, bu abvi nsɛn. Piɛɛl hɛ̃ ábvi nsɛn onse bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ɔ̃sal ngɔmɔ̃ wu ɔ̃kaal omwɛn ndɛ me nsɛn nku-a-nku a mbaa, ndɛ olɔ ndɛ etɔ, bvool olieel bubu: «Mbuul wu hɛ̃ áli ye ndɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl otwɛn ndiri: «Ngu, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ ndɛ wɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ke mbee ãlio ke kwɛ, mbuul ɔ̃kyam omwɛn ndɛ, bvool olieel ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ bam li ngɔmɔ̃ onse ayio a mbuul wu.» Piɛɛl otwɛn ndiri: «Mfya, mɛ̃ ke ndi ɔ̃yio a ndɛ wɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Ke mbee a nku-a-nku a lio ngelemɔ̃, mbuul ɔ̃kyam bvool oyɛɛn bam y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mbuul wu hɛ̃ áli ye ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ oli ɔ̃fi-Ngalile.» <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Piɛɛl bu abveel mbuul ondɛ ndiri: «Ke-bwɛn-ndoo, mɛ̃ ke ngyɛɛ b'edzii yɛ oyɛɛn wɛ.» Kɛn a me lio li ékeyɛɛn ndɛ, nswee okueel.<verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Obobɔ, Mfam okɔɔl otal ndɛ yuul. Piɛɛl bu ayeel ãyɛɛn m'éyɛɛn Mfam ndɛ ndiri: «Ye k'ekuaal nswee nonɔ̃, yɛ àtwɛn nsa tyel wɛn yɛ ke yɛɛ mɛ̃ wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Piɛɛl bu apal nkwel-a-nzi, obvi elel obool y'ãwua mbueel.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛɛl Yeso bvool aswel ndɛ ɛ̃tswɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Baal b'ákekiaal Yeso ákesyob ndɛ, bvool ákebɛɛl ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Bɔ afoo ndɛ osu, bvool afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Oŋɔ̃ meta bvua! Wu obɛɛl yɛ nã?» <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Bɔ aswel ndɛ ɛ̃tswɛ myam bibi hɛ̃.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ke nkwel a mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Ŋ'etsi bviil, nkel akuul-kuul b'Isalayel, y'amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel, abvɔɔn. Bɔ bu abiri Yeso ke mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Bɔ afuul ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛɛn bee, yɛ ndyam Mãsia li?» Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Ŋɛn mɛ̃ ngyɛɛn byɛ wɛn mɛ̃ ndi ndɛ, byɛ k'èkiool bam wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Ŋɛn mɛ̃ hɛ̃ mfuul byɛ ɔ̃mfuul, byɛ hɛ̃ k'èbveel mɛ̃ ndɛ bam wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Kɛn a bɛɛn meba ŋã, Muaan a mbuul àbva nsɛn me kuɔɔl ki elam ki Nziã-nga-Waan.»<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Obobɔ, bɔ bueel afuul ndiri: «Ŋɛn Muaan a Nziã yɛ?» Ndɛ obveel bɔ ndiri: «Byam baal b'eyɛɛn ndiri mɛ̃ ndi ndɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Bɔ bu ayɛɛn ndiri: «Bia-a-byɛ bvool k'eli ye kɔɔ e mbuul wu ayɛɛn bia-byɛ ãndɔɔ mã kwɛn bia-byɛ ewa ndɛ etumbu wɛ, nzal-a-ŋɛn bia-byɛ eyoo k'eyɛɛn ndɛ mɔ̃ m'ɔ̃nywã a ndyam.»<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Yeso ke nkwel a mfam Pilate</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, baal a mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda bam bueel atɛɛn, bu abiri Yeso ola Pilate. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Okɔ, bɔ abvi ndɛ ofɛn bubu: «Bee eyebɔɔ ngaburu wu akelɔ tsungaa onse ɔ̃kiri a bee. Ndɛ akepɛɛn baal ndiri abee mpal yi ɔ̃kwɛn Sedzaal ofuru, ndɛ hɛ̃ akeyɛɛn ndiri ndɛ ndyam Mãsia wu ɔ̃kwɛn ali.» <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Obobɔ, Pilate ofuul Yeso ndiri: «Yɛ ndiri li ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda?» Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Yam mpii b'eyɛɛn yɔ obɔ.»<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Pilate olieel amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'embuul e baal b'ábvɔɔn oŋɔ̃ ndiri: «Mɛ̃ ke mwɛn elyal ki awa mbuul wu etumbu wɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Kɛn a baal apio ndɔɔ oyɔ yam ɛ̃mpɛɛn ndiri: «Ndɛ bam abelɔ tsungaa me nsie a bee yam yueel yi Yude m'ãtee ã ndɛ! Ndɛ obɛɛn ke Ngalile, meba ŋã, ndɛ bu amaaya tiil kwɛn!»<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso ke nkwel ɔ̃kwɛn Elode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Ŋ'eyoo Pilate k'atueel Ngalile, ndɛ ofuul ndiri: «Mbuul wu ɔ̃fi-Ngalile ali?» <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Ŋ'eyoo ndɛ ndiri Yeso ofi nsie yi Ngalile yi eli ke nsɛn okwɛn b'Elode Antipas, ndɛ oyuɔɔl Yeso ola ndɛ, ke ngwel wɛ kɛn a me lio olɔ, ndɛ wu Elode áli hɛ̃ ke Yelusalem.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Ŋ'emwɛn Elode Yeso, ndɛ osia mpaa bibi. Ke ngwel wɛ, ndɛ ákeyoo nsia a ndɛ, bvool etel-nziil ki ékedzii ndɛ k'amwɛɛn ye ndɛ. Ndɛ áketa kaã ndiri owɛɛl ndɛ ol'omwɛn Yeso osi emvieel. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Ndɛ bu afuul Yeso ɛ̃mfuul myam bibi, kɛn a Yeso k'abveel ndɛ ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Ŋ'esa oŋɔ̃, amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'ayiool b'ãngel áli oŋɔ̃, bvool bɔ áburu Yeso ãndɔɔ ye nkoo yueel.<verse eid="LUK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Obobɔ, Elode ofiɛɛn ndɛ. Ambwel-mbwel a ndɛ asi hɛ̃ emfa kiki. Ndɛ osɔɔl ndɛ. M'emfa okyɛ, ndɛ olaal ndɛ ɔ̃nkuru wu anyɛɛn, bu abveel ndɛ ola Pilate. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Elode ye Pilate tsɔɔn áli ataal. Kɛn a me tsoo olɔ, bɔ ayii andoo.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Awi Yeso etumbu ki epfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Pilate obvool amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã b'anɛn, akuul-kuul ye baal bueel. <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />Ndɛ olieel bɔ bubu: «Byɛ ebiri mbuul wu ola mɛ̃ ɔ̃tswɛ-pa ndiri ndɛ akelɔ tsungaa onse ɔ̃kiri. Kɛn a myam mfuul ndɛ ɛ̃mfuul ke nkwel a byɛ ŋã, mɛ̃ ke mwɛn elyal ki awa ndɛ etumbu wɛ, k'eli ye ndɔɔ si ngamɔ̃ onse m'efɛn byɛ ndɛ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Elode hɛ̃ k'amwɛn ndɛ ye ndɔɔ yi mbi-mbi wɛ, ke ngwel wɛ ndɛ obveel ndɛ ola bia-byɛ. Mbuul wu ŋɛn k'asi ndɔɔ yɛn obvie awi ndɛ etumbu ki epfu wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Mɛ̃ ètam kwɛn abɛɛl ndɛ ɔ̃dzii, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ èyɔɔl ndɛ.» [ <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Me lio li pfuun lam lueel li Onduru, Pilate ákepaal bɔ mbuul a bwal ngɔmɔ̃.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>]<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Kɛn a bɔ bam bueel abvi obiool ndiri: «Bam ngaburu wu, yɔɔl bee Balabas!» <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Balabas wu áli onse bwal me ndɔɔ yi ébvɔɔn ndɛ ye baal b'álɔ tsungaa ke Yelusalem, bvool obam mbuul. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Onge bɛn Pilate ákedzii k'ayɔɔl Yeso, ndɛ oyɛɛn y'embuul li nsa yuaal. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Kɛn a bɔ abiool ndiri: «Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu! Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu!»<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Kɛn a Pilate olieel bɔ li nsa tyel ndiri: «Obi omã b'esi ndɛ? Mɛ̃ ke mwɛn elyal ki awa ndɛ etumbu ki epfu wɛ. Mɛ̃ ètam kɛn a ndɛ ɔ̃dzii obɛɛl, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ mɛ̃ èyɔɔl ndɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Kɛn a bɔ apio ɛ̃mpɛɛn m'obiool bam kokɔ ndiri: «Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu! Bɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu!» Obiool o bɔ bu oyesa kwɛn Pilate otɔ k'okiool.<verse eid="LUK 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />M'emfa okyɛ, Pilate osi okwɛɛn, bu akiool k'asa b'edzii bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kɛn a ndɛ oyɔɔl Balabas wu ékesɔɔ bɔ, wu ásam bwal me ndɔɔ yi élɔ ndɛ tsungaa onse bviil, bvool ábam mbuul. Etɔ me Yeso, ndɛ owi bɔ ndɛ ndiri: «Ndɛ obɔ, esa b'edzii byɛ ndɛ osa!»<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abɛɛl Yeso m'enkulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Bɔ ayɛn ye Yeso. Me nkuul, bɔ amwɛɛn ye Simɔ̃ wa bviil li Silɛn, ndɛ áfi ãnguun. Bɔ bu awi ndɛ enkulusu, kwɛn ndɛ abiri kyɛ ke mbee a Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Embuul e baal ékenɔɔn a ndɛ. Eli hɛ̃ y'akaal bibi b'áluul m'ãnyiĩ, bvool ákelel me ndɔɔ a ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Obobɔ, Yeso okɔɔl osɔɔn bɔ, bu alieel bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ b'akaal a Yelusalem, ebee olel me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃, elel me ndɔɔ a byam ye baan a byɛ! <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ke ngwel wɛ, ãtsoo ãyeya m'akieel ayɛɛn ndiri: “Esɛ m'akaal b'empi ye bɛn mwɛn-éndɛɛl kɛn aburu wɛ, kɛn awi muaan biaal wɛ!” <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />M'emfa okyɛ, baal ol'abvi oyɛɛn y'ãnkio ndiri: “Ebva nkal a bee!”, y'ãnkio m'ãtsi-ãtsi ndiri: “Efoo bee!” <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Ke ngwel wɛ, okɛɛn asi ɔ̃ti wu ɔ̃bee bubu, ke wu ɔ̃kɛɛ, kieel bwɛn-a-bwɛn asa ndɛ?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baal bakyɛ atsam ndiri ndɔɔ edzii k'eyɛɛn ndiri: Okɛɛn asi bubu me mɛ̃ wa dzu, olɔ ekal bwɛn me mbuul wu ɔ̃bi wu obvaan m'etumbu?</char></note>»<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Me lio alili olɔ, bɔ abiri hɛ̃ baal buaal akyam b'áli edzuul, me ndɔɔ yi abam bɔ ye Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ ke mboo yi ata me «Ebiɔ ki ɔ̃tswɛ», bɔ abɛɛl Yeso m'enkulusu oŋɔ̃, bɔ hɛ̃ abɛɛl edzuul enge-bviaal obvɛ, kyɛn me kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki elam, kyɛn me kuɔɔl e ndɛ ki ekal. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />[Yeso oyɛɛn ndiri: «Taal, dzeel bɔ, ke ngwel wɛ bɔ k'akwaal otsɛn o m'esa bɔ wɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.34 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ndɔɔ yi k'ákel yɔ onse ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Nziã mikyɛ mi tsɔɔn-tsɔɔn wɛ.</char></note>] Bɔ ati ebie<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:19">Ãnz 22.19</ref></char></note>, m'okab b'ekɔ e ndɛ.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Embuul e baal éli oŋɔ̃, bvool éketal m'ãkebwel, amfam a bɔ ákesɔɔl Yeso ndiri: «Ndɛ wu abvuul bakyɛ, k'amebvuul nzuru a ndyam ti, okɛɛn ndɛ Mãsia wu esueel Nziã!» <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Ambwel-mbwel hɛ̃ abvi Yeso osɔɔl: Bɔ ayesuo ndɛ mbal ã ŋɛɛ̃, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Okɛɛn yɛ li ɔ̃kwɛn a Yuda, oŋɔ̃ mebvuul nzuru a yɛ yam!» <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Ke ywel ɔ̃tswɛ a Yeso, éli ye muaan-ebɛɛ wu ákel ãmpiri mã: «Mbuul wu oli ɔ̃kwɛn a Ayuda.»<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus est crucifié" file="WA03926b.tif" size="span" copy="Graham Wade, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="23.33-38" /><verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse edzuul bvi ábɛɛl m'enkulusu obvi Yeso osiaan ndiri: «Yɛ mpii ndiri Mãsia li! Bvuul nzuru a yam, bvuul bee hɛ̃!» <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Kɛn a wukyɛ oyiaan ndɛ ndiri: «Yɛ k'abal Nziã wɛ? Yɛ ndoo bɔɔ etumbu kiki onge ki ndɛ! <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Me bia-yɛ, eli ndɔɔ yi dzu: Bia-yɛ efuru ãbi m'ési ési. Kɛn a mbuul wu yi asi yi mbi yam pyɛ.» <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyɛɛn Yeso bubu: «Yeso, olɔ tsam me mɛ̃ me lio li èyekal yɛ m'omfam.» <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yeso obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mɛ̃ eyɛɛn yɛ wɛn: Nonɔ̃ ŋã, yɛ àkal ye mɛ̃ onse paladi.»<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epfu o Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44-45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44-45" />Ŋ'eyii lio nku-a-nku a tal dzu, empeel ebvi me nsie yueel, tal k'ebengal wɛ tiil lio li ãtyel ŋ'ekɔɔl tal. Ekɔ ki enɛn ki onse Nzɔ a Nziã bu ebɔɔl kal-a-kal. <verse eid="LUK 23:44-45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yeso obiool bam me nkii yi kokɔ ndiri: «Taal, mɛ̃ mveel ɔ̃fel a mɛ̃ onse mviɔɔl ɛ̃ yɛ.» Ke mbee ãyɛɛn omɔ̃, ndɛ otsuul mwiĩ.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Ŋ'emwɛn mbiri a ambwel-mbwel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, ndɛ olweel Nziã ndiri: «Taa-taa bam, mbuul wu ali dzu!» <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Ke mbee a ŋ'emwɛn embuul e baal ki ébvɔɔn me ndɔɔ yi etal k'ebwel ãndɔɔ, bɔ abvool ãnzɔ y'ãwua bibi. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Kɛn a baal bueel b'áyɛɛ Yeso, y'akaal b'áyi ndɛ osuul fa Ngalile, ál'atɛɛn lela, me ndɔɔ yi atal m'ã́kebwel.<figure style="fig" alt="Le rideau qui est dans le temple se déchire au milieu" file="GT00041.tif" size="col" copy="Gordon Thompson © 2012 Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc." ref="23.44-45" /><verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adziool ebiĩ e Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />Oŋɔ̃ éli ye mbuul ngɔmɔ̃ wɛn nkuũ Dzedzef, ɔ̃fi-ola b'Ayuda b'Alimate. Ndɛ áli ngɔmɔ̃ onse mbal yi nɛn yi Ayuda. Ndɛ áli mbuul wa ngesɛ, bvool wa dzu. Ndɛ k'ákiool ãndɔɔ m'ékuru bakyɛ ye m'ési bɔ wɛ. Ndɛ ákekiaal oya b'Okwɛn o Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ndɛ oyɛn ola Pilate, osɔɔ ebiĩ e Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ wu Dzedzef okuul kyɛ ke ywel enkulusu, odzii kyɛ onse ekɔ, bu ayedziool kyɛ onse mpiɛɛn yi átsam onse ãnkɔɔn, yɛn tsɔɔn kɛn adziool mbuul wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Éli me tsoo li awal ɔ̃yɛɛl wa saba. Saba al'ayii abɛɛn m'ãnkunkwal mã tsoo olɔ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ol'Ayuda tsoo ebebɛɛn ŋ'edziin tal. Saba áli tsoo li owuun li Ayuda. Ndɛ ákebva me tsoo lɛn otsa eyenge ola bia-byɛ.</char></note>.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Akaal b'áyi Yeso osuul fa Ngalile anɔɔn a Dzedzef. Bɔ amwɛn mpiɛɛn, atal emfa ki ásuul ebiĩ e ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, bɔ abvool ãlɔɔ ã bɔ. Bɔ afaal mbaal y'ãnasi me ndɔɔ ebiĩ e ndɛ. Kɛn a me tsoo li saba, bɔ awuun, onge b'etam ãngel.<figure style="fig" alt="Le corps de Jésus est mis au tombeau" file="DN00494b.tif" size="span" copy="Darwin Dunham, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="23.50-56" /><verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Osiool o Yeso m'epfu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Me tsoo li eyenge m'epal-epal kwɔɔl, akaal ayɛn mpiɛɛn. Bɔ abiri mbaal y'ãnasi m'éyɛɛl bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Bɔ amwɛn kwɛn ákeel nkɔɔn yi ádzool ɔ̃nywã a mpiɛɛn me pyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Bɔ asam onse mwiĩ a yɔ, kɛn a bɔ k'amwɛn ebiĩ e Mfam Yeso wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Kwɛn ŋɛn bɔ ebɔɔ e nsie emeedziɔɔn, abɔɔl buaal apal tsotsoo a bɔ m'ekɔ bvi enyɛɛn bibi. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Akaal buɔ obɔɔ bɔ bibi, bɔ bu apfeel ãsu. Baal obɔ alieel bɔ ndiri: «Otsɛn omã b'ebii byɛ mbuul wa mwiĩ onse b'ákwi-ákwi? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ndɛ bvool k'ali ŋã wɛ, ndɛ amaasiool. Eyeel ãndɔɔ m'ékeyɛɛn ndɛ byɛ me lio li éli ndɛ kɛn ke Ngalile, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />ndiri: “Ebvaan kwɛn atiɔ Muaan a mbuul me mviɔɔl ɛ̃ baal b'ãbi, abɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu. Ndɛ àsiool me tsoo li ãtyel.”» <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Obobɔ bɔ ayeel ãyɛɛn ã Yeso.<figure style="fig" alt="Jésus s’est réveillé de la mort (Deux anges parlent aux femmes au tombeau)" file="WA03931b.tif" size="col" copy="Graham Wade, © United Bible Societies, 1989" ref="24.4-8" /><verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Akaal ambal mpiɛɛn, ayeliaal mam mbueel m'ãbwel ol'antam ange-kuun y'ɔ̃mɔ̃, y'ayio bakyɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Akaal obɔ áli bɔ ba: Mali wu ola bo Magadala, ye Dzane, ye Mali wu ngoo a Dzak. Akaal bakyɛ b'áli ye bɔ ke mpiɛɛn alieel hɛ̃ nsia oyɔ ol'antam. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Kɛn antam amwɛn ãndɔɔ m'eyɛɛn akaal omɔ̃ ngwel, obobɔ bɔ k'akiool mɔ̃ wɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Kɛn a Piɛɛl otɛɛn otsuu ntiin ke mpiɛɛn. Ndɛ opfɔɔn, omwɛn kɛn ɛ̃pa mi ekɔ mi ádzii ebiĩ, ndɛ bu akɔɔl nzɔ y'ɛ̃kam bibi me m'ãbwel.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Me nkuul yi ayi ola b'Emahus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Kɛn a me tsoo alili olɔ, ayio a ndɛ buaal ákeyi ola b'ata m'Emahus. Ola obɔ ye Yelusalem oli m'akilometele abekuun ye buaal. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Ayio obɔ áketa ɔ̃sam wu ãndɔɔ mbueel m'ã́bwel. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Ŋ'éketa bɔ ɔ̃sam bvool áketsuun, Yeso ndyam otɔ, bu abvool nkuul ye bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ayio ákemwɛn ndɛ, kɛn a mviil ã bɔ ã́li m'ofoo: Bɔ k'ákekoo k'ayɛɛ ndɛ wɛ.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Ndɛ bu afuul bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ eyi etsuun, ke ndɔɔ yam mã?» Ayio bu atɛɛn y'ãwua mbueel. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Ngɔmɔ̃ onse bɔ wu ata me Kelopas obveel ndɛ ndiri: «Mbuul kɛn a yɛ onse Yelusalem ŋã, wɛn k'ayɛɛ ãndɔɔ m'ãbwel m'ãtsoo mã wɛ!»<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yeso obveel ndiri: «Omɔ̃ ãndɔɔ ãmã?» Bɔ abveel ndɛ bubu: «Ãndɔɔ m'ãtal Yeso wa Nadzalet. Ndɛ áli ɔ̃liaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã wu ɔ̃nɛn m'ãyɛɛn y'ɛ̃sal ɛ̃ ndɛ ke mviil ã Nziã ye mã baal bueel. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Kɛn amfam b'angaa-a-Nziã y'amfam a bia-byɛ bakyɛ atiɔ ndɛ, kwɛn awa ndɛ etumbu ki epfu, bvool abɛɛl ndɛ m'enkulusu. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Bee éketa kaã wɛn owɛɛl ndɛ mbuul wu akaapaal Isalayel m'onkyal. Kɛn a nonɔ̃ bu eyii tsoo li ãtyel ke mbee a ŋ'ebwel ãndɔɔ omɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Kɛn akaal ke kwɛ ba nkel a bee, asuul bee ebɔɔ e nsie edziɔɔn. Bɔ ayɛn mpiɛɛn epal-epal kwɔɔl, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />bɔ k'amwɛn ebiĩ e ndɛ wɛ. Ŋ'eyebvool bɔ, bɔ alieel bee ndiri bɔ amwɛn ãnzwel ã Nziã ãpal ola bɔ, bu ãlieel bɔ ndiri Yeso oli mwiĩ. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Obobɔ, baal ke kwɛ onse nkel a bee ayɛn mpiɛɛn hɛ̃, bɔ amwɛn ãndɔɔ mbueel kɛn a m'emfa ki eyɛɛn akaal. Kɛn a ndyam wu Yeso, bɔ k'amwɛn ndɛ wɛ.»<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yeso bu alieel bɔ bubu: «Yɛɛ-ndɔɔ, baal b'aywɛn ãyal! Eli ye fool kwɛn byɛ ekiool m'eyɛɛn aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Mãsia ale k'akaamwɛn fool li obobɔ wɛ, m'osam o ndɛ onse omfam o ndɛ?» <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Oŋɔ̃ obɔ, Yeso otsɛɛl bɔ ãndɔɔ m'áyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a ndɛ onse Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã wueel. Ndɛ obɛɛn m'ɛ̃nkaan ɛ̃ Moyize, bu ayɛn tiil onse ɛ̃nkaan mvieel mi Aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Ŋ'etɔ bɔ tsotsoo ola b'ékeyi bɔ, Yeso osi empa onge mbuul wu ayi lela. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Kɛn a ayio ange-buaal atɛɛl ndɛ y'ɔ̃tɛɛ̃ wueel ndiri: «Kal kɛn ye bee ŋã! Ke ngwel wɛ, tal emeeyel, tsia oboobva.» Yeso bu asam onse nzɔ me ndɔɔ yi akal ye bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Ŋ'ewel ndɛ mboo m'odza ye bɔ, ndɛ owel mampa, bu abveel Nziã ãtuɛɛn, ke mbee oŋɔ̃ ndɛ otsiil ndɛ, bu awi bɔ. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />M'emfa okyɛ, ayio mviil ãyɔɔl, bɔ bu ayeyɛɛ kwɛn eli Yeso. Kɛn a ndɛ odziɔɔn ke nkwel a bɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Bɔ bu abvi oyɛɛn bam-a-bam ndiri: «Bvoo-mwɛn, esɛ ekeluul ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bia-yɛ, ŋ'ekeyɛɛn ndɛ ye bia-yɛ me nkuul, bvool akesɛɛl bia-yɛ Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã!»<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Bɔ atɛɛn bam nyã kɛn a me lio olɔ, bu akɔɔl Yelusalem. Bɔ ayebɔɔ antam ange-kuun y'ɔ̃mɔ̃ ye bakyɛ bam bueel abvɔɔn mboo ngamɔ̃. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Baal bueel b'ábvɔɔn obɔ ayeyɔɔ ayio ange-buaal y'ãyɛɛn m'ɔ̃nywã ndiri: «Taa-taa bam Mfam amaasiool m'epfu! Ndɛ opal ola Simɔ̃!» <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Ayio ange-buaal hɛ̃ abvi bɔ m'emwɛn bɔ me nkuul oliaal, y'emfa ki eyɛɛ bɔ Yeso me lio li etsiil ndɛ mampa ye bɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso opal ol'ayio a ndɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Ŋ'ebeta bɔ ɔ̃sam ondɛ, Yeso ndyam opal onse bɔ, bu abio bɔ bubu: «Yɔɔl opi okal ye byɛ!» <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ayio ongɛɛ y'etiɔɔl ebɔɔ bɔ bibi. Bɔ áketsam ndiri bɔ ɔ̃kwii ákemwɛn. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Yeso ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Ki etiɔɔl byɛ me buɔ emã? M'emã ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ ɛ̃luul m'enkyam? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Etal mviɔɔl ye ntaã e mɛ̃, wu mpii mɛ̃ ndyam! Ebiɛɛn mɛ̃, bvool etal! Ɔ̃kwii lɔɔ-okal oli ye tuo y'ɛ̃ywee onge b'emwɛn byɛ mɛ̃ ye myɛ̃?»<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Ŋ'ebeyɛɛn ndɛ obobɔ, ndɛ osuo bɔ mviɔɔl ye ntaã e ndɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Onge bɛn ayio k'ákekoo k'akiool kɛn wɛ, me ndɔɔ yɛn bɔ áluul m'esɛ, bvool áli y'ɛ̃kam bibi, Yeso ofuul bɔ ndiri: «Byɛ ŋ'eli ye ki-odza?» <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Bɔ awi ndɛ etswel e nswi ki amaabɛɛl. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Yeso owel etswel e nswi okyɛ, bu adzi kyɛ ke mviil ã bɔ.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, ndɛ oyɛɛn bɔ bubu: «Ŋ'éli mɛ̃ kɛn ye byɛ, mɛ̃ mpii éyɛɛn byɛ wɛn: Ãndɔɔ mam mbueel m'ákel me ndɔɔ a mɛ̃ onse ɛ̃nkaan mi ngel a Moyize, onse ɛ̃nkaan mi Aliaal-ɛ̃kiɛɛn a Nziã, y'ɛ̃nkaan mi Ãnziĩ, ebvaan asa mɔ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Etɔ oŋɔ̃, Yeso odzweel ãyal ã bɔ kwɛn bɔ abɔɔ otsɛn b'ãndɔɔ m'eyɛɛn Ɔ̃nkaan a Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ndɛ bvool olieel bɔ bubu: «Etal m'ákel: Mãsia ebvaan amwɛn fool, kɛn a ndɛ akieel asiool onse b'ákwi-ákwi me tsoo li ãtyel. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Me nkuũ a ndɛ, akieel atee onse ã yam mam mbueel, fa Yelusalem ndiri: Ebvaan kwɛn byɛ ekaal ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ byɛ, me ndɔɔ yi ebɔɔ odzeel b'ãbi ã byɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Byɛ eli baal b'amwɛn ãndɔɔ omɔ̃, bvool èyɛɛn me ndɔɔ a mɔ̃.»<verse eid="LUK 24:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />«Me b'otal mɛ̃, mɛ̃ èyuɔɔl byɛ Ɔ̃fel wu Ɔ̃nsensal wu éwi Taal lɔɔ. Kɛn a me b'otal byɛ, ekal kɛn a ŋã onse bviil li, tiil ye k'eluul byɛ me mpɛn yi efa ola Nziã.»<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oyi o Yeso ywel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ke mbee oŋɔ̃, Yeso obiri ayio sua ola bo Betani. Ndɛ ondɛɛl mviɔɔl ke ywel, bvool ondɔɔl bɔ kuɔɔl. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Me lio li ékendɔɔl ndɛ bɔ kuɔɔl, ndɛ osiil bɔ, bu andɛɛl ndɛ ayɛn ywel ola Nziã. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Kɛn ayio, ke mbee ŋ'ebvi bɔ ãbuo m'olweel o ndɛ, bɔ akɔɔl Yelusalem, ɛ̃kwal ɛ̃ bɔ ɛ̃luul m'esɛ. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Tsoo bwɛn a tsoo, bɔ áli onse Nzɔ a Nziã m'olweel o Nziã.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>